{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1171397-ic-exalted-3e-the-pirates-of-the-gilded-throne","id":1171397,"title":"IC [Exalted 3e] The Pirates of the Gilded Throne","path":["Home","Onyx Path","General","Conventions, Gatherings, and Online Play","Play by Post"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-12-28T18:43:14-08:00","id":1171397,"title":"IC [Exalted 3e] The Pirates of the Gilded Throne","content":"The sun shines high in the sky as you all walk along the cobblestone streets of Flotsam. The mid-morning breeze wafts the air with the scent of the salty oceans all around you, lifting the awnings of the market bazaar, and also shaking the flags strewn across the city, denoting the various nationalities of the owners of the inns and shops across the main thoroughfare. However, this isn't the only spectacle before you; a small crowd has gathered in the square, around a woman tied to a stake. A well-dressed man in a powdered wig, wearing several large hats, is reading off a list of presumable grievances the woman has committed, which the growing crowd is getting agitated at.<br /> <br /> <br /> What will you do?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-28T19:03:40-08:00","id":1171407,"title":"","content":"Intrigued by the spectacle, Diane is going to attempt to make out the man's words without getting too close and get drawn into the situation. <br /> <br /> Diane makes at Perception+Awareness roll and gets 4 successes.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-28T19:10:32-08:00","id":1171412,"title":"","content":"Shining Topaz, clad in Hauberk, walks to the back of the crowd, mildly interested in what crimes the woman is accused of.<br /> <br /> (Per+Awareness= 7d10 -&gt; 3sux)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11917-aranfan","name":"Aranfan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11917_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"503"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-28T19:21:22-08:00","id":1171416,"title":"","content":"Five Lessons Learned frowns as he sees the spectacle. Burning at the stake is gruesome, cruel. What did this woman do to preserve that particular fate? He had a feeling he wouldn't like the awnser. Slipping through the crowds with practiced ease he pushes himself to the front of the crowd, blending in with the rest.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> Though he has the charm I don't think he is using Easily Overlooked Presence here, as his presence will invaribly overlooked easily either way in this kind of situation. Should it be important he got 6 successes on a Manipulation+Larceny roll to blend in. I don't think he'd have to roll awareness from this close, but 4 successes should it be important.<br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1131211-flintys-homebrew-hub-2e\" target=\"_blank\">My Mage 2e Homebrew</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5241-flinty","name":"Flinty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"793"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-28T20:20:29-08:00","id":1171425,"title":"","content":"(Trial scene)<br /> <br /> Lessons isn't noticed as he melts into the crowd. As the self-important man continues his tirade, Topaz and Diane both get an earful of the man as he continues rattling off crimes and transgressions.<br /> <br /> &quot;--Petty theft, public indecency, and trade without a House License. Above all, these, though, her crimes include the intentional and direct sabotage of the Great Lighthouse that lights the way through the rocks of our fair harbor that both guard us from those landlubbers of Prassad, but also doom our ships not blessed by Lord Corvolo himself. How do you plead, Essen Meira?&quot; he demands, pointing his quill accusatively at the woman, who is tied to a stake before him. Getting a closer look, you notice the woman is a fetching lass in her early twenties, with flowing blue curls, which Diane would note, possess brilliant blue circles flowing across her wild stormy mane. Her gown, once most likely quite lovely, has sadly been ripped and ruined quite thoroughly, presumably in her incarceration.<br /> <br /> &quot;Please, Constable, the first three are crimes that many of the ladies here are guilty of. The only thing I've ever stolen were purses that people dropped at the pub, and even then, only those people left for a week. As per public indecency, the only one complaining about what little I offer are old crones who no longer get the happy gazes of young gents. As per trading without a House License, I'd hardly call what I offer, with my minor medicines and herbs to be a legitimate business, unless Goodie Halfmast ought to apply as well for being a midwife as well,&quot; she snaps,&quot; And as for sabotaging the Great Lighthouse, I did no such thing! Yes, I was there when the Constable's men discovered the damage, but I was trying to fend off the real attackers! Why would I, a native of this rock just as much as any of you, defile the Lghthouse? As Cobra is my witness, I swear I did no such thing!&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;See? You see? She swears to a foreign, landlubber god!&quot; The Constable fumes, as Essen tosses her mane irritably.<br /> <br /> &quot;Well, if the Duke and the Tyrant, fat and happy, in Dhaam-Bel, did anything about us here in Flotsam, maybe I wouldn't need to pin my hopes on the WIll of Cobra, then,&quot; she counters.<br /> <br /> &quot;I never! Well, Miss Meira, let's see how you, Cobra, and that damnable General Gorren deliver you from the pain of the Mirror! We, as the rightful and honorable agent of his nobility, the Duke, hereby sentence you, Ezzen Meira, to death by the Mirror,&quot; the constable spits, as a trio of men hoist large mirrors around the young woman.<br /> <br /> &quot;Cobra, Sancutary to us, please,&quot; she whimpers, as the light of the sun is amplified by the mirrors. Already, the temperature and brightness is getting uncomfortable, although the crowd seems to be enjoying the sport of it.<br /> <br /> What will you all do?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1586,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","user":"Dietaku","date":". 12-28-2017, 11:23 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-28T20:27:16-08:00","id":1171427,"title":"","content":"Shining Topaz could run up there, free the woman who seems to have been sentenced to death without so much as a fact finding inquiry, and fight off all the guards.<br /> <br /> Instead she looks away.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11917-aranfan","name":"Aranfan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11917_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"503"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-28T20:33:12-08:00","id":1171430,"title":"","content":"<br /> When the first ray of light shone through the open porthole in Scholar's room, his eyes opened and he swung himself out of bed. He walked to the washing area and splashed water on his hands and face. He then put on his clean clothes, black slacks and white shirt, and made his way to the kitchen to prepare meals for the day. He remembered recipies for poached alimber eggs and bacon. He took his time and seasoned it just perfectly and then cooked a fanastic meal.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> <br /> Cook 1 + Intelligence 5 + Solar Craft Excellency 4 = 10 Dice using 4 motes 7 successes<br /> <br /> <br /> </div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> He then went to his quartermaster office to prepare to take orders for crew repairs. He always liked to be ready. When that was done, he went to the dining area and met most of the crew. He saw a server hand out the food he made, and got a plate for himself. He ate, and then went back to the quartermasters to deal with repairs. He repaired Angor's sword with his hands alone. He went on to fold and press cloth together to make clothes for Goron and Dalken as the two brothers got into a fight and shredded their last set of clothes. He also removed a dent in Dalken's armor from the last privateering mission.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> <br /> sword craft weaponsmith 5 + Intelligence 5 = 10 Dice 8 successes!<br /> 7 10 9 9 4 8 2 8 4 8<br /> <br /> Clothes craft clothes 1 + Intelligence 5 +4 motes 10 Dice 5 successes!<br /> 4 7 10 2 10 5 5 1 3 5<br /> <br /> Armor craft armor 1 + Intelligence 5 + 4 motes 10 Dice 6 successes!<br /> 6 9 5 1 5 9 8 8 10 4<br /> <br /> </div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> It was quickly approaching mid morning. He had planned to perform an elemental summoning of a Tidemare, but he put it off. Captain Laughter would be putting into Flotsam and it would be a good idea to pick up supplies. He went back to his stores, in the cargo hold next to his warstrider Blood Venture, and quickly crafted four swords and two pieces of armor. He gives these to Laughter to sell for him. He strives for Exceptional Quality items. He also creates five golden figurines with gold from his stores. 3 sets of lockpicks and gives one out to the Night Caste and the others to Laughter to sell for him. He then goes to check out Flotsam.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> <br /> golden figurines craft artifact (creating a non magical artifact with gold if its ok) 5 + Intelligence 5 + 5 motes 15 Dice 6 successes!<br /> 4 8 5 9 7 6 2 6 9 9 7 1 4 5 3<br /> <br /> Lockpicks craft artifact (Non magical) 5 + Intelligence 5 + 5 motes 15 Dice 6 successes!<br /> 4 3 9 3 10 3 9 8 2 9 5 4 2 2 6<br /> <br /> </div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> While shopping for raw materials and ingredients he comes upon the woman tied to the stake. He almost misses the scene as he is somewhat myopic. He focuses on one thing at a time and misses a lot. Curious he walks in close listening to the girl's charges.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7592-wtaylorjr2001","name":"wtaylorjr2001","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"261"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-28T20:42:05-08:00","id":1171433,"title":"","content":"Laughter pushes his way through the front of the crowd, listening to the tale with a keen ear (activating Motive Discerning Technique to see if she's full of shit. If she is, she can burn for all he cares. The destruction of a lighthouse will get many a man killed. If not then turning on Thousand Courtesan Ways for more app and: )<br /> <br /> &quot;Oi! Magistrate! How much for the slave?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4017-angryicecream","name":"angryicecream","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-28T20:50:52-08:00","id":1171437,"title":"","content":"Alright, I'm going to make an Introduce Fact roll to declare that Corvolo, King of Whales, is against executions. I assume that Diane having Corvolo as a mentor counts as &quot;relevant backstory&quot; Rolling my Int+Lore of 6, I get 3 sux.<br /> <br /> Assuming that is sufficient, Diane will speak up, saying, &quot;Wait! You must stop this travesty! You who claim to hold faith with Lord Corvolo do not follow his guidance, for did he not say, 'Do not kill, even for the greatest of crimes; instead, have those who falter work to atone for their crimes, for Lo, I say unto you; There is a tide to every porpoise under heaven!' &quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-28T20:53:36-08:00","id":1171438,"title":"","content":"6 successes spent 3 motes on Excellency for MDT","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4017-angryicecream","name":"angryicecream","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-28T20:54:33-08:00","id":1171439,"title":"","content":"(Scholar)<br /> <br /> Scholar is quite the industrious quartermaster. He succeeds in his repair and crafting work, before going about his business. He succeeds in his errands, just in time to see Laughter begin haggling with the Constable.<br /> <br /> (Trial Scene)<br /> <br /> The Constable looks at the garish captain incredulously, before regaining his composure, and flatly stating, &quot;Her crimes are quite grievous. Her asking price will not be cheap. However, if you can afford it, then, her crimes will be forgiven. The price for her is...Oh, Jenkins?&quot;<br /> <br /> A tall, angular-faced man in an impeccable buttoned uniform steps forward, looking over several vellum scripts, before raising a haughty nose,&quot; The asking price as set down by the Tyrant for Captial Criminals is two talents silver, or equivalent goods.&quot;<br /> <br /> The Constable turns back to Laughter,&quot; You heard the man. If you want her, gods knows why, then pay the price.&quot;<br /> <br /> (That amounts to a resources 2 expenditure, by the by)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-28T21:00:13-08:00","id":1171440,"title":"","content":"Scholar watches the woman speak, and he watches Laughter do what he had planned to do. He smiles and goes ahead with his plan. He walks up to the Constable and pulls out his golden figurines that he created that very morning. It's exceptional quality, for all of them should be obvious to all who look upon them. <br /> <br /> &quot;I would like to buy this woman. If you are only going to kill her, she is worthless to you. I will give you one of these for her,&quot; say's Scholar.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7592-wtaylorjr2001","name":"wtaylorjr2001","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"261"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-28T21:03:04-08:00","id":1171441,"title":"","content":"&quot;Ha! For that old maid? Just looking to give my crew something to entertain themselves with for a few weeks of travel. (Thus emphasizing her fate is going to _suck_) I'll give you one talent and save you some fire wood.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4017-angryicecream","name":"angryicecream","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-28T21:08:29-08:00","id":1171443,"title":"","content":"(Trial Scene)<br /> <br /> The Constable blinks at this increased interruption of a perfectly good public execution.<br /> <br /> &quot;Yes, Lord Corvolo may be against executions, but is not the porpoise who swims against the pack eaten by bear sharks? There are tides to every porpoise under Heaven, and while Lord Corvolo is a great god indeed, the Nation Father of Dhaam-Bel is Lord Aulus himself, one of the great trade gods of the East!&quot; <br /> <br /> The Constable then lazily waves to a small statue of a stern young man with scales in one hand and a pouch of coins in the other, with the placard declaring, :The Rule of Coin is Law.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;And while I do enjoy discussing theology, now isn;t really the best time, young lady, so if you don't mind, we shall continue the execution,&quot; he says, waving at his subordinates as they keep the mirrors aloft. Essen is now looking quite unwell, and small tufts of smoke can be seen wafting up from the stake.<br /> <br /> (As per the Constable's intentions, he has a clear intimacy of fondness for Public Order, and a clear disdain for real and perceived vagrants, of which this woman is clearly one in his mind. He also has a very real nationalistic Zeal towards Dhaam-Bel and the Duke, which may be why such a single-minded man is in such a high level of authority. Judging from his intense gaze, he also may very well have fondness for the prisoner herself, although the rings on his left hand may suggest this is a forbidden longing, dare we say? Further information would require more focused questioning.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-28T21:15:49-08:00","id":1171444,"title":"","content":"&quot;Hey Constable. Don't damage the goods while that guy is trying to buy her. 's bad buisness.&quot; Lessons shouts. &quot;Tyrant doesn't like it when someone ruins his payday.&quot; he says with a pointed look toward the mirrors.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Using Seasoned Criminal Method to look like he belongs here. Guess the constable himself may not count as a criminal, but this place sounds like its awash with them, so most of the people around him probably think he looks familiar/is part of the crew etc. </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1131211-flintys-homebrew-hub-2e\" target=\"_blank\">My Mage 2e Homebrew</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5241-flinty","name":"Flinty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"793"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-28T21:16:19-08:00","id":1171445,"title":"","content":"(Meant to use MDT on the woman not the constable but that works too)<br /> <br /> &quot;Pah. What kind of servant of a trade god has hard prices for anything. Fine, fine. I'll pay your talents.&quot; He grumbles, taking a swig from his flask and thinking of how best to get his money back from this outrageous pricing. Disgusting, really. Well, the constable obviously cares for the woman. Maybe a private conversation after this shit show will smooth things over for his poor wallet.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4017,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4017-angryicecream","user":"angryicecream","date":". 12-29-2017, 12:23 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4017-angryicecream","name":"angryicecream","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-28T21:25:29-08:00","id":1171446,"title":"","content":"Scholar stands in front of the Constable and patiently awaits his answer considering a golden figurine, exceptionally made, for the girl. The figurine should be more than 2 talents. He looks at the girl as the flames heat up and thinks he will have to get the ingredients for a burn cream. He says, &quot;you can sell me the woman or the good captain the woman, but as was asked, please put out the fire that is burning the merchandise.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7592-wtaylorjr2001","name":"wtaylorjr2001","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"261"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-28T21:36:57-08:00","id":1171447,"title":"","content":"Laughter just looks at his associate trying to innocently save the woman's life and *entirely ruining his plans*. He stares for a brief moment before roaring in the angriest sea captain's bellow a man's ever heard &quot;BOY, GET GONE FROM 'ERE 'FORE I TEAR YOUR HIDE. I'M TRYIN' TO NEGOTIATE WITH THE GENTLEMAN.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4017,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4017-angryicecream","user":"angryicecream","date":". 12-29-2017, 12:54 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4017-angryicecream","name":"angryicecream","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-28T21:42:23-08:00","id":1171449,"title":"","content":"Scholar frowns, looks to the girl and says, &quot;She is burning, have him stop the execution as you speak.&quot; With that, Scholar walks away from them and keeps an eye on the girl. He suddenly turns back towards Laughter and screams, &quot;DON&quot;T LET HER DIE!&quot; And then, &quot;DON&quot;T CALL ME BOY!&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7592-wtaylorjr2001","name":"wtaylorjr2001","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"261"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-28T22:00:18-08:00","id":1171452,"title":"","content":"Well, just letting him walk away, tossing two talents up to the constable and leering at the woman. &quot;Let's ave er then, ye? An quickly 'fore you burn that pretty skin.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4017-angryicecream","name":"angryicecream","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-28T22:18:01-08:00","id":1171456,"title":"","content":"Scholar, after he sees Laughter toss the talents approaches Laughter and says, &quot;I'll reimburse you for what you lost and give you a bit more for a profit for you.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":7592,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7592-wtaylorjr2001","user":"wtaylorjr2001","date":". 12-29-2017, 01:25 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7592-wtaylorjr2001","name":"wtaylorjr2001","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"261"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-28T22:20:53-08:00","id":1171457,"title":"","content":"He mostly ignores him, only shooting him a glance leading away from here trying to communicate &quot;You need to leave&quot; non verbally","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4017,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4017-angryicecream","user":"angryicecream","date":". 12-29-2017, 01:30 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4017-angryicecream","name":"angryicecream","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-28T22:35:05-08:00","id":1171460,"title":"","content":"Scholar melts back into the crowd. He hangs around and watches what unfolds.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7592-wtaylorjr2001","name":"wtaylorjr2001","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"261"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-28T22:39:43-08:00","id":1171462,"title":"","content":"(Trial scene)<br /> <br /> (Ah, whoops. Well, then. Here's one on me for misunderstanding. Essen Meira, the woman in question, isn't lying, or at least she doesn't think so. As far as she's concerned, she's innocent of her accused crimes. She also has a zealous streak in her, but not towards Flotsam, as the Constable does, but for a &quot;Will of Cobra,&quot; whatever that is. Something else that stands out, is, despite her whimpering, something in your gut tells you she's not nearly as worried as someone in her position ought to be...)<br /> <br /> The Constable looks at Laughter, then to Scholar, then back to Laughter, before pocketing the coins and nodding to his manservant. He then sighs, waving at the men holding the mirrors and directing them away. As the crowd grumbles, the Constable nods to his men once more as they produce truncheon and billy club and with a few persuading shoves, the crowd disperses.<br /> <br /> &quot; It is not by my will that I free you, but by the laws of this land. Go now,&quot; he turns to Laughter,&quot; She is in your care now, Ser, but tread lightly. The Tyrant does not suffer recidivists lightly.&quot;<br /> <br /> The Constable's men untie Essen and shove her towards Laughter, as she scowls at them before directing her relieved gaze to her savior. Despite being pink in the face, her quick dust-off of her gown belies the mortal peril she was just in.<br /> <br /> &quot;Well, this is a surprise. To be bought by a dashing captain, ready to sweep me off my feet, eh? Well, Ser Moneybags, I suppose, I must be polite and congenial to my new master,&quot; she curtsies with a flourush,&quot; I am Essen Meira, 20 summers of age. I am a serving girl by trade, but I can cook, clean, and sew as needed. I can also cast line and net with the best of them, as my Da' is a fisherman. I... Do not have experience in the other work of a lady, despite whatever the Constable lied about me, but.. if that is what you ask, know i will do my best. Also know I will not suffer being taken lightly, as my bite is far worse than my bark.&quot;<br /> <br /> As the crowd disperses, Jenkins looks over Scholar's figurine and states,&quot; This is fine work. A shame you band with that lot,&quot; as his burning gaze shoots to Laughter and Essen. He hands Scholar a small parchment before walking briskly off.<br /> <br /> Indeed, the only one who seemed to remain unscathed from the Constable and his men's wrath was Lessons, who found quite a warm welcome among a gang of fishermen, who even offered him a pint of warm grog for their new friend. Diane also is offered a seat, as she sidles over to the gathering.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1586,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","user":"Dietaku","date":". 12-29-2017, 01:58 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-28T23:02:24-08:00","id":1171466,"title":"","content":"Scholar looks at the parchment, oblivious to the actions of the crowd. It is evident that the young brown skinned, black haired man is completely entranced by what is on the parchment.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7592-wtaylorjr2001","name":"wtaylorjr2001","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"261"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-28T23:06:54-08:00","id":1171468,"title":"","content":"&quot;Ah! Spirit! This'll be fun, me thinks.&quot; He says with a lewd grin, guiding her the hell out of here with enough force to make it clear it's not a choice but gentle enough to not damage the goods before their time. One must put on a good show for the observers who set all this up. Or at least make an attwmpt to salvage what left of his scheme he can","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4017-angryicecream","name":"angryicecream","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-28T23:17:09-08:00","id":1171470,"title":"","content":"Seeing that everything seems to have worked out, if with a few kinks, Lessons joins his new 'friends'.<br /> &quot;Guy must've got lots a money, way he throws it 'round.&quot; one of the fishermen remarks.<br /> &quot;Maybe I ought to try and sell 'im my wife then, ey?&quot; Lessons jokes, cueing a bit of bawdy laughter.<br /> &quot;Anyone knows which ship that rich guy's from?&quot;<br /> Lessons turns a bit sober. &quot;Aye the Maidens' Passing . But I'd stay away if I were you. Heard some stories about the guy. Horny as if Venus was his mommy, but got some huge stones, it's said. Good with a blade aswell. Heard he once got jumped by a pirate and by the end of it he'd had them pay a talent for everyone of the poor bastards who was still alive. Only they were three short so he had the rest jump the plank.&quot;<br /> <br /> They settle down in the nearest alehouse. &quot;So anyone know what that whole Cobra nonsense and sabotage and what not was about?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1131211-flintys-homebrew-hub-2e\" target=\"_blank\">My Mage 2e Homebrew</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5241-flinty","name":"Flinty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"793"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-29T07:12:05-08:00","id":1171527,"title":"","content":"Scholar)<br /> <br /> The note reads,&quot; Meet me at the Duke's estate at noon. I have a business proposition for you.<br /> <br /> --Hieronymous Glavanz Jenkins&quot;<br /> <br /> Well, that's a thing.<br /> <br /> (Laughter)<br /> <br /> &quot;So direct~. Mister Captain, we barely know each other,&quot; Essen titters, playing along. She follows Laughter to wherever it is he's planning to further his schemes.<br /> <br /> (Lessons)<br /> <br /> At Lessons question, the fishermen turn sober, looking to each other, before returning their gaze to Lessons.<br /> <br /> &quot;The Constable's men say lil' Essen did break the Lighthouse. I don't know why or how she'd do it. Her Dad is one of me best mates, and I've known her since she was a guppy; she' d never do anything like that.... Well, until she went overseas. See, her Ma has family landside, and she went to visit them. She left for two years. She said she got lost, went to the Summer Mountains or summat, but when she came back, that's when all this 'Cobra' nonsense happened with her,&quot; one of their number states. When asked about it, most wave it off, all save one. A nervous man, his eyes darting this way and that, speaks up.<br /> <br /> &quot;You're not from round here, are ya? The Will of Cobra is the one thing stopping those damnable Realm tosspots from clapping us all in chains. Cobra was a powerful heroine once, they say. She had the powers of the moon and the might of a thousand spears at her call. Outer Sanctuary was her homeland, and she blessed it to always be a place of free spirits. General Gorren leads it now, and all across the Dreaming Sea, those who oppose the Realm join them,&quot; he says.<br /> <br /> &quot; Or die horribly. Take it from me, friend, Outer Sanctuary and the Will of Cobra are fables meant to lure fools to an early death,&quot; the first fisherman warns<br /> <br /> Well now, what will you do?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1586,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","user":"Dietaku","date":". 12-29-2017, 12:05 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-29T09:33:07-08:00","id":1171546,"title":"","content":"Lessons takes a deep sip from his jug, the grog burning down his throat. &quot;So what? They some kind of pirates that call themselves freedomfighters? Impose a freedom tax on merchants aswell, eh?&quot; He eyes the nervous man suspiciously.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1131211-flintys-homebrew-hub-2e\" target=\"_blank\">My Mage 2e Homebrew</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5241-flinty","name":"Flinty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"793"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-29T10:19:29-08:00","id":1171559,"title":"","content":"Just heading back to the ship for now, when they get inside the cabin he hands her one of his cloaks to cover herself with, should she so choose, and flops down in a rather ornately carved chair, lighting a lantern adjacent to his desk. Maps clutter the walls, most of them tracking storm patterns, merchant routes, the scattered remains of the Terek navy, Parad's fleet, as well as would hunt activity. Don't think she'd know what they tracked since there's not really a legend to identify them but maybe she has some unique insights. Otherwise, the room is rather well taken care of, with a proper, if small, bed in the corner and some sailing implements seated comfortably on his desk. He takes another swig from his flask &quot;Gonna beat that boy silly some day if 'e doesnt learn to hold his blasted tongue.&quot; Turning his attention back to Essen &quot;Cost me a pretty penny, you did, girl. Who'd you piss off that they'd put you on the fryer?&quot; <br /> <br /> Technically Ship Claiming Stance is on, which takes a 1 die penalty from non crew actions. She was invited/taken on board but def not crew. So, not sure how that would effect her.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4017,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4017-angryicecream","user":"angryicecream","date":". 12-29-2017, 01:42 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4017-angryicecream","name":"angryicecream","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-29T13:29:43-08:00","id":1171612,"title":"","content":"Scholar looks at the address and finds the first person who will tell him how to get there. It is a little before noon so he takes his time. There is an issue on his mind, how will he get the raw materials, precious metals and gems, to craft his repairs. And his sister. He missed his little sister who was stolen by the Fae. He needed a way to track her. It has been several weeks since Alabaster and where was she, how was she. The Fae would rue the day they took her from him. Ever since his parents were killed and he became an orphan, he took care of his little sister. He felt he let her down.<br /> <br /> Enough of this sad thought. In order to survive in the Wyld, he needed his Colossus to provide protection. He needed to fix it and develop the skill to drive it. To fix it required a fortune in metals and gems. He considered. His knowledge of Occult is what served him as he wandered through the streets searching for the Duke's Estate. He needed a series of Elementals. He needed an earth elemental that could travel through the earth and find gems and metals. He needed a few of them. He did not know how long he would be here, he needed the captain's trade route. He would have earth elementals find the precious raw materials, and water elementals that could track him somehow.<br /> <br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> <br /> Occult 5 + Intelligence 5 + 5 motes to know about two elementals, a water elemental that could track him through the seas, and an earth elemental that could find and mine gems and metals.<br /> <br /> Earth Elemental 15 Dice 8 successes!<br /> 9 1 8 3 3 7 2 7 10 6 8 8 1 4 6<br /> <br /> Water Elemental 15 Dice 7 successes!<br /> 5 10 6 6 4 9 2 9 8 3 2 2 10 1 5<br /> <br /> He is left with 13 peripheral and 3 personal motes, he does not want his anima flaring.<br /> <br /> </div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <br /> He considered various elementals he knew about from his studies in the little gods and elementals. People unknown to him stared at him as he walked through the streets talking to himself. He was oblivious to his surroundings. He wore his cloak and breastplate and leather pants, all black. His cloak had a silver clasp. He didn't notice a pair of men who could be following him. He did not notice anything save the addresses he was passing and the thoughts of elemental types he could summon. A water elemental that could track him through the water, and an earth elemental who could find raw material. And then he saw his destination, the Duke's house.<br /> <br /> He walked to the Dukes house and knocked on the gate getting the attention of the guard protecting the house. He asked, &quot;I was invited here to meet Mr. Jenkins,&quot; and he showed the guard the note.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":7592,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7592-wtaylorjr2001","user":"wtaylorjr2001","date":". 12-29-2017, 04:44 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7592-wtaylorjr2001","name":"wtaylorjr2001","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"261"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-29T16:47:49-08:00","id":1171670,"title":"","content":"Shining Topaz guards the room her captain is speaking with Essen in. She's a shout away.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11917-aranfan","name":"Aranfan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11917_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"503"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-29T20:34:22-08:00","id":1171704,"title":"","content":"(Fishermen)<br /> <br /> &quot;It's so much more than that, Ser. It's like....You're thinking much too small. It's not just a pirate crew, but rather like an entire nation of pirates. They extend across the Dreaming Sea and the Southeast, seeking different things, but united in their common goal to throw off the shackles of the Realm and unite under a Deliberate form of rule. General Gorren is the closest to this goal, so close, they say to doing so, &quot; the nervous fisherman says, as his friend laughs.<br /> <br /> &quot;Yes, and you know whatever happens when a Hero of Outer Sanctuary comes close to winning their prize? A Celestial Magistrate comes down from Heaven, and snuffs out their ambition. First, they stole Cobra away, then they slew Massive Manager. I don't have high hopes for Gorren at this rate, Bert,&quot; he says, as Bert frowns.<br /> <br /> &quot;Says you, Tom,&quot; was all Bert could say.<br /> <br /> &quot;Still, if you want pirates who ARE interested in this claptrap, I'd suggest you seek out the Cobalt Claws, friend, or don't...Their Captains are an...odd lot,&quot; Tom continued, and the revelry continued.<br /> <br /> What will you do now?<br /> <br /> (Shipside)<br /> <br /> Essen blinks at Laughter's question, before answering,&quot; I angered the Constable's wife, for one. She's had it out for me ever since I got back from my voyage overseas, and the Constable noticed I was a lady and not just some pup in a dress. Still, if you;re asking why the execution, that was a misunderstanding. I've taken it upon myself to act as a guardian of this place, and I noticed some rather...unsavory fellows making motions towards the lighthouse, one of the great features of Flotsam since there's been a Flotsam, and sure enough, I found them skulking around. In the ensuing scuffle, they took the heart of the Great Lighthouse, and ran off. Unfortunately, they also set up some explosives, nothing large, mind, which alerted the Constable and his men, and they found me out for the count, the sole survivor remaining that knew anything. Of course, they didn't believe me, and the Constable's wife was all the happier to ply his ear and see me burn, no doubt. And that,&quot; Essen says, crossing her arms,&quot; is that. Would it be possible for me to have something to drink? I'm parched. Of course, if it pleases you, Master&quot;<br /> <br /> Essen curtsies once more to emphasize her point.<br /> <br /> (Duchal Estates)<br /> <br /> Scholar is ushered into a large salon, whereupon, he sees Jenkins sitting at a large table surrounded by parchments of all types.<br /> <br /> &quot;Ah, you're here on time. Excellent. I cannot abide by tardiness. Still, it does you credit. in any case, sit, sit, we have much to discuss. I suppose the best place to start is to introduce myself. As you know, I am Hieronymus Jenkins, but you may not know I am the Agent Plenipotentiary of the Tyrant here. I have been assisting the Duke, but sadly, the Duke, like much of his kin, are incompetent to the bone in terms of governance. Alas, if only Lord Joshua Von Rogan was still among the living, he'd sort this all out. However, that is not why I asked you here today. I saw that you are a man of artistry and grace, and the Von Rogans, the Family of Tyrants of Dhaam-Bel, have long sponsored the arts. I wish to commission you to make a statue of the Lord Duke. And not just any statue. I want a colossus that we can set up in the town square, made of the finest wave marble. If you can succeed in this task, not only can I provide you and your allies with a letter of marque, but you will be personally, handsomely rewarded. Well, young man? What do you say?&quot; he asks, looking up at Scholar expectantly.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-29T20:47:45-08:00","id":1171709,"title":"","content":"Diane keeps her self and Lessons in drinks while listening to the fishermen's conversation, musing on the strange situation that seems to be unfolding. Finally she speaks up, &quot;What's so important about this lighthouse? And who would have reason to destroy it?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-29T20:49:37-08:00","id":1171711,"title":"","content":"&quot;Wait. Celestial what now? Sounds important. You tellin' me these Cobra guys are pissing the gods themselves off?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1131211-flintys-homebrew-hub-2e\" target=\"_blank\">My Mage 2e Homebrew</a>","edited":{"userid":5241,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5241-flinty","user":"Flinty","date":". 12-29-2017, 11:55 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5241-flinty","name":"Flinty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"793"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-29T20:56:00-08:00","id":1171715,"title":"","content":"&quot;Ah. Course. Where are me manners,&quot; he says, reaching behind him to pull a cask of wine from behind him and a glass from the ceiling (basically held up by innately carved holes in the ceiling) and pours her a glass. &quot;Why'd a tiny thing like yourself choose to get in a scuffle in the first place? Why not scream for the guards? You one of them godbloods?&quot; He doesn't seem particularly bothered by the notion.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4017-angryicecream","name":"angryicecream","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-29T21:00:49-08:00","id":1171716,"title":"","content":"Scholar of the Golden Owl listened as Jenkins spoke. When he heard the possibility of rewards his eyes widened. A letter of Marque would be a good thing to have. Scholar nodded. He would need to see the Duke. He would need the marble. He would need a time when the square was cleared so he could work unimpeded. If these were taken care of he would definitely do this. <br /> <br /> &quot;I would take your offer under the following conditions. First I would like to speak to the Duke. To capture his visage, his essence, I need to know a bit of him. I would not take much of his time, but I would need to know him. Second I would need the marble. I have none in my stores and I don't have the capability at this time of buying it. Lastly I would need the square cleared for a few hours. As long as I am given these things it would be my honor to grant you your request.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7592-wtaylorjr2001","name":"wtaylorjr2001","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"261"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-29T21:11:48-08:00","id":1171720,"title":"","content":"(Fishermen)<br /> <br /> &quot;Aye, lassie. The lighthouse is like the liver of out fine harbor, for without it, we can't live. It lights the safe paths through the shoals, and the only vessels that can pass through otherwise are those blessed by Lord Corvolo himself. Sad to say, the Lord of Whales is a shy sort, and he doesn't hand out such hulls willy-milly,&quot; Bert says, taking naother quaff of his drink,&quot; At this rate, Lord Aulus may need to provide another Heart, or Dhaam-Bel will wait till we all starve and send another gang of poor colonists to keep this place afloat.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Hm? Anger the gods? Well, not that I know of. We all pray on the low holidays and everything. You don't get to be a sailor for long otherwise. No, these blokes were foreigners; no one I've ever heard of from what the stories say. Plus, they spoke in an odd language no one had ever heard. The gods round here have the common decency to speak in proper Rivertongue, andnot in whatever strange language they were speaking. Still, these chaps stole Joyous Cobra herself up to heaven, and rained fire and death upon Massive Manager. I'd bet a sesterce that the same will happen to Gorren,&quot; Tom grins, as Bert scowls at him.<br /> <br /> \u200b(Laughter) <br /> <br /> &quot;You...You could say I'm blooded by the gods. I don't like to fight, but Flotsam is my home and the lighthouse is our lifeblood. If I needed to shed my blood, then that would be the time to do it,&quot; she said, graciously accepting the glass, before downing it in one pull. Clearly, despite her unimposing stature, she was no stranger to spirits,&quot; That's a good vintage. In any case, wouldn't you agree, Master?&quot;<br /> <br /> (Scholar)<br /> <br /> &quot;The first and third requests are easily done,&quot; Jenkins stated,&quot; The marble, however, you will need to procure. Wave marble is almost impossible to find, let alone purchase, but it is strong, sturdy stuff that is quite beauteous, especially when handled by a master, presumably like yourself. Here,&quot; Jenkins hands Scholar a sea map, which contains Flotsam, the surrounding islands, Dhaam-Bel, and off to one corner, Agricola Isle.<br /> <br /> &quot;That island there, Agricola, is the closest source of wave marble. Consider this your trial, of sorts,for our sponsorship. Collect as much as you feel appropriate, and bring it back here. When you do so, you will have as much time as you need with the Duke and with the town square.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-29T21:21:37-08:00","id":1171723,"title":"","content":"&quot;A fine vintage, indeed,&quot; he says, looking her over as he pours himself a glass and fills hers up again. &quot;You didn't particularly expect to die beneath the glare of them mirrors, did ye?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4017-angryicecream","name":"angryicecream","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-29T21:26:31-08:00","id":1171726,"title":"","content":"&quot;Ugh Bugger me, nothings ever easy, is it?&quot;, Lesson says shaking his head. In his head his thoughts are racing. These Cobra followers seem interesting. And with a little persuasion, perhaps, they would shift their sights to other opressors than just the realm. Such as a water dragon holding a city in its chokehold that could well be a stronghold of theirs? He'd have to ask this Essen lad about them, but the sailors seemed to know precious little about them aside from stories. Switching gears he takes a new jug from Diane with a nod of gratitude and joins in on her conversation. &quot;So who hates this place enough to damn it straight to Malfeas then?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1131211-flintys-homebrew-hub-2e\" target=\"_blank\">My Mage 2e Homebrew</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5241-flinty","name":"Flinty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"793"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-29T21:37:06-08:00","id":1171729,"title":"","content":"<br /> Scholar nodded thinking that this was something he could do. He got up close and looked at the map and took the time to memorize it. This was easily done. This island, Agricola was an interesting looking place. He knew nothing of it. That was the first thing to be remedied.<br /> <br /> &quot;Tell me Mr. Jenkins, what do you know of Agricola? Is it owned by a nation? What are the indigenous lifeforms? What can you tell me about this place?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7592-wtaylorjr2001","name":"wtaylorjr2001","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"261"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-29T22:04:28-08:00","id":1171731,"title":"","content":"(Shipside)<br /> <br /> Essen blushes at Laughter's question, &quot; Ser Captain, if you're asking for all my secrets, well, you'll have to pry a little harder than that...However, since you did pay so much for me, then, I suppose I can answer that. I felt absolutely no danger from that heat. Although, you have to admit that that was a good show, right? My mom always said I would make an excellent actress. Now, since I'm in a good mood, is there anything else you wish to know about me?&quot;<br /> <br /> (Scholar)<br /> <br /> &quot;Agricola Island is a temperate island, home to no major human settlements. It has similar climate and fauna to Flotsam here, although, because of the larger landmass, you'll see anything from wild pigs, to sun-bears and other small predators. Nothing too dangerous. There is also a quite ancient shrine to Paisap upon the island. Please, do not, for the love of all that is good disturb it. However, since that is nowhere near where the wave marble is, I trust you can do so. Now, is there anything else I can do for you?&quot; Jenkins asked, tapping the map.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-29T22:13:33-08:00","id":1171732,"title":"","content":"(Fishermen)<br /> <br /> &quot;Who's to say? There's as many people who hate this rock as those who love it. Heck, many of the posh gents and dames in Dhaam-Bel send their children they're ashamed of here as punishment. They seem to be under the mistaken impression we're a bunch of &quot;layabouts,&quot; Bert says, as Tom nods.<br /> <br /> &quot;I saws it, I did. The girl is right,&quot; an ancient mariner, nearly as craggy as the bench he sits on, says, speaking up. You could be forgiven for thinking him part of the furniture for how quiet he has been,&quot; It was the Dark Wulf of the Depths, it was. The Fell Lord of those what died at Sea. He comes by on a ship with no sails, powered by the doldrums themselves. He's the one what killed the lighthouse's light.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Oh, pish-posh, Old Joe, don't scare the kids with ghost stories. the Dark Wulf ain't real,&quot; Tom laughs, as the elder mariner grumbles.<br /> <br /> &quot;He too be real. I swear on Lord Corvolo's fin, I saw his ship not two weeks ago. All aflame with black ash and death. Then, it was gone,&quot; the old man said, before sitting back down, silent once more.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-29T22:26:51-08:00","id":1171733,"title":"","content":"&quot;Aye, I do have another question&quot; he says, leaning forward with a grin, &quot;Do ye really want me to try n pry into yer secrets?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4017-angryicecream","name":"angryicecream","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-29T22:44:59-08:00","id":1171735,"title":"","content":"Doublechecking that he knew were the wave marble was, he said, &quot;No I don't think I need anything else. I will go and get the marble.&quot; With that he politely took his leave. After leaving the Duke's mansion he walked to the coast. Everything was blurry in the distance, he couldn't see well. His eyes were bad, as was his hearing. He had a choice. He could go back to the ship or he could go to Agricola. It could be very simple and easy to summon a tidemare and go get the wave marble. Then again, a Tidemare could not carry the needed amount of wave marble. He would need a larger Elemental. <br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> <br /> Introduce the fact that a Thanor was a huge aquatic creature that could carry enough wave marble for 2 or more statues of the desired size.<br /> Lore 5 + Intelligence 5 + motes 3 = 13 Dice <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7592-wtaylorjr2001\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"7592\" data-vbnamecard=\"7592\">wtaylorjr2001</a>, you rolled 1,2,4,5,5,6,6,6,7,7,8,8,8 for a total of 5 successes<br /> <br /> It was an elemental of the terrestrial circle similar to the tidemare save this was a workhorse that couldn't carry people in its belly. It carried things on its back. it was huge. He could not ride it, it swam underwater, but he could call it as well as a tidemare.<br /> <br /> </div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> He was by the coast, thinking. He could go to the ship, or he could go directly to Agricola. What would he do?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7592-wtaylorjr2001","name":"wtaylorjr2001","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"261"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-29T22:45:48-08:00","id":1171736,"title":"","content":"(Shipside)<br /> <br /> Essen smiles, looking up at the wolfish captain,&quot; You did pay for me, and if you ask as a gentleman, Master, then, I may very well. However, remember, my bite can kill,&quot;<br /> <br /> Essen leans in, and embraces her master. However, whatever jubilation at his apparent stickball home run is cut short when he looks down and realizes that instead of regular limbs holding him, there is a mass of blue-ringed tentacles holding him gently.<br /> <br /> Oooooooooh, dear. What will our intrepid captain do now?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-29T22:52:09-08:00","id":1171737,"title":"","content":"(Scholar)<br /> <br /> Scholar's kowledge prove true. The Thanor would serve his purposes quite well indeed.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1586,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","user":"Dietaku","date":".  Edited because I failed at reading comprehension.... 12-30-2017, 02:31 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-29T22:53:59-08:00","id":1171738,"title":"","content":"&quot;Really? Where did you see it, and what's it's heading?&quot; Diane asks Old Joe, retrieving a fresh drink for the old man. While she may not be the most adept socialite in the world, Diane knows one thing; If Joe's anything like any of the Vicruith or Novaleksi men back home, he'll talk for days if a young woman is paying attention and he has a drink in his hand. &quot;It's just that my uncle spent a few years as marine on a Ptreas Trireme when I was little. I always loved his sea-stories, but I've never met anyone that's actually seen a ghost ship...&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-29T23:07:56-08:00","id":1171739,"title":"","content":"(Fishermen)<br /> <br /> &quot;Thank ye, lass. Yer a kind one. She was heading North-Northeast, towards Agricola Island, if me guess is right. An ill omen if there ever was one. Legends say, Lord Paisap has an ancient home on that island. On top of that, that's where the Anathema Thryme the Bloody Garden is laid to rest. They say they're still nailed to the place where Jyubei the Cleft-Handed stabbed them through with the demon-spear Zvykawl the Sealing Spear. Tis not a good sign if two such evil spirits were to join in cahoots, eh?&quot;<br /> <br /> The other mariners wave off Old Joe's story, but Old Joe remains firm in his protests that his story is true.<br /> <br /> What will you do now?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-29T23:22:03-08:00","id":1171742,"title":"","content":"Well, this is interesting. Certainly unexpected, but, so long as the rest of her isn't a tentacled mess he's certainly willing to see where this leads. <br /> <br /> &quot;Curiouser and curiouser&quot; he says, kissing before picking her up and tossing her on the bed.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4017,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4017-angryicecream","user":"angryicecream","date":". 12-30-2017, 03:52 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4017-angryicecream","name":"angryicecream","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-29T23:42:18-08:00","id":1171745,"title":"","content":"Diane will wait a while longer, perhaps an hour or so with the fishermen, drinking and chatting, before getting up to leave, declaring &quot;Ah, it's been good, but I gotta get back to the ship. Cap'n might just keelhaul me if I'm late again.&quot;<br /> <br /> And with that, Diane will start making her way back to the ship.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-30T00:16:42-08:00","id":1171746,"title":"","content":"Since they hadn't been perceived as belonging together, Lessons stays a bit longer before taking off himself, returning to the ship to see what the Essen woman knows about the will of the cobra.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1131211-flintys-homebrew-hub-2e\" target=\"_blank\">My Mage 2e Homebrew</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5241-flinty","name":"Flinty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"793"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-30T07:38:39-08:00","id":1171786,"title":"","content":"Shining Topaz is still standing outside the room, ready to come in if her captain calls for her.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11917-aranfan","name":"Aranfan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11917_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"503"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-30T07:48:17-08:00","id":1171789,"title":"","content":"<br /> Scholar turns back and heads to a shop where he could sell one of the golden figurines he created. He wants to gain a little experience in selling and bartering. He has prepared himself emotionally to lose money on the deal as normally he would sell his creations to Laughter for him to resell for a profit. Even though everything in the distance is a blur, when he gets closer to the stores, with a squint he can read the signs on the streets and the stores. He is looking for a specific store. He wants a goldsmith so that he can sell a figurine for golden ingots. These are fairly large figurines as he used one bar or ingot of gold for each figurine. He walks the market streets to answer the question, &quot;is there a goldsmith in this city?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7592-wtaylorjr2001","name":"wtaylorjr2001","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"261"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-30T10:58:23-08:00","id":1171832,"title":"","content":"(Laughter)<br /> <br /> The couple's encounter was a roiling, passionate and wild swell, plumbing the depths of their hearts in ways that are causing this metaphor to fall apart, just as foam upon the sea's waves.As Laughter enjoyed the afterglow, though, he could hear singing from abovedecks in a clarion voice he was unfamiliar with. <br /> <br /> &quot;Ah, young love. That is the true message of the Booty Call of Cthulhu. Whoever Cthulhu is--oh snap!&quot; the voice called as the angry voices of his crew converged on the singer and Laughter hears the telltale splash of someone leaping overboard. A moment later, a knock on the door brings Laughter's first mate, a stocky veteran of the seas, quietly informing you that Lessons and Diane wish to speak with them. A moment later, the trio enter just in time for Essen to compose herself, entirely human now, donning a new gown from where, Laughter cannot guess.<br /> <br /> Well, the gang's here. What will you discuss?<br /> <br /> (Lessons and Diane)<br /> <br /> The pair are ushered aboard just in time to see a small furry feline chap wearing a dapper bowler hat and carrying a violin, leap overboard with the ship's crew in hot pursuit. Ignoring that, the first mate guides you to the captain's quarters, where you find Essen and Laughter sitting opposite one another, engaging in a pleasant chat.<br /> <br /> What will you do?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1586,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","user":"Dietaku","date":". 12-30-2017, 02:58 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-30T11:06:01-08:00","id":1171834,"title":"","content":"(Scholar)<br /> <br /> Scholar finds a small shop along the main street, declaring itself to be &quot;Midaea Solon and Sons, Smiths and Armorerrs.&quot; Entering inside, he finds a small boy along with an Alopkeis puppy at the counter.<br /> <br /> &quot;Welcome! I'll get my dad,&quot; the boy calls, as a large man enters, dusting off his hands.<br /> <br /> &quot;Barnabas, my boy, do we--Ah, hello young man. What can I do for you? You need a sword sharpened? Or do you wish to show off to a lass with a new set of armor, eh?&quot; the man grins. <br /> <br /> What will you do?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1586,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","user":"Dietaku","date":".  Autocorrect. Just, autocorrect 12-30-2017, 04:12 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-30T12:19:26-08:00","id":1171847,"title":"","content":"Well, would have used celestial bliss trick but otherwise fine with me. Any stunt for all this? Mostly wondering about getting wp back.<br /> <br /> &quot;You're back early.&quot; He says, putting on his coat as the others walk in &quot;Find anythin' of interest'?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4017-angryicecream","name":"angryicecream","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-30T12:30:36-08:00","id":1171855,"title":"","content":"<br /> Scholar smiles at the older gentleman and offers his name and hand for a handshake. He was looking for a goldsmith, not quite a blacksmith, but this was good also. Scholar answers the man's question with, &quot;I have a novelty item to sell a goldsmith. Perhaps you would also be interested in it,&quot; and with that he takes out his exceptional golden figurine. <br /> <br /> &quot;It is solid gold and it is my best work. Please examine it,&quot; said Scholar giving him his masterpiece.<br /> <br /> &quot;It is my master piece,&quot; scholar added, &quot;and that's a nice puppy you got there,&quot; he said to the little one.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7592-wtaylorjr2001","name":"wtaylorjr2001","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"261"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-30T13:09:04-08:00","id":1171868,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>angryicecream</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1171397-ic-exalted-3e-the-pirates-of-the-gilded-throne?p=1171847#post1171847\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well, would have used celestial bliss trick but otherwise fine with me. Any stunt for all this? Mostly wondering about getting wp back.<br /> <br /> &amp;quot;You're back early.&amp;quot; He says, putting on his coat as the others walk in &amp;quot;Find anythin' of interest'?&amp;quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>If you want to, you can retroactively roll for CBT, with a 2 die stunt for role play.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-30T13:28:47-08:00","id":1171874,"title":"","content":"Not normally a roll for it so not sure on the attributes used, but 8 successes on app+perform if that's an appropriate dicepool 6 dice excellency took 5 motes from the ship","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4017,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4017-angryicecream","user":"angryicecream","date":". 12-30-2017, 04:31 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4017-angryicecream","name":"angryicecream","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-30T13:58:54-08:00","id":1171885,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dietaku</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1171397-ic-exalted-3e-the-pirates-of-the-gilded-throne?p=1171832#post1171832\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">(Lessons and Diane)<br /> <br /> The pair are ushered aboard just in time to see a small furry feline chap wearing a dapper bowler hat and carrying a violin, leap overboard with the ship's crew in hot pursuit. Ignoring that, the first mate guides you to the captain's quarters, where you find Essen and Laughter sitting opposite one another, engaging in a pleasant chat.<br /> <br /> What will you do?</div> </div> </div> </div>Topaz joins the others in the captain's room.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":11917,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11917-aranfan","user":"Aranfan","date":". 12-31-2017, 05:28 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11917-aranfan","name":"Aranfan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11917_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"503"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-30T21:23:17-08:00","id":1171953,"title":"","content":"Lessons snorts as he sees scene. &quot;Typical.&quot; he remarks, but in good humour. &quot;And perhaps. Got some information about what happened at the lighthouse. Got a witness saying the lady is indeed not to blame. And some questions.&quot; He studies Essen as she finishes puttin on her gown. &quot;You mentioned the will of the cobra. Tell me what you know about them.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1131211-flintys-homebrew-hub-2e\" target=\"_blank\">My Mage 2e Homebrew</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5241-flinty","name":"Flinty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"793"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-31T16:23:40-08:00","id":1172098,"title":"","content":"(Scholar)<br /> <br /> Solon taps his bearded chin as he looks the figurine over, turning it slowly around to see it from all angles,&quot; This is quite good, young man. I have not seen the likes of which in a long, long time. Sad to say, though, that there are no goldsmiths in Flotsam. There's no real demand for dedicated goldwork, at least no on a regular basis. You'd have to go to Dhaam-Bel. for that sort of thing. Still, this is fine work, and...Hm...&quot; he places the figurine down on the counter, and pulls out a rack with a finely crafted steel cuirass and scale skirt suit of armor with matching short blade and shield. The style is foreign and unusual to Scholar, but Solon beams as he pats it lovingly, &quot;I don't have the coin for such a treasure, but tell you what? I'll give you this set here for the figurine. You'd look quite sharp in this, and you'd be sure to catch the eye of a fine young lady, eh? Well, what do you say, young man?&quot;<br /> <br /> (He is offering a fine quality cuirass, shield, and slicing sword to you in exchange for the figurine. Will you accept his proposal?)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-31T17:37:40-08:00","id":1172118,"title":"","content":"(Shipside)<br /> <br /> Essen coughs as she straightens up,&quot; The Will of Cobra is the philosophy of Outer Sanctuary, to continue the Endless War against the Realm and its catspaws until the right and proper government of Creation can be reestablished. Cobra was the Mother of that land, an outlaw who fled a terrestrial paradise on the central continent now lost to the ages, and sought her entire life to reclaim it for those who allied themselves with her. Though she passed on, stolen by Heaven, her Will continues, carved into the very stones of her land. That is why the people of Outer Sanctuary continue to fight even when she has been gone for almost a thousand summers. My teacher taught me that she had envisioned a means by which regardless of their power or their magic, that the people of Outer Sanctuary could halt the Realm's ambitions, and perhaps even turn the tables on them and become the dominant power in Creation, but he remained tight-lipped as to what that was. Why are you asking, though? Do you wish to become Sons of Cobra yourself?&quot; <br /> <br /> Well? What how will you respond?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-31T17:41:55-08:00","id":1172119,"title":"","content":"&quot;I thought the central continent was the Blessed Isle?&quot; Topaz comments, &quot;Which is supposed to be a terrestrial paradise in terms of abundance and weather.&quot;<br /> <br /> She taps her foot, &quot;What <i>is</i> the right and proper government supposed to be anyway?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11917-aranfan","name":"Aranfan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11917_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"503"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-31T18:44:28-08:00","id":1172126,"title":"","content":"(Shipside)<br /> <br /> &quot;The right and proper government is a meritocratic oligarchy, with those who have exceeded beyond their limits, risking everything to achieve the glory of exaltation from the Celestial deities. Those who achieve this glory must then work to lift up those beneath them, fostering them to potentially achieve the same. This is the dream that millions have died for,&quot; Essen said,&quot; As for the central continent, yes, that is the name it has been given by the squatters who feast on the dead from the threshold and their colonies on the fringes, but according to the books I have read, and my mentor, it was so much more. Not a retreat for the in-bred rich, but a center for the brightest and best all across the universe.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-31T19:20:27-08:00","id":1172130,"title":"","content":"&quot;And why don't the in bred rich just show up n root out the nest of would be anathema?&quot; He asks, mulling through the scattered memories of his past life.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4017-angryicecream","name":"angryicecream","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-31T19:42:34-08:00","id":1172134,"title":"","content":"&quot;They try, and they've made in-roads, but it's difficult to wage war when the land itself turns against you, the citizens only begrudgingly tolerate your presence, and it's so <i>dreadfully </i>far from their cities and luxuries. Prasad has tried many times to conquer them, but they never succeed, at least not in full. Not to say everything goes swimmingly for the defenders. The area is almost constantly at low-level war with itself and others, and the harvests are rarely ever good, being so deep into the South, but they make do,&quot; Essen shrugs.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-31T19:46:02-08:00","id":1172135,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dietaku</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1171397-ic-exalted-3e-the-pirates-of-the-gilded-throne?p=1172126#post1172126\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">(Shipside)<br /> <br /> &quot;The right and proper government is a meritocratic oligarchy, with those who have exceeded beyond their limits, risking everything to achieve the glory of exaltation from the Celestial deities. Those who achieve this glory must then work to lift up those beneath them, fostering them to potentially achieve the same. This is the dream that millions have died for,&quot; Essen said,&quot; As for the central continent, yes, that is the name it has been given by the squatters who feast on the dead from the threshold and their colonies on the fringes, but according to the books I have read, and my mentor, it was so much more. Not a retreat for the in-bred rich, but a center for the brightest and best all across the universe.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Topaz snorts, &quot;I'd be a shitty ruler. That said, I'm always up for sticking it to Prasad.&quot;<br /> <br /> A moment passes. &quot;I shouldn't have said that.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":11917,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11917-aranfan","user":"Aranfan","date":". 12-31-2017, 10:53 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11917-aranfan","name":"Aranfan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11917_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"503"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-31T20:37:43-08:00","id":1172153,"title":"","content":"&quot;Then you would be a wonderful Daughter of Cobra! The way you hold yourself, the way you stand, clearly you're not ignorant of the way of the blade,&quot; Essen says excitedly.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-31T20:41:45-08:00","id":1172155,"title":"","content":"&quot;Right fightin' the good fight against the realm and all that.&quot; Lessons quickly interjects as Aranfan spills the beans. &quot;I actually can sympathize with that to a point. Usually have more immediate troubles to deal with, but I get the idea. Now here's what confuses me. Why did this cobra person get taken away by the freaking gods themselves? And to hear the fishers talk they rained fire down on one of her successors. What did these guys do to get the gods to grill their assess?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1131211-flintys-homebrew-hub-2e\" target=\"_blank\">My Mage 2e Homebrew</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5241-flinty","name":"Flinty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"793"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-31T21:05:50-08:00","id":1172162,"title":"","content":"&quot;They weren't gods. They were bureaucrats of Heaven, but they weren't gods. Even the gods fear these ones. I'm not sure what they are, but they are <i>dangerous</i>. My teacher told me that if I ever see someone who smiles, but the hairs on the back of my neck shiver, then I ought to run. They have abilities, to kill with a kind word and to turn your love into chains to strangle you. They can corrupt your mind and even make the land itself barren with but a thought. Thankfully, they hate each other as much as they hate the Will of Cobra. Besides, there are others who they hate more, so their attention is never solely on us,&quot; Essen shivers, as if remembering some nightmare.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-31T21:22:36-08:00","id":1172167,"title":"","content":"&quot;Mhhm. Weird. And troubling, if true anyway. So how'd you get caught up with them?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1131211-flintys-homebrew-hub-2e\" target=\"_blank\">My Mage 2e Homebrew</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5241-flinty","name":"Flinty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"793"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-01T06:58:22-08:00","id":1172248,"title":"","content":"<br /> <br /> <br /> Scholar takes the sword, armor, and shield in turn and pulls them close so he can examine them in fine detail despite his weak eyes. Three times he squints and runs his sight along the shape of the item in his hand. He studies each in turn and learns very little as he doesn't know beyond a trifling amount what to look for. He doesn't have the experience in appraisal that the blacksmith has. This is true for all save the sword. He is an expert in bladed weapons, taught by his master who was not only a great warrior but a great blacksmith also, with fiery spirits of knowledge adding their capabilities to his massive reservoir of fighting knowledge. He understands how much the blade is worth. But then, the entire set is worth nothing to him as it is not what he needs now. He needs raw material to create personal items to sell and replenish his dwindling supplies.<br /> <br /> &quot;Kind sir these look like wonderful pieces, but they are worthless to me. I need raw materials. I need iron and coal and the trashy resins that are left when you smelt iron. I would trade this figurine for all of the raw materials I can get to be delivered to the ship I'm on. I can direct the delivery.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":7592,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7592-wtaylorjr2001","user":"wtaylorjr2001","date":". 01-01-2018, 10:03 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7592-wtaylorjr2001","name":"wtaylorjr2001","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"261"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-01T17:11:16-08:00","id":1172439,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dietaku</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1171397-ic-exalted-3e-the-pirates-of-the-gilded-throne?p=1172153#post1172153\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&quot;Then you would be a wonderful Daughter of Cobra! The way you hold yourself, the way you stand, clearly you're not ignorant of the way of the blade,&quot; Essen says excitedly.</div> </div> </div> </div>There is a sound of clinking metal as Topaz's gauntleted fingers tap against her mailed arm, &quot;I know why I don't like Prasad, but why are you so eager to go up against a nation of Terrestrial Exalts? What bee did they put in your bonnet?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11917-aranfan","name":"Aranfan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11917_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"503"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-01T19:35:05-08:00","id":1172481,"title":"","content":"(Shipside)<br /> <br /> Essen looks away, &quot;It began about three years ago. I went with my Ma to visit relatives landside, and everything went fine. However, the ship we returned on hit a squall and I was tossed overboard. I swam and swam, trying to stay alive, until I felt dead and began to sink. However, I then got angry. I'm a daughter of Flotsam, dammit! Why ought I go softly into death's embrace? So I kept swimming, even as my body screamed with pain, I continued to swim, until I found it was the easiest thing to do. My body didn't hurt any longer, and sure enough, I found myself in the shallows, where I met a group of natives. They saw my swimming, and knew something odd had happened to me. They brought me to their leader, who clothed me and told me all about how their village was part of a great nation; that which opposed those pompous pricks from Prasad, and sought to right the world's wrongs. That seemed like a good thing, and after meeting with the man the ELder alluded to, it all made sense. What had happened, why I had survived, and what I now must do. My teacher taught me many things, like complicated maths, to command troops, and also fight. He wasn't so good at things like I was, though, he never did get the best way to approach people, always viewing them as potential enemies, but the point still stands that he was a great man, and I owe him much. After a year's training, I returned home, arriving after about a year's time, and here I am. As for why to defeat Prasad? Well,&quot; Essen looks a bit embarrassed, &quot; My master has a better grasp on it than I ever did. Something about &quot;Force projection,&quot; and &quot;Command over arterial waterways, trade networks and denying the enemy strategic assets,&quot; I'm really not sure what that all means, even now. I'm sorry I can't be more help.&quot;<br /> <br /> (Scholar)<br /> <br /> &quot;Well, my boy, if that's all you want, I have about a ton of iron ingots, several carts of bronze, and some tin. I also have several casks of turpentine, resin, and various other oils you'd need to maintain iron in sea air. You're not going to set up shop here in town, are you?&quot; Solon asks, as Barnabas claps as his dog spins around him.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-01T19:40:08-08:00","id":1172484,"title":"","content":"&quot;So something weird happened when you were just about to drown... like what?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1131211-flintys-homebrew-hub-2e\" target=\"_blank\">My Mage 2e Homebrew</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5241-flinty","name":"Flinty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"793"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-01T19:43:32-08:00","id":1172485,"title":"","content":"Laughter, for his part is just listening, downing enough liquor to keep a comfortable buzz going. Keeping an eye out for shifts in tone that might indicate she's starting to grt uncomfortable or clam up.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4017-angryicecream","name":"angryicecream","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-01T19:51:57-08:00","id":1172489,"title":"","content":"&quot;No Solon, I will be based on the ship as it makes its rounds. Actually that may also be a good thing for you as the captain is a merchant. He might be pursuaded to buy your goods and sell to small islands and other cities. I don't see myself as your competitor. It is a deal then. I will give you this piece for the raw materials you can trade to me. If you have two carts I can take hem to my ship now.&quot;<br /> <br /> Scholar shakes the Solon's hand. He glances at the little one playing with the little dog. <br /> <br /> &quot;He is having a lot of fun over there isn't he. Reminds me of the carefree days of my youth,&quot; With that he excuses himself and makes his way back to the ship. When he gets to the ship, he would have the crew unload the carts into the cargo hold with the giant crate that is the warstrider. He then sends the carts back to Solon and makes his way to the captain to tell him of Jenkins offer.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7592-wtaylorjr2001","name":"wtaylorjr2001","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"261"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-01T19:53:00-08:00","id":1172490,"title":"","content":"(Shipside)<br /> <br /> Essen swallows, before she stands up,&quot; I don't want you all to get alarmed, but since you asked....&quot;<br /> <br /> The young woman rolls up her sleeves before her arms bulge unnaturally, splintering into writhing blue-ringed tentacles.<br /> <br /> &quot;This. This happened. Well, and other things, but I think this proves my point that something odd happened to me,&quot; Essen explained.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-01T20:03:23-08:00","id":1172495,"title":"","content":"&quot;Uhh yeah.&quot; Lessons says scratching his head. &quot;Some kind of wyld mutation? Where's Scholar when you need him...&quot; he sighs. Then shrugs. What does it matter.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1131211-flintys-homebrew-hub-2e\" target=\"_blank\">My Mage 2e Homebrew</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5241-flinty","name":"Flinty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"793"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-01T20:03:51-08:00","id":1172496,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dietaku</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1171397-ic-exalted-3e-the-pirates-of-the-gilded-throne?p=1172481#post1172481\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">(Shipside)<br /> <br /> Essen looks away, &quot;It began about three years ago. I went with my Ma to visit relatives landside, and everything went fine. However, the ship we returned on hit a squall and I was tossed overboard. I swam and swam, trying to stay alive, until I felt dead and began to sink. However, I then got angry. I'm a daughter of Flotsam, dammit! Why ought I go softly into death's embrace? So I kept swimming, even as my body screamed with pain, I continued to swim, until I found it was the easiest thing to do. My body didn't hurt any longer, and sure enough, I found myself in the shallows, where I met a group of natives. They saw my swimming, and knew something odd had happened to me. They brought me to their leader, who clothed me and told me all about how their village was part of a great nation; that which opposed those pompous pricks from Prasad, and sought to right the world's wrongs. That seemed like a good thing, and after meeting with the man the ELder alluded to, it all made sense. What had happened, why I had survived, and what I now must do. My teacher taught me many things, like complicated maths, to command troops, and also fight. He wasn't so good at things like I was, though, he never did get the best way to approach people, always viewing them as potential enemies, but the point still stands that he was a great man, and I owe him much. After a year's training, I returned home, arriving after about a year's time, and here I am. As for why to defeat Prasad? Well,&quot; Essen looks a bit embarrassed, &quot; My master has a better grasp on it than I ever did. Something about &quot;Force projection,&quot; and &quot;Command over arterial waterways, trade networks and denying the enemy strategic assets,&quot; I'm really not sure what that all means, even now. I'm sorry I can't be more help.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>Topaz exhales. &quot;The dreaming sea is far from the Realm. Far enough that it can't really impose it's will, project it's force, this far out. Last time it tried, said force decided to become Prasad instead of enforcing the will of the Realm. Which means if someone, a Silver Anathema say, wanted to set up a base of operations here, it would be mostly proof against the Realm if Prasad was eliminated. Since they also have the &quot;kill the anathema&quot; religion. Get rid of them and you could build up infrastructure and troops beyond the range of the Realm's influence.&quot;<br /> <br /> She looks Essen right in the eye, the back of her head cradled in her hands (putting them near the sword at her back). &quot;You're a Silver Anathema.&quot; It's a statement of fact, not a question.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11917-aranfan","name":"Aranfan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11917_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"503"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-01T20:06:36-08:00","id":1172497,"title":"","content":"&quot;What in Malfeas is a Silver Anathema?&quot; Lessons asks confused.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1131211-flintys-homebrew-hub-2e\" target=\"_blank\">My Mage 2e Homebrew</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5241-flinty","name":"Flinty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"793"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-01T20:14:44-08:00","id":1172499,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Flinty</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1171397-ic-exalted-3e-the-pirates-of-the-gilded-throne?p=1172497#post1172497\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&quot;What in Malfeas is a Silver Anathema?&quot; Lessons asks confused.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> &quot;Like a Golden Anathema, but stealing their power from the Moon rather than the sun. You know, demon in the skin thing? Also Silver Anathema can shapeshift.&quot; Topaz says, eyes remaining on Essen in case she makes any hostile moves.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11917-aranfan","name":"Aranfan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11917_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"503"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-01T20:15:15-08:00","id":1172500,"title":"","content":"(Scholar)<br /> <br /> Solon grins as he shakes Scholar's hand,&quot; It does my heart glad to see a young lad so keen to improve himself. Besides, it's good to get your adventuring out when you're young. That's how I met my Brigitte. Anyways, good luck to you and may Origenes smile on you in your adventures lad,&quot; he says, bowing, as he assists you load up your new resources onto your carts. <br /> <br /> What will you do?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-01T20:17:49-08:00","id":1172502,"title":"","content":"His eyes turn back to Essen. &quot;Oh shit.&quot; he says his face draining of colour. &quot;So you're going to kill us all now demon?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1131211-flintys-homebrew-hub-2e\" target=\"_blank\">My Mage 2e Homebrew</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5241-flinty","name":"Flinty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"793"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-01T20:19:48-08:00","id":1172503,"title":"","content":"&quot;Oh, relax, girl. She's up to no ill will.&quot; He says, in response to Topaz' sudden readiness for battle","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4017-angryicecream","name":"angryicecream","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-01T20:40:25-08:00","id":1172507,"title":"","content":"&quot;I will be back some time with other things to sell to you, and perhaps other things to buy from you, until then fair well,&quot; and with that he makes his way to the ship with his new purchases. The other drivers, Scholar didn''t know if they were rented, or from Solon's shop, spoke about something as they headed to the ship, but with the fact that he wasn't particularly interested, but more so as he couldn't hear well, he smiled and nodded and kept his council. When he got to the ship, he would let the crew unload the two carts, and make his way to find the captain.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7592-wtaylorjr2001","name":"wtaylorjr2001","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"261"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-01T20:44:16-08:00","id":1172509,"title":"","content":"(Shipside)<br /> <br /> &quot;If I wanted to kill you, I would've already, or I would've killed your captain, at any rate,&quot; Essen smiles, her cheeks flaring once more,&quot; Not that that is a worry now. Still, as one fast-talker to another, you really ought to do better.&quot;<br /> <br /> Turning to Topaz, she replies with,&quot; I've heard of that term, but I thought the Anathema were fairy tales, told by parents to keep their children in line. From the Golden-Devils, the Moon-Mad, the Star-Spawn, and the Grave-Born, all devils sent to wreak havoc on the innocent. My teacher told me it's all hogwash, though, and I'm inclined to agree with him. I'm curious to hear what my Master has to say, though....Master, will you accept this part of me, even so?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1586,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","user":"Dietaku","date":". 01-02-2018, 01:59 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-01T20:45:49-08:00","id":1172511,"title":"","content":"(Scholar)<br /> <br /> Very well, then. After loading your new goods aboard ships, Scholar is ushered into the state room just in time for Topaz's accusation to hang in the air. Scholar is now in the scene with the others.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-01T20:50:40-08:00","id":1172512,"title":"","content":"Lessons throws up his arms in defeat. &quot;Fine, fine. So to ask a more pertinent question: Why reveal yourself to us? You seem to be pretty sure we're not going to feed you to the next wyld hunt.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1131211-flintys-homebrew-hub-2e\" target=\"_blank\">My Mage 2e Homebrew</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5241-flinty","name":"Flinty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"793"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-01T20:54:15-08:00","id":1172513,"title":"","content":"&quot;Aye.&quot; He says, with a grin, &quot;You and I are just fine, my dear. Just fine,&quot; He looks towards the door as it opens and sees Scholar walking in, his smile faltering somewhat. &quot;Ah. Good of you to make it back, my boy. We need to have a chat about situational awareness.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4017,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4017-angryicecream","user":"angryicecream","date":". 01-02-2018, 12:22 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4017-angryicecream","name":"angryicecream","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-01T20:55:45-08:00","id":1172514,"title":"","content":"Essen's face brightens at Laughter's approval. It appears that Laughter's magic had done its work as intended.<br /> <br /> &quot;Oh, good! Well, I didn't intend to reveal myself to you all, but I wanted to scare Master a little, and he...&quot; Essen giggles a little to herself,&quot; Master surprised even me. To a lesser extent, you all have. Few others would have fought for my freedom from the Constable and his men as vehemently as you did, and yet you then you're surprised if I trust you a little? Besides, there are far scarier things I can do, but I don't like to use them if I don't have to. Now, is there anything else you wish to know? I'm getting a little hungry.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1586,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","user":"Dietaku","date":".  Edited because Sempai noticed Essen-chan 01-01-2018, 11:58 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-01T20:59:58-08:00","id":1172515,"title":"","content":"&quot;Not that uncommon for a decent man to save a pretty girl.&quot; Lessons says with a shrug. &quot;Pretty common for people to get scared by mutants, demons and fairytales. Most'd probably scare and then you'd have to kill them. More dangerous people may put on a friendly face and stab you in the back at the first opportunity they get. Just saying you're taking quite the big risk here, trusting us as you do.&quot; He gives her an encouraging (and even genuine) smile. &quot;Luckily for you, you actually do not have to fear anything from us. Not for what you are.&quot; He makes a nod towards laughter and her. &quot;So you plan on staying?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1131211-flintys-homebrew-hub-2e\" target=\"_blank\">My Mage 2e Homebrew</a>","edited":{"userid":5241,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5241-flinty","user":"Flinty","date":". 01-02-2018, 12:14 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5241-flinty","name":"Flinty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"793"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-01T21:04:45-08:00","id":1172517,"title":"","content":"&quot;That should take a back seat to what I have to say. Lesser importance, I took care of restocking the raw materials and it only cost one of these. You can take the others and sell them and give me my share. You can even take out the cost of her. We need more food though. But I think you will like the next part. Because of my showing my figurines for the trade of her life, I got an offer for a statue in the market. Upon completion, we get a letter of marque from the Duke.&quot;<br /> <br /> Scholar looks at the scene as if for the first time. The people were blurry, but he could make out who's who.<br /> <br /> &quot;Is everything alright?&quot; He asks.<br /> <br /> Scholar says to the saved girl, &quot;I can fix you up something to eat. It is about time I started on dinner.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":7592,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7592-wtaylorjr2001","user":"wtaylorjr2001","date":". 01-02-2018, 12:14 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7592-wtaylorjr2001","name":"wtaylorjr2001","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"261"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-01T21:23:18-08:00","id":1172521,"title":"","content":"&quot;Kind of in the middle of something here, Scholar. Meet Essen the Octopus Anathema.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1131211-flintys-homebrew-hub-2e\" target=\"_blank\">My Mage 2e Homebrew</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5241-flinty","name":"Flinty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"793"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-01T21:23:56-08:00","id":1172523,"title":"","content":"&quot;...Yes, everything's fine.&quot; He says after a moment before turning his attention back to Essen &quot;What are you cravin, my dear? He truly is a remarkable chef...&quot; He says, amused by the turn","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4017,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4017-angryicecream","user":"angryicecream","date":". 01-02-2018, 12:25 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4017-angryicecream","name":"angryicecream","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-01T21:42:09-08:00","id":1172529,"title":"","content":"Scholar looked at the young woman and then back to Slippery Shadow. &quot;Middle of something?&quot; He then turns to Essen, &quot;Pleased to meet you Essen.&quot;<br /> <br /> He turns to Slippery and asks, &quot;Middle of what? Is there a danger?&quot;<br /> <br /> Scholar's brow clenches in confusion. His cloak parts revealing his breastplate and longsword, a medium sized blade.He looks around as he doesn't know who to direct his attention to. He is ready without putting his hand on his blade.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7592-wtaylorjr2001","name":"wtaylorjr2001","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"261"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-01T21:46:44-08:00","id":1172530,"title":"","content":"&quot;Easy there, Scholar, everythin's fine&quot; he says, raising a placating hand &quot;Why don't you go prepare that stew of yours and we'll talk about it over dinner when everyone's more relaxed. Then you can tell us all about the deal you made for the marque too.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4017-angryicecream","name":"angryicecream","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-01T21:49:27-08:00","id":1172531,"title":"","content":"&quot;Well, one thing we should definitly talk about is the Lighthouse. Local scuttlebutt has it that it's 'heart' was taken by some 'Dark Wulf of the Depths, Fell Lord of those who die at sea', who then made away with it to a place called Agricola Island. We should think about wether we want to do something about it. We're not from here, so technically not our problem... but it sounds like the people here are pretty much screwed without it, so I say we get it back, earn some local favour in the process or whatever.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1131211-flintys-homebrew-hub-2e\" target=\"_blank\">My Mage 2e Homebrew</a>","edited":{"userid":5241,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5241-flinty","user":"Flinty","date":". 01-02-2018, 12:55 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5241-flinty","name":"Flinty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"793"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-01T21:51:59-08:00","id":1172532,"title":"","content":"&quot;We can talk about it over supper, me thinks. Catch the boy up on what's happened then, ye?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4017,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4017-angryicecream","user":"angryicecream","date":". 01-02-2018, 12:59 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4017-angryicecream","name":"angryicecream","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-01T21:58:54-08:00","id":1172535,"title":"","content":"His eyes were bad, though this was the first time he mistook arms for tentacles even with his bad eyes. Does this mean his eyes are getting worse? He looks at Essen and squints. He sees better now.<br /> <br /> &quot;Well then. Everything is OK. If you have a problem from the changing lands of the wild, I may be able to help you as I am also a doctor,&quot; Scholar says. &quot;Actually a healer.&quot; His cloak doesn't close but he seems more relaxed.<br /> <br /> He pauses.<br /> <br /> &quot;If you came into contact with the wild areas, have you come across a fae,&quot; and he proceeds to describe the fae that took his sister. &quot;It took my sister and I'm getting her back or die trying.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;One other thing,&quot; he turns to Laughter,<br /> <br /> &quot;Don't call me boy. Alright miss Laughter?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":7592,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7592-wtaylorjr2001","user":"wtaylorjr2001","date":". 01-02-2018, 01:26 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7592-wtaylorjr2001","name":"wtaylorjr2001","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"261"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-01T22:29:51-08:00","id":1172543,"title":"","content":"He chuckles at the 'Miss' and says&quot;I'll call you boy as long as you keep lookin' and actin' like one. You're young. Nothin' wrong with bein' a boy. Enjoy it while you can. People are less likely to hold you to task for what you say and do. So, don't work so hard to tear down that shield...&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4017,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4017-angryicecream","user":"angryicecream","date":". 01-02-2018, 01:40 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4017-angryicecream","name":"angryicecream","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-02T03:15:11-08:00","id":1172585,"title":"","content":"Scholar of the Golden Owl looks at Laughter. He holds Laughter's eyes with his own. He is angry, more so than he has been since his sister's abduction. He refuses to be looked down on. <br /> <br /> &quot;I work passage here, I am paying my way to get help finding my sister. But I am not part of your crew. I have told you to stop doing something that I find annoying and yet you persist. You will stop calling me boy or face the consequences.&quot;<br /> <br /> His anger flares into a rage that pushes to get out. He does not know the words, but in truth he is a Twilight Solar Exalted and he will not be belittled by anyone. His caste mark flares and his rage feeds into his anima, a glowing golden owl spreading its wings. <br /> <br /> He will not be belittled.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7592-wtaylorjr2001","name":"wtaylorjr2001","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"261"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-02T06:16:47-08:00","id":1172621,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dietaku</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1171397-ic-exalted-3e-the-pirates-of-the-gilded-throne?p=1172514#post1172514\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Essen's face brightens at Laughter's approval. It appears that Laughter's magic had done its work as intended.<br /> <br /> &quot;Oh, good! Well, I didn't intend to reveal myself to you all, but I wanted to scare Master a little, and he...&quot; Essen giggles a little to herself,&quot; Master surprised even me. To a lesser extent, you all have. Few others would have fought for my freedom from the Constable and his men as vehemently as you did, and yet you then you're surprised if I trust you a little? Besides, there are far scarier things I can do, but I don't like to use them if I don't have to. Now, is there anything else you wish to know? I'm getting a little hungry.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>Topaz relaxes, mollified that there won't be a fight here.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wtaylorjr2001</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1171397-ic-exalted-3e-the-pirates-of-the-gilded-throne?p=1172585#post1172585\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Scholar of the Golden Owl looks at Laughter. He holds Laughter's eyes with his own. He is angry, more so than he has been since his sister's abduction. He refuses to be looked down on.<br /> <br /> &quot;I work passage here, I am paying my way to get help finding my sister. But I am not part of your crew. I have told you to stop doing something that I find annoying and yet you persist. You will stop calling me boy or face the consequences.&quot;<br /> <br /> His anger flares into a rage that pushes to get out. He does not know the words, but in truth he is a Twilight Solar Exalted and he will not be belittled by anyone. His caste mark flares and his rage feeds into his anima, a glowing golden owl spreading its wings.<br /> <br /> He will not be belittled.</div> </div> </div> </div>Aaaaaand there goes that. Right back to being tense.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":11917,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11917-aranfan","user":"Aranfan","date":". 01-02-2018, 09:18 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11917-aranfan","name":"Aranfan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11917_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"503"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-02T06:43:55-08:00","id":1172626,"title":"","content":"&quot;Easy, Scholar.&quot; Lessons says calmly. &quot;Flipping your shit over this just proves him right. Act calmly and thoughtfully and everyone will give you the respect you deserve.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1131211-flintys-homebrew-hub-2e\" target=\"_blank\">My Mage 2e Homebrew</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5241-flinty","name":"Flinty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"793"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-02T08:18:53-08:00","id":1172643,"title":"","content":"&quot;Ye haven't asked, lad. Ye've made demands. How do ye expect to be treated like a man when this is how ye respond to not immediately bein' given what ye want?&quot; Laughter asks, still seated calmly. &quot;What does a threat of violence prove?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4017-angryicecream","name":"angryicecream","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-02T08:34:38-08:00","id":1172646,"title":"","content":"Still flaring Scholar moves closer to Laughter, getting within inches of his face, all the while holding his eyes with his own. His fists are clenching. His face snarls as he says,<br /> <br /> &quot;What's it gonna be Laughter, the ball is in your court. Will you stop calling me boy?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7592-wtaylorjr2001","name":"wtaylorjr2001","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"261"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-02T08:40:42-08:00","id":1172647,"title":"","content":"&quot;Listen, I'm tryin' to help ye here. I've come to see ye as one of me own. Ye need to think. It's like one of yer experiments. What's yer hypothesis on how demandin' to not be treated like a child while actin' like one'll be? Who benefits from this? Ye? Yer sister? Or the faeries what ran off with er?&quot; He says, taking a swig from his flask, the rum burning hot in his mouth","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4017-angryicecream","name":"angryicecream","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-02T08:45:15-08:00","id":1172649,"title":"","content":"There is no stopping Scholar. There is no compromise. There is win or lose. His breath hot in Laughter's face asks the question, &quot;will you stop calling me boy?&quot; He starts to tremble from holding back his onslaught. The final line is about to be crossed.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7592-wtaylorjr2001","name":"wtaylorjr2001","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"261"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-02T08:48:14-08:00","id":1172650,"title":"","content":"He spits the rum on the floor before saying, &quot;Nay, child. Not on me own ship while ye make demands of me like a squallin' babe&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4017-angryicecream","name":"angryicecream","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-02T08:52:09-08:00","id":1172651,"title":"","content":"Lessons quietly positions himself behind scholar, readying himself to intervene if necessary.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1131211-flintys-homebrew-hub-2e\" target=\"_blank\">My Mage 2e Homebrew</a>","edited":{"userid":5241,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5241-flinty","user":"Flinty","date":". 01-02-2018, 12:14 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5241-flinty","name":"Flinty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"793"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-02T08:54:05-08:00","id":1172652,"title":"","content":"&quot;Then I'm not on your ship anymore bitch!&quot; Scholar turns and leaves.He goes to the hold. He catches a crewman and has him help him into the warstrider, takes his wagon filled with raw materials. He leaves the cloths and food that was for the crew and leaves the ship.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7592-wtaylorjr2001","name":"wtaylorjr2001","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"261"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-02T09:11:59-08:00","id":1172659,"title":"","content":"&quot;Boy ... Scholar,&quot; he changes it to &quot;if ye walk out there right now, ye'll surely die. Sit. Think. Where are ye? What are ye doin'? Think of yer sister. Please.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4017,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4017-angryicecream","user":"angryicecream","date":". 01-02-2018, 12:55 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4017-angryicecream","name":"angryicecream","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-02T10:31:27-08:00","id":1172681,"title":"","content":"Scholar stopped. The warstriders damage was clearly evident as when he stopped it nearly fell over onto the cart. He turned to see what he saw on the ship.<br /> <br /> &quot;You finally called me by my name. That was all I wanted. I became a man the day my parents were killed and I was alone to take care of my sister. I was a man when my sister almost died from starvation when I couldn't provide for her and myself. When my sister was taken by the Fae I fought one to a standstill. I will not be called boy.&quot;<br /> <br /> Scholar projected his voice fairly well at the group? was it a group? That he couldn't see because of his eyes.<br /> <br /> &quot;You said my name. Called me by my name. That was all I wanted.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7592-wtaylorjr2001","name":"wtaylorjr2001","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"261"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-02T10:41:26-08:00","id":1172682,"title":"","content":"Well, would have said something before he actually left the room, once he's outside/the door is open he's already dead. Wouldn't call him back at that point to doom everyone. Assuming he stopped at the door then as follows:<br /> He mutters something under his breath, &quot;Right. Please, sit down. At least until ye stop blazin' like the damn sun. If ye leave now ye'll find yerself sportin' a coat of arrows before you can say 'I'm not a demon'.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4017-angryicecream","name":"angryicecream","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-02T10:48:03-08:00","id":1172683,"title":"","content":"Essen stares at the scene before her in sheer incredulity. Surely this wasn't happening.<br /> <br /> &quot; Stop, both of you. Scholar, was it? You must not take such japes to heart. If you wish to be seen as a man, let your actions speak for you, &quot; she says, patting Scholar on the shoulder, before turning to Laughter.<br /> <br /> &quot;And as for you, to bait him like that is unconscionable of anyone I would call my master!&quot; she narrows her eyes, hands on hips, before shaking her head in resignation,&quot; Anyways, I'd like a bit of crab. Maybe some crab cakes? Come along, Scholar. You need to show me to the mess.&quot;<br /> <br /> Well, gents, the gauntlet has been cast down, so to speak. What will you all do?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1586,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","user":"Dietaku","date":". 01-02-2018, 02:47 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-02T10:54:50-08:00","id":1172685,"title":"","content":"Well, assuming you're retconning scholar's glorious burning essence out of the scene then just watching them leave. &quot;I really need to teach that boy how to think. Gonna get us all killed. Rum?&quot; He says once the door closes, putting down some glasses.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4017,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4017-angryicecream","user":"angryicecream","date":". 01-02-2018, 02:00 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4017-angryicecream","name":"angryicecream","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-02T10:56:46-08:00","id":1172687,"title":"","content":"&quot;Aye, crabs sound delicious, let's go.&quot; Lessons says, joining Essen and hopefully Scholar.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1131211-flintys-homebrew-hub-2e\" target=\"_blank\">My Mage 2e Homebrew</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5241-flinty","name":"Flinty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"793"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-02T11:36:58-08:00","id":1172694,"title":"","content":"Crab cakes. Scholar remembers several recipes for crab cakes.<br /> <br /> &quot;I know a few good recipes,&quot; as he moves past Laughter into the hallway and all the way to the galley. He had he feeling he couldn't trust this group. He didn't know where it came from, but it wasn't just Laughter. He had a feeling he needed to always be on guard from them. Then he realized. They were Laughter's crew. He needed his own. Silence was his best friend.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7592-wtaylorjr2001","name":"wtaylorjr2001","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"261"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-02T12:15:20-08:00","id":1172707,"title":"","content":"Lessons follows Scholar and Essen to the galley, trying to cheer up Scholar a bit and making small talk with Essen. He's not really a good chef, but he's handy with a knife and if there's one thing he knows about kitchens, it's that there's allways need of a knife in one.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1131211-flintys-homebrew-hub-2e\" target=\"_blank\">My Mage 2e Homebrew</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5241-flinty","name":"Flinty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"793"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-02T12:41:56-08:00","id":1172714,"title":"","content":"When Scholar gets to the kitchen, he is a different person. He needs no one else in the kitchen moving from one food preparation task to another. He gets in close so it becomes evident his eyesight is poor, as well as his hearing, he gets close to hear the dramboli sizzle. It is very evident that he knows what he is doing when the scents come together and he himself becomes hungry for a taste. But he doesn't until he needs to. There are clams, oysters, and shrimp in a light tomato sauce over the now steaming dramboli. He focuses his will on the dish, using his solar power to make this meal for the captain and the crew just as good as the others he made.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> <br /> Craft cooking 1 + Intelligence 5 + motes 4 is 10 and he got 11 successes<br /> Needs to be highlighted to see<br /> </div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> He tastes and it is good, one of his better meals. The crew will like it. He then goes to his quartermaster room and checks for new orders for armor, weapons, or clothes.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":7592,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7592-wtaylorjr2001","user":"wtaylorjr2001","date":". 01-02-2018, 03:49 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7592-wtaylorjr2001","name":"wtaylorjr2001","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"261"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-02T13:44:08-08:00","id":1172725,"title":"","content":"&quot;So..&quot; Lessons ventures while Scholar is whirling around the kitchen like some maddened dervish. &quot;What was that all about? Why does it get you so mad when Laughter calls you boy? Calls me that all the time too and from the looks of it I'm a few years older than you. What's the problem?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1131211-flintys-homebrew-hub-2e\" target=\"_blank\">My Mage 2e Homebrew</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5241-flinty","name":"Flinty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"793"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-02T13:49:43-08:00","id":1172728,"title":"","content":"Well, apparently there is now a way into the bowels of the ship via the captain's cabin to keep this from fracturing further. Laughter for his part, goes to sit in the mess, mirth largely gone from him as he contemplates how to proceed, especially with his maps ruined by the damned boy's tantrum. Maybe he can fix them. Time will tell. In the meanwhile, he leaves others to watch Scholar, trusts them to keep him below deck where he can't bring certain doom to the entire crew.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4017-angryicecream","name":"angryicecream","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-02T13:58:56-08:00","id":1172735,"title":"","content":"&quot;I asked him to stop and he didn't,&quot; Scholar responds. <br /> <br /> &quot;He is not my family. He has no right to act that way to me, with all I do for the crew and him, I have earned respect.&quot; Scholar paused for a moment.<br /> <br /> &quot;And I just kept getting madder and madder. It is not fair. I am a passenger on this ship though I am a working passenger. You and the others are his crew, not me. I am a working passenger. I am trying to find my sister. He may help.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7592-wtaylorjr2001","name":"wtaylorjr2001","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"261"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-02T14:13:48-08:00","id":1172742,"title":"","content":"&quot;I'm not part of his crew. I know fuck all about how to handle a ship, in case you didn't notice.&quot; he notes calmly. &quot;Neither does Rose. I am here because the people here can help me accomplish my goals and vice versa. It's a crapsack world and there happen to be alot of people here who can actually make a difference and who want to improve the world each in their own way. Laughter just likes to sound important and throw the weight of his experience around. Sure, it can be annoying at times, but no reason to get so upset over.&quot; He mulls it over silently for a moment then says. &quot;If you want respect you allways have to earn it in my experience. And you only get or loose that through action. Loosing your cool like that just makes people think you really have anger issues like a child. Act responsibly and thoughtful. Think of the bigger consequences of your actions and don't get flustered easily and people will start respecting you for the man you are.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1131211-flintys-homebrew-hub-2e\" target=\"_blank\">My Mage 2e Homebrew</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5241-flinty","name":"Flinty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"793"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-02T14:37:35-08:00","id":1172753,"title":"","content":"&quot;When someone disrespects me, I don't allow it. I will fight for my respect. And you are his crew. I am the one out of place. Hey, taste this and tell me what you think.&quot; Taking a clean spoon he takes out a bit for Lesson to try.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7592-wtaylorjr2001","name":"wtaylorjr2001","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"261"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-02T14:45:08-08:00","id":1172755,"title":"","content":"He takes the spoon and takes a sip. &quot;This is.... amazing. Wow.&quot; he says, clearly impressed. &quot;Brute force doesn't get you respect, only fear at best. There's other ways to fight for the respect than getting into their face. Just isn't smart. And that ego of yours is going to get you dead at some point. Not because of Laughter, but what if some Dragonblood is giving you lip? You just going to stand there and get in his face too?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1131211-flintys-homebrew-hub-2e\" target=\"_blank\">My Mage 2e Homebrew</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5241-flinty","name":"Flinty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"793"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-02T15:03:49-08:00","id":1172761,"title":"","content":"&quot;I will never put myself in a position where a dragonblood, an anathema, or a man will have power over me.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7592-wtaylorjr2001","name":"wtaylorjr2001","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"261"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-02T15:14:32-08:00","id":1172765,"title":"","content":"&quot;That wasn't really the question. I was asking what you would do if a dragonblood was showing you disrespect on the open street?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1131211-flintys-homebrew-hub-2e\" target=\"_blank\">My Mage 2e Homebrew</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5241-flinty","name":"Flinty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"793"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-02T15:26:11-08:00","id":1172769,"title":"","content":"Scholar smiles at Lesson, &quot;Lesson, go back to your boss. I have work to do here and I need my concentration.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7592-wtaylorjr2001","name":"wtaylorjr2001","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"261"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-02T15:41:05-08:00","id":1172775,"title":"","content":"He frowns. &quot;I allready told you I'm not working for him. No idea why you don't believe me. I'm not here as part of some scheme. Just trying to give you some advise. And no I'm not trying to tell you what to do. I'm not trying to control you. But I lived on the street for a long time. I know what it's like to nearly starve and I know what it feels like to loose people. The rage. Frankly there's people I think about stabbing to death everyday. But I'm not just walking over there and try to do so. Because that's not smart. That's how you die. Knew a kid in the neighbourhood who was a bit like you. Idealistic. Forthright. Hell, he even had a sister too. Used to hang out and play skipping pebbles together. Whatever. My point is he got stabbed to death because he didn't know when to take a hit and knuckle under. Think of people like blades. You make a sword out of pure iron? That's brittle. Hard sure, but it'll break when put to the test. A good blade's flexible. Gives way now so it can cut later, yeah? It's good if you have your principles, but if your first and only reflex is confrontation it's just going to get you killed and leaves your goals unfinished.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1131211-flintys-homebrew-hub-2e\" target=\"_blank\">My Mage 2e Homebrew</a>","edited":{"userid":5241,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5241-flinty","user":"Flinty","date":". 01-02-2018, 07:16 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5241-flinty","name":"Flinty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"793"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-02T16:11:40-08:00","id":1172788,"title":"","content":"&quot;I'm sorry. This is a little trying for me. Thank you for your advice. I appreciate it, I really do. But I want to get to work and finish up here and the quartermasters station.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7592-wtaylorjr2001","name":"wtaylorjr2001","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"261"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-02T16:13:21-08:00","id":1172791,"title":"","content":"&quot;Yeah. Sorry to bother you, just... give it a thought ok?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1131211-flintys-homebrew-hub-2e\" target=\"_blank\">My Mage 2e Homebrew</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5241-flinty","name":"Flinty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"793"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-02T19:03:35-08:00","id":1172818,"title":"","content":"Inside the kitchen, Essen assists Scholar in his high-speed cooking, as a yawn erupts from the corridor and Rose enters the room, holding several dead seabirds.<br /> <br /> &quot;Evening, Lessons. Lookit! The sailors taught me how to sling! I even hit some birds, and they helped me net them in, too! It was really fun! See, see?&quot; she beams, presenting her bounty to him proudly.<br /> <br /> Essen stares at her for a moment, as the two women are locked in a tense battle for a moment, before Rose swallows and turns to turns to Lessons, whispering, &quot;Lessons, she's <i>staring</i> at me. How do I let her down that I'm not into other girls?&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Oh,&quot; was the sole reply, and Essen stalked back to her prior spot, her hands a whir as she continued to slice and dice everything from tomatoes, crab meat, to even things Scholar wasn't using, like white radish and parsley.<br /> <br /> With that settled, the tension in the room relaxes as everyone seems to have their bad feelings aired. What will you do?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-02T19:09:04-08:00","id":1172820,"title":"","content":"For the last time Scholar goes into his quartermaster office and checks for orders. Does he need to do any clothe, armor, weapon repairs, and if no he goes to the cargo hold where the warstrider is.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7592-wtaylorjr2001","name":"wtaylorjr2001","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"261"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-02T19:15:15-08:00","id":1172822,"title":"","content":"He watches the short exchange between the two women and shakes his head. &quot;I have no idea what just happened.&quot; he confesses. Then he takes a closer look at Rose's catch and whistles appreciativly. &quot;Awesome.&quot; he makes a short pause. &quot;Damn, you've got a knack for that kind of thing. Maybe you ought to show me sometime.&quot; He looks back over to Essen. &quot;Don't worry about her,&quot; he says, which between them is code for 'we should keep an eye on this one', &quot;she's a girl we saved from the stake. Not that she needed saving since she's a silver.... Hey Essen, what is the polite term for you? The whole Anathema thing is kind of insulting with the whole demon thing and whatnot.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1131211-flintys-homebrew-hub-2e\" target=\"_blank\">My Mage 2e Homebrew</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5241-flinty","name":"Flinty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"793"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-02T19:15:19-08:00","id":1172823,"title":"","content":"Shining Topaz sits down with the crew to have a good meal.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11917-aranfan","name":"Aranfan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11917_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"503"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-02T19:28:30-08:00","id":1172827,"title":"","content":"&quot;Ye alright, girl? Seemed rather stressed a day.&quot; He says as Topaz sits down at the table<br /> <br /> To avoid another fiasco, if it's not painfully obvious, it's not intended to be demeaning at all.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4017,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4017-angryicecream","user":"angryicecream","date":". 01-02-2018, 10:34 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4017-angryicecream","name":"angryicecream","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-02T19:46:40-08:00","id":1172833,"title":"","content":"(Galley)<br /> <br /> &quot;Oh, it's no worry. I'm new to this all myself. My teacher told me I was a Steward, one of the ranks of the Lunar Vicars, and a handmaiden to the Silver Chair. Any of those are fine. It's better than what my master called himself, anyways...Void Lord, No-Face, Lunar Gladii....I sometimes wonder if he was just glad to have me around so he'd have an excuse to talk,&quot; Eseen said, smiling.<br /> <br /> Rose looked quizzically at Essen and back to Lessons, &quot;What's she even going on about?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1586,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","user":"Dietaku","date":". 01-02-2018, 11:18 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-02T19:50:16-08:00","id":1172835,"title":"","content":"&quot;Ok, well that's a lot, yeah. So that. You're planning to stay, I take it?&quot;<br /> He turns back to Rose: &quot;She's an exalt. Can turn her arms into tentacles.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1131211-flintys-homebrew-hub-2e\" target=\"_blank\">My Mage 2e Homebrew</a>","edited":{"userid":5241,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5241-flinty","user":"Flinty","date":". 01-02-2018, 11:20 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5241-flinty","name":"Flinty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"793"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-02T19:50:17-08:00","id":1172836,"title":"","content":"It is night and Scholar finished working on the warstrider. He gets off the ship and heads towards the coast. This will definately break him. He is tired from a full days work. But he has wanted a tidemare for a very long time. This ritual will take a long time. It will take four hours to complete. He wades out into the water and he fills the palms of his hands with water while speaking in old realm. He begins his chanting ritual. The first hour was grueling. He was tired and it was late. He describes the elemental he was here to create. The second hour was easier, somehow he caught his second wind. The thought of a friendly tidemare to be his friend and confidant bouyed him. The last hours flew by. <br /> <br /> &quot;I would have you serve me loyally for a year and a day. With these words I bind you to me. I choose you.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7592-wtaylorjr2001","name":"wtaylorjr2001","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"261"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-02T20:11:10-08:00","id":1172847,"title":"","content":"(Scholar)<br /> <br /> There's a deep rumbling, and the tide swells, bubbling menacingly as a huge wve blows up from the deep....and a tiny chariot pulled by a surfboard swells up from the surf. Off this odd vehicle ambles a small bipedal horse, with sea-green, scaly skin, and small fins across their back.<br /> <br /> &quot;Who's that elemental? It's Pool Pinto! Nice t'meet'cha, Lord Sorcerer! What is my task?&quot; it whinnies, hooves to hips in a quite dashing pose.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-02T20:26:12-08:00","id":1172851,"title":"","content":"&quot;We are going to be good friends Pool Pinto. I am The Scholar of the Golden Owl. We have just one more thing to do and you will be my special friend.&quot; With that Scholar looks around one last time to make certain no one is around, and then he channels energy through his anima to encompass Pool Pinto making her his familiar. When that is done he runs up to her saying, &quot;Let me in and lets see the under water lands. I want to see the fish and plants beneath the sea.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":7592,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7592-wtaylorjr2001","user":"wtaylorjr2001","date":". 01-02-2018, 11:30 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7592-wtaylorjr2001","name":"wtaylorjr2001","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"261"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-02T20:27:00-08:00","id":1172852,"title":"","content":"(Galley)<br /> <br /> Rose nods slowly,&quot; Oh, that's nice.....Wait. Tentacle arms. Isn't that an Anathema....&quot;<br /> <br /> Her face slowly drains of color, before she coughs and bows to Essen,&quot; Please be gentle. I'm not a good fighter, and I'd only get hurt. Just spare my life and I'll think of Lord Sextis Jylis, okay? Then you can go off and kick puppies or whatever, and we can both be happy, right? You get what you want, and I get to live?&quot;<br /> <br /> Essen arches a brow, before turning to Laughter,&quot; If it pleases you, Master, I would like to stay in your company for a little while longer. I'm wondering how much I can make this one do.&quot;<br /> With that, Rose sat back up like a shot, coughing as if no one was the wiser to her gaffe, as she asked a single question to the group,&quot; So, we're just letting an Anathema be in our company, then?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-02T20:33:28-08:00","id":1172855,"title":"","content":"&quot;Well whatever should we do?! Clearly she will murder all of us if we displease her.&quot; Lessons says throwing up his arms in mock desperation.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1131211-flintys-homebrew-hub-2e\" target=\"_blank\">My Mage 2e Homebrew</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5241-flinty","name":"Flinty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"793"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-02T20:35:51-08:00","id":1172856,"title":"","content":"&quot;Aye, truly we're doomed to be drowned at sea. But, we knew that anyway so it changes little.&quot; He says first to Rose since she seems quite a bit more panicked than Essen then turning his attention to the latter &quot;Stay as long as ye like, darlin'. Want ye around at least long enough to pay off the talents but I don't think that'll take ye long at all.&quot; He says, downing a tankard &quot;It would truly be a heart breakin' shame if ye left soon after.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4017,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4017-angryicecream","user":"angryicecream","date":". 01-02-2018, 11:49 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4017-angryicecream","name":"angryicecream","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-02T20:39:52-08:00","id":1172857,"title":"","content":"(Beach) <br /> <br /> Pool Pinto nods and spins about,&quot; You won't regret recruiting me, nossir! I'm level 99, with all skills maxxed! I know Amrita, Meigdoloan and even Samecarm! Anyways, you want to go underwater? Okay!&quot;<br /> <br /> Pool Pinto directs Scholar onto her odd vehicle, as she hops on top of Scholar;s head.<br /> <br /> &quot;Okay! I'll help you breath and stuff!&quot; she whinnies as the vehicle descends into the depths. Chilly water covers Scholar like a blanket, but sure enough, he can breathe. He sees an impressive coral reef as the pair slowly giide forward. Well? Where to now? Deeper in? Around the Coast?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-02T20:43:21-08:00","id":1172859,"title":"","content":"&quot;Deeper let's see whats down there,&quot; he says excitedly. He then makes the mistake of getting comfy and begins falling asleep. He is both excited and exhausted, though he feels safe.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7592-wtaylorjr2001","name":"wtaylorjr2001","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"261"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-02T21:15:17-08:00","id":1172881,"title":"","content":"&quot;Comrades!&quot; Diane shouts, kicking down the door to the galley, carrying upon her back a quite ugly derphin. She slams the dead porpoise upon a table and gestures to it magnificently, saying, &quot;Lord Corvolo has bestowed upon me a glorious porpoise! Now, help me clean the beast,&quot; Diane continues as she collects an impressive array of cutlery, &quot;There's good eat's on one of these, and I want to make it's head into a hat!&quot; <br /> <br /> With that last exclamation, she grins at her comrades and, socially oblivious gal that she is, finally notices the tension coming from Rose. &quot;Huh? Is something going on?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-02T21:17:00-08:00","id":1172884,"title":"","content":"&quot;God Dammit, woman! Me door! Why must ye always damage me beautiful ship every time ye find a fish!?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4017-angryicecream","name":"angryicecream","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-02T21:20:37-08:00","id":1172888,"title":"","content":"&quot;I stand corrected. Maybe she would kill us all if we don't manage to kill ourselves by accident one of these days.&quot; Lessons says with a small smile.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1131211-flintys-homebrew-hub-2e\" target=\"_blank\">My Mage 2e Homebrew</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5241-flinty","name":"Flinty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"793"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-02T21:21:03-08:00","id":1172889,"title":"","content":"&quot;IT'S A PORPOISE! HOW DARE YOU CALL THE HOLY CHILD OF THE FATHER OF THE DEEPS A FISH!&quot; Diane shouts. From her tone, one could gather that this is quite often a point of contention between her and Laughter","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-02T21:23:15-08:00","id":1172892,"title":"","content":"&quot;LAST I HEARD CORVOLO WAS A WHALE! THAT DONT LOOK LIKE NO WHALE TO ME!&quot; He says, returning the shout, happy to have a break in tension after such a long day","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4017-angryicecream","name":"angryicecream","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-02T21:25:56-08:00","id":1172894,"title":"","content":"Rose shudders, before whispering to Diane,&quot; That woman is an Anathema, friend Diane! We're all in terrible danger! Not only of losing our lives, but this wonderful porpoise you've bestowed upon us. &quot;<br /> <br /> Under her breath, you can hear Rose repeating a mantra, &quot; Lo and Sextus Jylis said to us, &quot;Baldness is a crime. But shave, ye, fair maidens. Thou knowst what I speak of. Yeah, and Bathe, too. And Lo, did Paisap declare,&quot; Brother...That is shameful to say in public,&quot; even as he cradled yon tiny blonde babe...&quot;<br /> <br /> This goes on for a long time...<br /> <br /> Truly, Rose has her priorities right and true. Sextus Jylis knows how to pick 'em....Yep.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1586,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","user":"Dietaku","date":". 01-03-2018, 12:29 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-02T21:28:07-08:00","id":1172895,"title":"","content":"&quot;Say Diane, what's the best way to hunt and kill an octopus? Just asking for friend.&quot;<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1131211-flintys-homebrew-hub-2e\" target=\"_blank\">My Mage 2e Homebrew</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5241-flinty","name":"Flinty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"793"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-02T21:35:21-08:00","id":1172899,"title":"","content":"&quot;Porpoises is just whales with funny faces,&quot; Diane grumbles at Laughter, before perking up at Rose's revelation, &quot;That right? What type of Anathema? My great-uncle Flynn said he met Mejan Flesh-weaver once, but he was always full of shit so I never believed him.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-02T21:42:07-08:00","id":1172903,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Flinty</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1171397-ic-exalted-3e-the-pirates-of-the-gilded-throne?p=1172895#post1172895\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&quot;Say Diane, what's the best way to hunt and kill an octopus? Just asking for friend.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;Octopuses?&quot; Diane seethes, &quot;They're like the squirrels of the deep. Foul abominations, birthed from the mind of something too mad for man to comprehend.&quot; <br /> <br /> Diane shudders as she continues, &quot;Much like the foul squirrel, you must trap the octopus were it has no method of escape; a cave, or hole in the ground. One you do, you trap it with nests, and then stab with spears until the foul beast beats its last. Finally, you cook it in oil, with bit of vinegar and citrus, for until it has been burned and consumed, you can never truly know it hasn't survived.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-02T21:43:19-08:00","id":1172904,"title":"","content":"&quot;Dangerous as squirrels ye say? Do they store human bones in piles in the ocean depths like the squirrels do in trees?&quot; He seems in good humor, rather than actually upset about her kicking open doors. Not like it's hard to fix with a twilight on board.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4017,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4017-angryicecream","user":"angryicecream","date":". 01-03-2018, 12:49 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4017-angryicecream","name":"angryicecream","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-02T21:45:39-08:00","id":1172907,"title":"","content":"&quot;Mhhm. Well we do have everything we need ingredient wise.&quot; He says eying Essen. &quot;And she does look quite tastey. What do you think Laughter, I need your expert opinion here.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1131211-flintys-homebrew-hub-2e\" target=\"_blank\">My Mage 2e Homebrew</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5241-flinty","name":"Flinty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"793"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-02T21:47:47-08:00","id":1172910,"title":"","content":"&quot;Essen snorts, muttering something under her breath about the &quot;Cetacean Agenda,&quot; and how Lady Skwoor'Hyuuuuuuz will hear of this, and Diane will get like, so much hate mail from the cephalopod gods now, before hearing the banter turn to her and she perks up, giggling,&quot; Oh, you! I'm just an average girl, you don't need to stab me with spears! Besides, I can bite through the whaler's lances, anyways,&quot; she beams , revealing a pristine smile of rather impressive teeth.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1586,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","user":"Dietaku","date":". 01-03-2018, 12:50 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-02T21:48:06-08:00","id":1172911,"title":"","content":"Diane gives Essen an appraising look, &quot;Ah, that explains the blue rings, eh? So do you know Mejan Flesh-Weaver? He's had dealings with my people form time to time. Made a bit of an impression.&quot;<br /> <br /> She turns to Laughter, pointing accusatorily, &quot;Dinae you take that tone wi' me. Squirrels is right deadly buggers. Fell beasts that was birthed from the blackest depths of the far-away. And Octopusses are just as bad. Dead cunning, slippery little buggers. Just when you think you've got 'em pinned... ZOOM! They slip through ya fingers and take one of them with 'em!&quot;<br /> <br /> She pauses, thinking back on what she said, &quot;.... fingers. They take one of yer fingers with 'em&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":155,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","user":"Noodle","date":". 01-03-2018, 12:59 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-02T21:54:14-08:00","id":1172912,"title":"","content":"Lessons mimes taking a piece of paper out of his pants and writes down. &quot;Use lances made out of the magical thingamagins, got it.&quot; He says with a slow nod.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1131211-flintys-homebrew-hub-2e\" target=\"_blank\">My Mage 2e Homebrew</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5241-flinty","name":"Flinty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"793"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-02T22:04:46-08:00","id":1172917,"title":"","content":"&quot;I ave little doubt of the ferocity of the squirrel, I was just makin' an inquiry. Who be Megan Flesh-Weaver?&quot; (Yes, he mispronounced it, not a typo) he looks over at Lessons, &quot;As for ye, a gentleman does not kiss n tell.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4017-angryicecream","name":"angryicecream","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-02T22:10:49-08:00","id":1172918,"title":"","content":"&quot;Essen shakes her head,&quot; I am a disciple to Mazaar Gorren, and am a junior to Kharas Schneider. I sadly, do not know of this Mejan you speak of, And Octopi aren't scary! We-Erm, I mean, they're adorable!&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-02T22:12:23-08:00","id":1172919,"title":"","content":"&quot;To tentacle joke or to not tentacle joke...&quot; Lesson muses. &quot;So you here on some kind of mission for the Will of the Cobra?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1131211-flintys-homebrew-hub-2e\" target=\"_blank\">My Mage 2e Homebrew</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5241-flinty","name":"Flinty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"793"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-02T22:15:16-08:00","id":1172921,"title":"","content":"Essen pouts,&quot; I'm here because this is my home! General Gorren told me to do as I will once my training ended. I assist him as I can, but I can't very well leave my family alone!&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-02T22:16:43-08:00","id":1172922,"title":"","content":"&quot;Yeah, I get that.&quot; he says somewhat distracted, suddenly a bit down.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1131211-flintys-homebrew-hub-2e\" target=\"_blank\">My Mage 2e Homebrew</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5241-flinty","name":"Flinty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"793"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-02T22:26:07-08:00","id":1172926,"title":"","content":"&quot;Well, ye can't stay here unless ye want to live like an outlaw. Have anywhere else in mind fer ye family?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4017-angryicecream","name":"angryicecream","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-02T22:31:14-08:00","id":1172927,"title":"","content":"Essen looks put out, before finally replying,&quot; I know I ought to leave. I ought to let them live their lives in peace. I basically died to them when I fell off that ship. However, I didn't want to admit it to myself, I guess. Still....If you all would have me, I'd be happy to assist you in whatever it is you're doing.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-02T22:35:32-08:00","id":1172929,"title":"","content":"Frustrated that no one seems to want to help her butcher her kill, Diane sets about gutting and butchering the porpoise with practiced precision. &quot;Mejan Flesh-Weaver is one of them Ogre 'Nathemas. When the Forsaken Odal Thousand Fangs attacked Novalesk, my people came to our cousins' aid. But the Ordon, they attacked us, thinking we would be weak with so much of our forces abroad. Mejan Flesh-Weaver came to our aid, Ceryd alone knows why. He called up an army of beasts and kept the Ordon and their metal-men at bay until we returned to push the interlopers from our lands.&quot;<br /> <br /> Diane shrugs, &quot;According to some, he still comes to our forests from time to time, but no one can be sure. Figured if you was a friend of his, you'd be alright.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-02T22:51:27-08:00","id":1172931,"title":"","content":"&quot;They living here on Flotsam?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1131211-flintys-homebrew-hub-2e\" target=\"_blank\">My Mage 2e Homebrew</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5241-flinty","name":"Flinty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"793"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-02T22:52:15-08:00","id":1172932,"title":"","content":"He blinks at her sudden sullenness &quot;I was offerin' to give em a ride somewhere if they wanted out of here. But, if he's rather just leave, then by all means, yer welcome to come with us.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4017-angryicecream","name":"angryicecream","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-02T22:54:45-08:00","id":1172934,"title":"","content":"(Underwater)<br /> <br /> Scholar drifts to sleep, before he finds himself floating underwater on a gigantic pale white rock as a gaunt, pale man with dark circles over his eyes floats nearby.<br /> <br /> &quot;What are you doing so casually in my realm, little one, and why have you brought this Lawgiver?&quot; he asks in a sour tone.<br /> <br /> &quot;I...Well...He asked me to?&quot; Pool Pinto stammers, as the man slowly nods, turning to Scholar.<br /> <br /> &quot;Well, Lawgiver, what is it that you seek in my domain? Wealth? Knowledge? Some twisted form of mate?&quot; the man demands bluntly.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1586,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","user":"Dietaku","date":". 01-03-2018, 01:58 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-03T09:02:30-08:00","id":1173011,"title":"","content":"Scholar was asleep. Scholar woke in a flash as the man spoke to his familiar, where was he. Then he remembered what had happened. His own familiar. When the man spoke to Scholar, his mind was clear and as sharp as a blade cutting through air. What did I want here, he wondered. What drove him to summon his familiar in the first place? What motivated him to get up in the ... he didn't know what time it was as there was no sun.<br /> <br /> &quot;I want beauty. The corals are so alive, the fish beautiful going through life as they were meant to be. As this is your realm, you should feel proud of the results you have created. You have created beauty and you should feel proud. Scholar stands and spreads his hands and continues with, &quot;all of this must have taken time and dedication, knowledge and love, and most definately power beyond what a normal human, and many little gods can produce, and you produced it.&quot;<br /> <br /> Scholar holds the eye of the man and earnestly answers, &quot;in a world of strife and ugliness, with which I shamefully find myself tainted, I have found an oasis of beauty and I feel gratitude at its creator. Beauty is not all that I desire though. I desire allies for me and my ... friends? I would that this beauty can be even more secure and lasting. I have lost my sister and I desire her back. For that I need allies. Other Lawgivers who I have crossed, yet who wait for me now. Honest craftfolk who create wonders and worship the Lord of the Seas. And you, creater and defender of beauty.&quot;<br /> <br /> Scholar pauses to let his words sink in, &quot;I want your friendship.&quot;<br /> <br /> Scholar thinks. He calls upon his Lore of the First Age to help him. What was this area here like in the First Age to give him a clue to what this person would want as well as who he was. He searches his mind for symbols that would bind him to Lawgivers in a good way, in friendship. Until Laughter could do a better job of making friends than he could. Here he was inadequate and he knew it. With his new crafting knowledge and experience from making the fantastic dinner, he would create a true gift from the very sands under his feet. He would create and shape pearl, one the size of his golden statue.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> 9 sux<br /> </div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> &quot;Give me a moment to grant you with something that will make you smile. I might glow a bit.&quot;<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> He uses one silver xp for a major project and Craftsman Needs No Tools.<br /> 11 sux<br /> </div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> He then takes his time to craft the symbol that could bring value to this relationship. He takes two hours of prep and work to allow his Essence energy to replenish. When he feels right, he uses his &quot;mojo&quot; to create a wonderful non magical memory of the past that this man would like.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":7592,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7592-wtaylorjr2001","user":"wtaylorjr2001","date":". 01-03-2018, 12:24 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7592-wtaylorjr2001","name":"wtaylorjr2001","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"261"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-03T15:09:13-08:00","id":1173094,"title":"","content":"Shining Topaz has been eating quietly. Choosing not to partake in the banter and keep her own counsel.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11917-aranfan","name":"Aranfan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11917_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"503"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-03T18:42:43-08:00","id":1173126,"title":"","content":"(Underwater)<br /> <br /> The man watches silently as Scholar creates his trinket and presents it to him, silently taking it, before he guffaws uproariously.<br /> <br /> &quot;My apologies, Lawgiver, it has been an age since I have been asked to become the boon ally of any of your kind,&quot; he states, as the rock beneath you keens loudly.<br /> <br /> &quot;What of that small Lawgiver who tried to harpoon you, Milord?&quot; the rock asks in a nasally tenor voice.<br /> <br /> &quot;Yes, well, her as well. My point stands, although you may be mistaking me for my superior. I am Corvolo Tiresias ab Tak'akzooka, Lord of Whales and Father to Cetaceans. While I patrol the deeps, I do not safeguard the corals any more than you, good sir, safeguard that city, Champoor. Besides, what corals are there?&quot; Corvolo asks, directing Scholar to look beyond the stone once more. When he does so, Scholar realizes that the underwater bluff he thought he was floating above, was in fact, a gigantic whale, and he was in such deep water, his gaze lost sight of the bottom in its inky depths.<br /> <br /> &quot;To lose focus and ease your guard in this realm is to ensure your own demise, young one. However, in light of your bravery, I will accept your request, on one condition: You must slay the Dark Wulf of the Depths. He has slain too many of my children, and he reeks of foul forces that Heaven itself finds abhorrent. Well? What say you, Lawgiver?&quot; Corvolo asks, crossing his arms.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-03T18:59:01-08:00","id":1173130,"title":"","content":"(Galley)<br /> <br /> Essen nods, &quot; Yes. I was borne and raised here. My Dad, Mom, and little brother are all living here as well. I suppose I should just accept that if I stay here, I'll just get them wrapped up in the troubles my powers will bring with it. I do appreciate the offer, though, Master, and will gladly stay with you, in return. However, enough of me, there are more pressing matters. You asked before about the lighthouse and its heart? Well, the light house actually predates Flotsam. No one actually knows who built it, but the fact of the matter is, it doesn't erode and the intricacies of its lamp are so wondrous that it can illuminate the entire bay with just a single candle. The source of the lighthouse to do this is a miraculous crystal, the Heart of the Lighthouse. This crystal amplifies and directs the light source and allows the light house to do its job. However, those blackhearts stole it, and now the entire thing is just a pretty tower sitting there in the bay,&quot; Essen sighs, brushing her mane out of her face.<br /> <br /> &quot;Why not get a new one?&quot; Rose offers, as Essen shakes her head once more.<br /> <br /> &quot;It can't be just any crystal, you need a powerful god to crystallize their power for many months to create such a stone. I suppose if we approached Lord Aulus in Dhaam-Bel, he might do it, but he's also supposed to be really hard to get in contact with. And that's assuming you can dodge his money-hungry priests,&quot; Essen replies.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-03T19:02:59-08:00","id":1173131,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dietaku</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1171397-ic-exalted-3e-the-pirates-of-the-gilded-throne?p=1173130#post1173130\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">(Galley)<br /> <br /> Essen nods, &quot; Yes. I was borne and raised here. My Dad, Mom, and little brother are all living here as well. I suppose I should just accept that if I stay here, I'll just get them wrapped up in the troubles my powers will bring with it.</div> </div> </div> </div>Topaz can't help but wince at this.<br /> <br /> &quot;Any ideas who took the crystal?&quot; She asks.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11917-aranfan","name":"Aranfan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11917_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"503"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-03T19:05:59-08:00","id":1173132,"title":"","content":"&quot;Nothin' wrong with seeing your family Essen.&quot; Lessons says gently. &quot;Just make sure no one connects your name with anything Anathema. You should think of a pseudowhatsitcalled. Another name.&quot;<br /> He turns to Topaz. &quot;Well I mentioned it before. Scuttlebut has it that some guy named the 'Dark Wulf of the Depths', some kinda lord of the dead, has stolen the heart of the lighthouse. Guy says he saw him sail off in the direction of Agricola Island.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1131211-flintys-homebrew-hub-2e\" target=\"_blank\">My Mage 2e Homebrew</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5241-flinty","name":"Flinty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"793"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-03T19:14:33-08:00","id":1173133,"title":"","content":"&quot;Essen shakes her head again,&quot; I don't know who they were, but there was a woman in leathers with a tricorn hat and a trio of sabers she loved to rattle. She also had a gang of mariners along with her, all clothed in bandages and rather clever trousers with lots of pockets. I took out about ten of the bandaged men, and found them to be fumbling if strong fighters. They also all had a lupine emblem on their garb.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-03T19:17:08-08:00","id":1173135,"title":"","content":"&quot;Well sounds like a Wulf at least... you heard of the guy before? Any idea who might know more about him? Where he makes port? And what about that Agricola Island? Is there a port or somethin or is it deserted?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1131211-flintys-homebrew-hub-2e\" target=\"_blank\">My Mage 2e Homebrew</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5241-flinty","name":"Flinty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"793"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-03T19:22:42-08:00","id":1173137,"title":"","content":"As Scholar learns of his second quest, his expression becomes one of deep thought. Using his knowledge of Lore once again as he delves into the past to know anything he can know of this Wulf entity. <br /> <br /> &quot;I thank you for this chance to become friends. Please tell me what you can of this spirit. I need to know how strong it is now. I want to know if I am able to kill this entity. I may need a Dawn Lawgiver to deal with it. Also, does it kill to live or for the joy of killing. In other words does it eat its prey or leave the corpse after it did the ugly deed?&quot;<br /> <br /> Scholar once again holds Corvolo's eyes with his own, &quot;the reason I ask this is if it is obeying natures law of survival, would it be acceptable to you to move the entity to a place that it will never harm one of your children?&quot;<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7592-wtaylorjr2001","name":"wtaylorjr2001","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"261"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-03T19:33:48-08:00","id":1173140,"title":"","content":"(Underwater)<br /> <br /> Corvolo snorts, an impressive feat as he's still underwater,&quot; That....thing isn't a spirit as you would understand it, and he doesn't kill to feed, either. He kills because it delights him to do so. Life itself sickens him, and he seeks to spread his glory through macabre displays of his work. If you need assistance, that is fine, so long as you assist in defeating his foe,&quot; Corvolo replies.<br /> <br /> To gleam anything about the Dark Wulf of the Depths, roll Int+Lore at difficulty 4","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-03T19:43:33-08:00","id":1173141,"title":"","content":"&quot;Do ye know anythin' about his recent activity? Might make it easier to figure out where he'll go next.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4017-angryicecream","name":"angryicecream","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-03T19:43:35-08:00","id":1173142,"title":"","content":"(Shipside)<br /> <br /> Essen ponders for a moment,&quot; Of course. The Dark Wulf was an evil, evil man from the Age before our own. He was a terrible man who fed poor sailors to terrifying sea monsters, stole riches and terrorized the whole of the Dreaming Sea. That is, until the heroic crew of warriors led by the Son of Dan'aad, Kyosuuke the Sailchaser, who chased down his frigate and captured him. He was then hanged for his crimes, his heart cut out, and lances piercing his side to ensure his death. As he was dying, he laughed, promising:<br /> <br /> &quot;You may kill me now, but I will return. Even the Pits of Malfeas won't contain my hate! I'll return and dance on your graves!&quot; he laughed, and they then burned him to be sure,&quot; Essen said darkly, &quot;The worst part is....&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;The worst part?&quot; Rose asked, looking more than a little worried.<br /> <br /> &quot;He came back. Not ten years later, another flying his flag and performing the same deeds appeared. However, after several months, this one disappeared. This has been going on for almost five hundred years now,&quot; Essen said, as a small squeak of firght escaped Rose's lips.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-03T19:44:37-08:00","id":1173143,"title":"","content":"&quot;That thing is then an abomination. it is as good as dead. I will return to my .... friends, and we will deal with it.&quot; <br /> <br /> &quot;Pool Pinto, it is time for us to return to the ship. The ship that you have never seen.&quot;<br /> <br /> Scholar lets Pool Pinto take him almost to the surface. They head back to the city and to the ship.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7592-wtaylorjr2001","name":"wtaylorjr2001","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"261"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-03T19:46:52-08:00","id":1173144,"title":"","content":"&quot;...Weeeeeell. Curious. Any idea where his heart ended up after they cut it from his chest?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1131211-flintys-homebrew-hub-2e\" target=\"_blank\">My Mage 2e Homebrew</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5241-flinty","name":"Flinty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"793"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-03T19:59:14-08:00","id":1173146,"title":"","content":"&quot;It sounds to me like this not be the same man. Just a cunnin' pirate bearin' his mantel. There any reason to suspect otherwise?,","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4017-angryicecream","name":"angryicecream","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-03T20:51:16-08:00","id":1173153,"title":"","content":"(Underwater)<br /> <br /> Corvolo bids Scholar farewell, as he returns to Laughter's ship. Pool Pinto accompanies him on-board.<br /> <br /> (Shipside)<br /> <br /> Essen shook her head,&quot; I don't know if anything was said about his heart, just that he lost it. I dunno if it was someone pretending to be him, either, but I suppose that could be true, too. THe Dark Wulf is used as a fable to scare children, so I guess it's possible.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Well, it works for me....Or, um, it could work,&quot; Rose stated.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-03T20:57:23-08:00","id":1173155,"title":"","content":"He grunts &quot;Well, do he know anythin' else about his activity? Where he likes to hunt, patterns of attack, who mans his vessel?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4017-angryicecream","name":"angryicecream","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-03T20:58:46-08:00","id":1173156,"title":"","content":"&quot;Don't worry. No one expects you to fight this guy.&quot;, Lessons quietly remarks to Rose before turning to everyone. &quot;Shame... the smart thing would probably to find out more about the guy. See if he's legit. Find a weakess and exploit it. But he has the Heart of the lighthouse with him now and who knows what he plans on doing with it. If we waste too much time he may just sell it off or destroy it or whatever. So we might have to take the fight to him early.... if we can't simply steal it back, that is.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1131211-flintys-homebrew-hub-2e\" target=\"_blank\">My Mage 2e Homebrew</a>","edited":{"userid":5241,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5241-flinty","user":"Flinty","date":". 01-04-2018, 12:20 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5241-flinty","name":"Flinty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"793"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-04T05:59:49-08:00","id":1173201,"title":"","content":"&quot;Fighting the Wulf sounds like a good cause.&quot; Topaz ventures, &quot;I'm fine with it.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11917-aranfan","name":"Aranfan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11917_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"503"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-04T09:40:13-08:00","id":1173246,"title":"","content":"Scholar awoke on the ship, Pool Pinto fast asleep at his side. He puts energy into his sense of timing and becomes aware of the exact time of day. It is close to when he usually wakes up. He has to fix breakfast. Not only that, it is crewman Rhy's birthday, and he had planned to make him a nice outfit, one with which he could pick up chicks at the port. <br /> <br /> First things first, he leaves Pool Pinto to sleep and heads to the galley to make breakfast. He would fix a meal of quattle eggs, ham, and potatoes. These eggs, though green, when mixed with certain herbs made it less likely for people to get sick from changes in weather. They were hard to get, fortunately these fish eggs liked the local water climate so he was able to get enough for one day. He added the herbs that would safeguard the crew, and for twenty four hours make them stronger. He set the herbs to simmer in a large pot and went to check his quartermaster station.<br /> <br /> At the station, unexpectedly was crewman Sanders. He was holding his stomach and there was red all over his hands. An accident of some kind. Whatever happened, Scholar would have to deal with the injury first, forgetting everything else. He put healing herbs and wrapped the wound after washing it with other healing herbs. He then game him bark to chew on for the pain.<br /> <br /> He went back to the kitchen to find that the herbs had simmered too long. The medicinal effect would be there but the taste would be off. He did his best to finish up a good meal, but it was off. <br /> <br /> Scholar goes to the morning meeting and informs the captain of the &quot;accident&quot;. He doesn't have much information on it, but it looks like it may not have been an accident. His projections on food and medicine was food will last for thirty days, but medicine was lacking, they had not gotten much.<br /> <br /> He tells that he must go to &quot;Agrippa&quot; Island to get wave marble and create the statue in the market, and he must find and kill an evil being that sacraficed human beings for power by the name of Wulf of the depths. He tells the captain what he knows of Wulf and asks for help killing him. He is offensive to the Unconquered Sun, so Scholar wants him dead. The rewards were a letter of marque from the Duke, and the friendship of Corvolo, a mighty creature of the sea.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7592-wtaylorjr2001","name":"wtaylorjr2001","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"261"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-06T19:56:25-08:00","id":1173907,"title":"","content":"&quot;I already have the friendship of Lord Corvolo, but I am willing to perform a favor for a friend,&quot; Diane says. She holds up the Derphin skull to Scholar, &quot;Would you mind making me an awesome hat out of this?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-06T19:59:12-08:00","id":1173908,"title":"","content":"(Shipside)<br /> <br /> &quot;I dunno.. The stories say he usually shows up out of the fog, then rains death down upon his prey with Novaleski Fire. He then boards them and steals whatever he can, or whoever he can. That's usually how it happens. He's usually in the central area of the Dreaming Sea, too. He avoids the western areas, near Prasad, especially,&quot; Essen says.<br /> <br /> &quot;That's good to know,&quot; Rose says, nodding, and you can already suspect what her plan is going to be.<br /> <br /> So, what are you going to do?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-06T20:02:42-08:00","id":1173910,"title":"","content":"&quot;Well as I said, we may not have much time, unless we want to find or build a replacement for this Lighthouse heart. I say we sail for Agricola tomorrow, try to go to shore without being seen and then take a look at what the hell is going on there. If he really is there... well can see if we can steal the thing back or lay an ambush, depending on the situation.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1131211-flintys-homebrew-hub-2e\" target=\"_blank\">My Mage 2e Homebrew</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5241-flinty","name":"Flinty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"793"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-06T20:06:38-08:00","id":1173912,"title":"","content":"&quot;Aye. Sounds like a plan. Anyone seen Scholar? He ought to get started on reinforcin' the maiden's flame retardant.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4017-angryicecream","name":"angryicecream","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-06T20:17:56-08:00","id":1173914,"title":"","content":"Topaz nods assent for the plan.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11917-aranfan","name":"Aranfan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11917_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"503"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-06T20:18:57-08:00","id":1173915,"title":"","content":"Scholar takes the skull from Dianne and turns it over in his hands imagining good things he could make from it. He also listens to what the others are saying. He remembers all of the outfits Dianne has worn and patiently comes up with a style that will go with most, if not all. <br /> <br /> When Laughter mentions Flame Retardant he considers for a moment and says, &quot;I can create something like a balm to coat the decks and outer sides of the ship. The crew can apply it in a few hours.At least I think I can, might need to get more herbal ingredients though.<br /> <br /> He turns back to Diane and says, &quot;I can make a few possible designs with this. I can also make a mystical helm, but that might take a long time. Off the cuff maybe a month maybe more. And can't guarantee anything other than I will do my best. Which do you choose? &quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7592-wtaylorjr2001","name":"wtaylorjr2001","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"261"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-06T20:26:59-08:00","id":1173918,"title":"","content":"&quot;I was just thinking of a snazzy hat,&quot; Diane says, &quot;but if you want to make something mystical, I won't say no...&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-06T20:56:45-08:00","id":1173925,"title":"","content":"Very well, gents....<br /> <br /> It is now the next day, in the early morning haze. The glow of the sun is breaking the night, but the SUn has not yet risen. You have set out sailing towards Agricola, using the chart that Jenkins provided.<br /> <br /> Roll Wits+Sail","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1586,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","user":"Dietaku","date":". 01-07-2018, 12:39 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-06T21:00:11-08:00","id":1173927,"title":"","content":"Diane gets 3 successes on 7 dice.<br /> <br /> She will keep to the crows nest, keeping watch with her keen sight.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":155,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","user":"Noodle","date":". 01-07-2018, 12:06 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-06T21:06:17-08:00","id":1173930,"title":"","content":"Congratulations, you avoid the shoals. Now, you see land. Wait, what's that nearby the far-off island?<br /> <br /> Roll Perc+Awareness if you wish.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-06T21:09:46-08:00","id":1173931,"title":"","content":"&quot;Oi! Diane! What be that?&quot; He yells pointing off to a distant object while squinting through a... For the life of me I cant remember what those lens things they used are called.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4017-angryicecream","name":"angryicecream","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-06T21:20:49-08:00","id":1173934,"title":"","content":"Diane peers out unto the distance, attempting to identify the island. She gets 4 successes.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-06T21:22:01-08:00","id":1173935,"title":"","content":"Scholar does the same also with 4 successes","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7592-wtaylorjr2001","name":"wtaylorjr2001","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"261"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-06T21:24:39-08:00","id":1173936,"title":"","content":"The Island is indeed Agricola island, with the towering central mountain of Fountain Peak. However, on the shore you see a large black trireme....Oh dear. What will you do now?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-06T21:40:44-08:00","id":1173937,"title":"","content":"Assuming someone tells Laughter this, he slowly draws his blade and as he does so the air immediately begins thickening, soon gentle waves of fog overtake the deck of the ship, smothering the light as the bank slowly puahes forward swallowing ship and island both","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4017-angryicecream","name":"angryicecream","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-06T21:48:28-08:00","id":1173942,"title":"","content":"Very well....<br /> <br /> As you approach the island, you don't notice any movement from the shore....<br /> <br /> Wait, is that? <br /> <br /> Roll Perc+Awareness","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-06T21:57:23-08:00","id":1173945,"title":"","content":"Diane activates Keen Sight Technique for 6m, 1wp to keep in indefinite, providing a -1 difficulty to see through the fog. She rolls 10 dice and got 5 successes.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-06T21:59:42-08:00","id":1173946,"title":"","content":"Scholar invites Diane onto Pool Pinto's vehicle with him and we all sink beneath the waves, after Scholar runs to his cabin and picks up and awakens his familiar. Scholar looks at the ship from beneath as he sees wulfs ship.<br /> <br /> &quot;I just came up with an idea. When we are done scouting, we might try sinking wulf's ship,&quot; he says to Dianne.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7592-wtaylorjr2001","name":"wtaylorjr2001","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"261"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-06T22:01:50-08:00","id":1173947,"title":"","content":"Scholar and Diane both hear it....the scraping and creaking of the ship as a series of bandaged figures slowly rise out of the waves, clawing their way onto the deck....They look up at the crew who spies them with hollow eyes and panting gasps.<br /> <br /> What will you do?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1586,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","user":"Dietaku","date":". 01-07-2018, 01:06 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-06T22:13:30-08:00","id":1173952,"title":"","content":"&quot;Stand to!&quot; Diane shouts, &quot;We're being boarded&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-06T22:16:36-08:00","id":1173953,"title":"","content":"Very well....Roll Join Battle!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-06T22:16:43-08:00","id":1173954,"title":"","content":"&quot;Pool Pinto can you use your poisonous spines to get as many of them as possible,&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7592-wtaylorjr2001","name":"wtaylorjr2001","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"261"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-06T22:20:38-08:00","id":1173955,"title":"","content":"&quot;ALL HANDS ON DECK, ME BOYS, SHOW THESE LOUTS WHAT WE THINK OF BOARDERS!&quot; He bellows, crashing his blade down in an arc to cleave one of the boarder's head in twain before he can pull himself all the way up or defend himself.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4017-angryicecream","name":"angryicecream","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-06T22:28:24-08:00","id":1173957,"title":"","content":"Pool pinto looks up at Scholar, giggling,&quot; Oh, Maaaaaaaster~! To brazenly ask to see a lady's tail! Well, since you asked.&quot;<br /> <br /> Pool Pinto expands into a gigantic bipedal horse monstrosity with a scything tail, with cruel barbs that could definitely run a man through.<br /> <br /> &quot;Here it is, Master! This is my lovely taaaaaail~!&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-06T22:29:44-08:00","id":1173958,"title":"","content":"Hearing the shouts, Lessons palms one of his knives and crouches down between two crates, surveying the deck, ready to strike as it becomes necessary.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> Starting Initiative 11, 8 successes on establishing stealth. 9m personal spent </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1131211-flintys-homebrew-hub-2e\" target=\"_blank\">My Mage 2e Homebrew</a>","edited":{"userid":5241,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5241-flinty","user":"Flinty","date":". 01-07-2018, 01:43 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5241-flinty","name":"Flinty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"793"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-06T22:30:34-08:00","id":1173959,"title":"","content":"Scholar's brown skin reddens.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7592-wtaylorjr2001","name":"wtaylorjr2001","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"261"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-06T23:19:58-08:00","id":1173971,"title":"","content":"Diane activtes Sensory acuity prana. Rolling 9 dice, she gets 3 successes","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-07T07:12:10-08:00","id":1174015,"title":"","content":"Topaz draws the slashing sword at her hip and readies herself for battle.<br /> <br /> (OOC: 6 sux on 12 dice. So 9i to start with.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11917-aranfan","name":"Aranfan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11917_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"503"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-07T13:35:20-08:00","id":1174123,"title":"","content":"Keeping to the shadows, Lessons trys to get a good look at the situation, but can't make a damn thing out in this dense fog. Muttering a quick curse under his breath he freezes when he realizes where he took cover. Next to him stands a barrel of whale oil, used to light up lamps and more slippery than a realm official. Quickly he unscrews the cap and then goes to his knees wrapping his arms around the barrel. He heaves and slowly lifts the barrel, holding it up over the railing and pouring slippery oil down the side of the ship, over the hull and the climbing assailants. Let's see how they're going to board the ship now! This should slow them down on this side of the ship and give the others an opportunity to deal with the other front.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> Lessons tries to get any more specifics about their opponents and the strategic position on board and fails his reflexive perception roll (damn mist!). Without any more information he attempts to slow down/throw off the asscent of the bandaged assailants by making the hull extra slick with some whale oil. Incidentially this also means they will burn rather well (unlike the Orichalcum hull). 2 successes on a feat of strength 3+ for lifting a barrel. I figured doing so may be a miscellaneous action, though I could see this task continue for another round or two.<br /> <br /> Initiative as far as I've figured it out:<br /> Lessons 11<br /> Princess 9<br /> Laughter and Scholar 8<br /> Diane 6<br /> Pool Pinto 5<br /> Evil Things (presumably?) 3<br /> Essen ???<br /> Rose ???<br /> Sailors ???<br /> </div></div> </div> </div><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1131211-flintys-homebrew-hub-2e\" target=\"_blank\">My Mage 2e Homebrew</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5241-flinty","name":"Flinty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"793"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-09T16:59:40-08:00","id":1174696,"title":"","content":"Essen bulges with unnatural muscle as her form shifts to that of a towering purple-skinned humanoid with slick, moist skin, twin large tentacles emerge from her hips along with another pair on her shoulders, as a water jet pops out from the small of her back. Then then adjusts her weight to assume a calculated fighting stance. She roils 2 suxx on her join battle roll.<br /> <br /> Therefore, the initiative totals are:<br /> <br /> Lessons 11<br /> Princess 9<br /> Laughter and Scholar 8<br /> Diane 6<br /> Pool Pinto and Essen 5<br /> Evil Things as they're being called: 3<br /> <br /> Rose is asleep below decks in her stateroom; she won't be ready at the moment for battle.<br /> <br /> As Lessons begins his act of sabotage, he barely manages to raise the barrel, but as he does so, some of the oil sloshes onto the deck about him -best be careful about that. He can see it slow the ascent of the boarders, but to ensure its full efficacy will indeed require further turns of action.<br /> <br /> Topaz's turn now.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-09T18:11:26-08:00","id":1174722,"title":"","content":"Topaz charges at the boarders, her sword opening the throat of one, before it twirls to run another through. Topaz is not quite a dervish, but she is slaying or incapacitating the boarders nearly as quickly as they come on.<br /> <br /> (Withering attack. 6m from persona for Excellent Strike and Fire and Stones Strike.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11917-aranfan","name":"Aranfan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11917_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"503"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-09T18:37:57-08:00","id":1174730,"title":"","content":"Topaz's fierce assault scythes down the boarders, as they collapse into burning piles of hacked pieces. The boarders momentarily pause, before their chanting begins anew and they resume their action.<br /> <br /> Laughter and Scholar's turns....","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-09T18:40:12-08:00","id":1174731,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>angryicecream</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1171397-ic-exalted-3e-the-pirates-of-the-gilded-throne?p=1173955#post1173955\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&quot;ALL HANDS ON DECK, ME BOYS, SHOW THESE LOUTS WHAT WE THINK OF BOARDERS!&quot; He bellows, crashing his blade down in an arc to cleave one of the boarder's head in twain before he can pull himself all the way up or defend himself.</div> </div> </div> </div>Just a bit out of order. Same action as before.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> With Excellent Strike from periph </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4017-angryicecream","name":"angryicecream","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-09T19:07:42-08:00","id":1174734,"title":"","content":"Laughter's strokes deftly strike down the boarders as they leap aboard. <br /> <br /> It is now Scholar's turn.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-10T19:40:58-08:00","id":1175065,"title":"","content":"Standing on Pool Pinto's vehicle, while in the water, Scholar watches the entities climb the sides of the ship. Scholar turns to his familiar and says, &quot;Can you please take your beautiful tail and sweep back and forth knocking those scalers back intothe waters. I wan't to give our men time to prepare for the attack. Scholar watches very carefully. Should the creatures hurt Pool Pinto the order will be to dive under the sea.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7592-wtaylorjr2001","name":"wtaylorjr2001","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"261"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-10T19:50:34-08:00","id":1175067,"title":"","content":"&quot;Very good, Master!&quot; There's one problem! I can't act right now! Still, I'll do as you command when I can!&quot; Pool Pinto declares.<br /> <br /> It is now Diane's turn.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-10T20:50:30-08:00","id":1175078,"title":"","content":"&quot;Avaunt, monsters!&quot; Diane shouts, slicing at the foes with Unlucky End.<br /> <br /> Enhanced with Excellent Strike, Diane gets 5 successes (4 rolled +1 automatic)<br /> <br /> Diane deals 4 damage.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":155,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","user":"Noodle","date":". 01-11-2018, 01:29 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-11T08:37:37-08:00","id":1175182,"title":"","content":"Pool Pinto whinnies triumphantly,&quot; It's my TIME, Master! Time to show off my Stu--&quot; just as she trips, and her tail whips out flatly against the side of the ship, missing the boarders. <br /> <br /> Essen on the other hand assumes a open-handed fighting stance, breathing, as she mutters, &quot; legs loose, body limber, focus the force inside their bodies.&quot;<br /> <br /> She then smashes a nearby boarder, knocking him into his fellows with an open palm strike just before the original victim of her violence erupts into pieces which shred the others. <br /> <br /> Congratulations, the boarders are now defeated, as the stragglers retreat back into the waves. However, as you celebrate the victory, you hear a single low horn note sound out in the mist. Now, what could that mean? <br /> <br /> What will you do?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-11T08:59:24-08:00","id":1175186,"title":"","content":"Laughter pulls out his eye glass and looks first towards the trireme then in general for the dource of the noise, allowing the fog to disperse. This is clearly unhelpful st the moment.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4017-angryicecream","name":"angryicecream","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-11T09:20:48-08:00","id":1175192,"title":"","content":"Laughter, you determine that the source of the noise is a small bandaged mariner on board the trireme, hefting a large horn. You're unsure what it could mean, but a pair of figures hop off the Trireme, one a young woman, the other an older man, about your age.<br /> <br /> What will you do?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-11T09:34:55-08:00","id":1175195,"title":"","content":"&quot;Oi! Essen! Look here, who be they?&quot; He says, handing her the spy glass and aiming it at the trireme. If anyone would recogbize our targets it'd be her.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4017-angryicecream","name":"angryicecream","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-11T09:53:13-08:00","id":1175201,"title":"","content":"Essen stares through the spyglass intently before returning her attention to Laughter,&quot; The woman isn't anyone I know. She's younger than the one I saw at the Lighthouse, and the other....Wait, those weapons, that's Chandra the Devil-Killer, one of the Six Black Heaven Guns. He's a famous exorcist that wanders the South, slaying devils and helping people. He's supposed to be a boon ally of Ahlat and has the fastest draw of anyone alive.&quot;<br /> <br /> Well, this is some news alright. What will you do?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-11T10:00:24-08:00","id":1175207,"title":"","content":"&quot;Great. More Exalts. Just what I needed to keep me ship from bein' mangled. HOIST THAT RAG, BRING US IN CLOSER!&quot; He pulls out a palm sized mirror and starts signalling with pale reflections of light of dawn to the other vessel that they come in peace.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4017-angryicecream","name":"angryicecream","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-11T10:23:07-08:00","id":1175211,"title":"","content":"(Below decks)<br /> <br /> Lessons gently rouses Rose as she sleepily rises.<br /> <br /> &quot;Morning, Lessons! Oh! I had the most wonderful dream! A reeeeeeeeally handsome guy appeared in my dreams! He was wearing some reeeeeeeally weird clothes, too. Like the gauze you see on Chiarascan women, but not as poofy and he had several layers of jackets on. I met him in a brilliant rose garden, and he begged me to help him. He said there's a great treasure on the island and that I need to help him! There are some bad people on the island and he told me that all of Creation could be in trouble if they get it! Lessons, I know I'm no good at fighting. I'm a scaredy-cat and all I can do is dance well, and I can't persuade you otherwise, but please, be careful, okay? The man I saw in my dreams looked really scared and he had this awful wound on his stomach, like someone pierced him with a spear. I-I don't know what I'd do if I lost you,&quot; she said quietly,&quot; I'm sorry, I know that that was a lot all at once.Just, can you promise me that you'll be careful?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-12T12:00:21-08:00","id":1175524,"title":"","content":"&quot;Whoa, hey, morning.&quot;, Lessons says smiling gently, caught of guard by that odd and emotional torrent of words. &quot;I'll be careful, I promise.&quot; he says, &quot;'Sides I'm not really after glory and all that, so no worries I'll run or hide or play dead if I need to.&quot; he gives her an encouraging squeeze of the shoulder. &quot;Weird dream. Something to keep in mind, maybe.&quot; he says turning around to give her some privacy should she care to get dressed. &quot;For now we have other problems though. The ship just got attacked by a horde of bandaged weirdos. No reason to worry, they got their ass beat real quick like, but now there's some other folks incoming. Figured I'd better wake you with all that commotion going on.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1131211-flintys-homebrew-hub-2e\" target=\"_blank\">My Mage 2e Homebrew</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5241-flinty","name":"Flinty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"793"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-12T19:25:09-08:00","id":1175655,"title":"","content":"Assuming we're still a few miles out &quot;Alright, lads! Bring one of them ballistae in in front in case that ship gets any ideas!&quot; And otherwise just to the island, still signalling peace but preparing for battle should they try ramming us for some reason.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4017,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4017-angryicecream","user":"angryicecream","date":". 01-12-2018, 10:29 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4017-angryicecream","name":"angryicecream","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-12T20:42:50-08:00","id":1175668,"title":"","content":"Rose smiles, clearly relieved at Lessons' promise. The pair return above decks to find the crew hefting one of the heavy broadside ballistae forward-ships, presumably to threaten the trireme with. However, as before, neither the trireme nor the pair on the beach offer any signal back. Well, no signal, apart from the low constant droning blasts from the lone sailor on the trireme and his horn. <br /> <br /> What will you do?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-12T21:56:00-08:00","id":1175688,"title":"","content":"I wouldn't assume the trireme (it'd be a significantly smaller vessel even height wise so doubt it could see much on the deck) could even see the ballista until it's turned and aimed at them so not really intended as a threat.<br /> <br /> As for the horn blowing, tapping into his long years of not having time for this god damn shit and mastery at barking orders to sailors on other, often distant boats, Laughter takes a moment to center himself and calmly walks up to the bow of the ship, coughs once to clear his throat, sips a bit a rum to wet the pipes and ever so elegantly screams at the top of his lungs &quot;OI! YE! YEA! YE! YOU'RE CHANDRA, YEA? WHAT ARE YE DOIN' HERE? WHY ARE YE BLOWIN' THE DAMNED HORN? YOU'RE NOT WORKIN' FOR THAT SHIT WULF ARE YE? RIGHT AWFUL OF YE IF YE ARE SUDDENLY!&quot; (No, doesn't think he's working for the wulf, just trying to disarm a potentially nasty situation with a bit of absurdism)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4017,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4017-angryicecream","user":"angryicecream","date":". 01-13-2018, 01:00 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4017-angryicecream","name":"angryicecream","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-12T22:34:41-08:00","id":1175696,"title":"","content":"The trireme is actually a quite large vessel, possessing a much deeper draft than such vessels usually possess, but still, Laughter;s ship still outclasses her in size handily.<br /> <br /> Chandra then looks from his colleague to the sailor blowing the horn on the crow's nest, before returning his gaze to Laughter and replying in his own tenor voice.<br /> <br /> &quot;And what if I am? Who are you, to judge me, good sir? You seem to know my name, but I don't know your's,&quot; he replies, assuming a relaxed stance, his hands slowly settling on his bandoleer.<br /> <br /> Okay, then. What will you do?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-13T10:36:32-08:00","id":1175795,"title":"","content":"&quot;NAME'S LAUGHTER ON THE BREEZE. LOOKIN' FOR SOME STOLEN GOODS. HEARD THEY WERE ROUND THESE PARTS. YE DOIN' THE SAME?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4017-angryicecream","name":"angryicecream","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-14T17:03:00-08:00","id":1176116,"title":"","content":"Chandra arches his brow, a point that is lost somewhat due to the distance between the two men,&quot; Stolen? Good sir, there is naught on this island, but the dead and their riches. The dead hold no sway over this place, so what problem is there if my colleagues and I releive them of it. After all, you can't take it with you,' He called, before he reflexively winced, placing his hand on his brow. However, whatever pain he felt seemed to be momentary, and he returned to his prior nonchalance....<br /> <br /> Well, that was odd. What will you do now?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-14T17:08:37-08:00","id":1176118,"title":"","content":"&quot;The dead hold no sway? Are ye daft? Me ship just had dozens of undead boarders! Do that be what yet drum is for? To keep em at bay?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4017-angryicecream","name":"angryicecream","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-14T18:55:24-08:00","id":1176140,"title":"","content":"&quot;Drum?&quot; Chandra is clearly confused. He turns to his comrade, as she shrugs,&quot; Do you mean the bloke over there with the horn? That's not what he's for, either. He's there to inform the Boss you're here, is all. Now, the real question, is boy-o, what ought I do about you? Will you go home quietly? Or will I need to convince you?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-14T18:58:36-08:00","id":1176141,"title":"","content":"&quot;Well, when ye threaten a man, veiled or otherwise, it's quite unconscionable to just walk away! Tell ye what, how about ye come over here for some rum and brandy and we can discuss this like gentlemen. That way ye don't mar that beautiful vessel of yers for no good reason, aye?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4017-angryicecream","name":"angryicecream","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-14T19:10:51-08:00","id":1176145,"title":"","content":"Chandra turned to his colleague for a moment, muttering something to her, before he turned back to Laughter, nodding,&quot; I've never been one to turn down a drink. I'll be over in a moment.:<br /> <br /> He then strides over the waves as sure as one walking on land, as the tides turn into frost beneath his feet. He calmly walks over to the ship, before leaping aboard.<br /> <br /> &quot;Chandra Coffin-Filler, called the Devil-Killer, at your service,&quot; he says, bowing.<br /> <br /> What will you do now?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-14T19:16:50-08:00","id":1176147,"title":"","content":"Returns the gesture, &quot;Well, I promised ye rum and brandy didn't I? Come on, let's fill ourselves some tankards (because clearly whatever passes for a shot is not enough.)&quot; He says, walking towards his cabin (I assume Essen stopped being a cthulian horror by now, if not would have asked her to turn back when he started walking aboard. She seems smart enough to do it on her own, just figured i'd mention it)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4017,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4017-angryicecream","user":"angryicecream","date":". 01-14-2018, 10:21 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4017-angryicecream","name":"angryicecream","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-14T19:24:17-08:00","id":1176148,"title":"","content":"Once inside he pours him whichever, or both, he prefers and proceeds to down his own first. Showing good faith that it's not laced with poison before flopping into his seat. &quot;So, ye said yer workin' with the Wulf, aye?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4017-angryicecream","name":"angryicecream","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-14T19:26:18-08:00","id":1176149,"title":"","content":"Essen nods and ceases to be the fever dream of a timid man from Massachusetts or the lurid fantasies of high school girls from a far-off island. Either or. Reassuring her normal, plain, human appearance. Nothing weird going on on this ship. Nope.<br /> <br /> Chandra follows Laughter to his cabin, where he pulls up a chair, as Essen trails the pair. No way in the Brass Realms is she going to let this strange man be alone with her Master.<br /> <br /> Chandra follows suit, licking his lips, &quot;That's good. All I've had to drink for the past week is watery piss that my Boss keeps. Presumably for the ratings. He doesn't touch the stuff. As per the question. Yes, I'm working for the Wulf. I've found, that in order to hunt Devils, sometimes one must walk the path of Midnight in order to trail them to back to their lairs. I can tell from your eyes, you know what I mean, as does your woman. She's a fighter. I can tell. Girly, you don't hold your arms like that, unless you want to do butcher work and strangle a bird, or you're fixing to slam me into the floor here. So, let's cut the crap. What are you really here for, then?&quot;<br /> <br /> Essen looks taken aback, muttering something about her posture, before she relaxes, and puts her arms behind her back.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1586,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","user":"Dietaku","date":". 01-14-2018, 10:30 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-14T19:38:25-08:00","id":1176152,"title":"","content":"&quot;I've been honest with ye from the start, mate. We've come for some stolen goods... And rocks to build a statue for some pompous fop, I suppose&quot; he says the latter with a wave of his hand, focusing on other issues &quot;Specifically, the heart of a light house. We heard tell it was brought here. Lot of good men gonna die without that heart.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4017-angryicecream","name":"angryicecream","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-14T23:22:45-08:00","id":1176198,"title":"","content":"Naturally blending in with the others, Lessons followed the pair, keeping quiet and looking plain. He was good at that, looking plain. No reason anyone should take note of such an unimportant man. In fact he was pretty sure even Laughter and Essen had forgotten he was there at all by the time they got to his cabin. Laughter didn't even offer him a drink. Rude bastard.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> activating easily overlooked presence method and tagging along!<br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1131211-flintys-homebrew-hub-2e\" target=\"_blank\">My Mage 2e Homebrew</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5241-flinty","name":"Flinty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"793"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-15T10:41:08-08:00","id":1176319,"title":"","content":"Chandra sighs,&quot; You seem to have a rather....interesting view on the world picture, Ser. You heard that from the privateers in Flotsam? You're going to shed crocodile tears for that band of pirates? What if I told you, boy, that that Heart could light the way to salvation, to a riches that could enliven the entirety of the Dreaming Sea? ANd all we need to do? Is to give up a city filled with pirates, thugs and criminals? Well, I'm not one to talk, but, that seems like a trade to me.&quot;<br /> <br /> What will you do all now?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-15T11:57:23-08:00","id":1176336,"title":"","content":"&quot;Well, I'm certainly listenin' if you'd care to share how that works.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4017-angryicecream","name":"angryicecream","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-15T12:08:15-08:00","id":1176341,"title":"","content":"Chnadra coughs,&quot; There's not much else to say. The Heart is needed for the work my Boss is doing. If he succeeds, then all the pain, suffering, and anguish this part of the world is experiencing, will end, and a new golden land will arrive. Just you see. Thanks f'r the drink. Now, I'll have to take my leave,&quot; Chandra says, rising before nodding at Laughter and Essen<br /> <br /> Chandra begins to make his way out to the deck. If you have anything else to say to him, now would be the time.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-15T12:21:21-08:00","id":1176346,"title":"","content":"&quot;Well, yer bosses glorious vision can't be that great if yer can't even take five minutes out of yer day to explain how. I mean, hell, if it's half plausible I might even go lookin' for the recruitin' office.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4017-angryicecream","name":"angryicecream","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-15T12:27:14-08:00","id":1176347,"title":"","content":"Chandra pauses in his swagger, before turning around on the rail as he grinned,&quot; I'll say this last thing. Yuugo Al-Argentum's treasure is real. My Boss is looking for it, and that Heart, and this island are necessary for this mission. If we succeed in finding it, then all this, all the strife, all the Realm, the Will of Cobra, all of it, will be washed away, and a land of peace will be forged. If that tickles your fancy, then follow me ashore. If not, well, I can understand. Peace is a hard pill to swallow for men like us.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-15T12:34:42-08:00","id":1176350,"title":"","content":"Who is Lessons if not one to take a man up on such generous an offer? That all did sound quite interesting and potentially dangerous. Rose's dream, the hints Five Days Darkness had dropped.... time to see for himself. The black &quot;leather&quot; wrapped around his arms seemed to tighten as Lessons focussed and move not forward but inbetween, vanishing from the real and entering the dark. As Chandra jumps over the rail, Lessons follows, vanishing into the mans shadow before anyone can spot as much as a flicker of movement.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1131211-flintys-homebrew-hub-2e\" target=\"_blank\">My Mage 2e Homebrew</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5241-flinty","name":"Flinty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"793"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-15T13:20:43-08:00","id":1176373,"title":"","content":"&quot;Think ye can hold the ship, lads?&quot; He asks, Topaz (and his crew so it doesn't seem like he's asking a random woman to defend the ship from Exalts (figure she's afk OOC so might as well put her blender ways to work defebding the ship)). Assuming she would say yes then follpwing after Chandra, presumably with Essen","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4017,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4017-angryicecream","user":"angryicecream","date":". 01-15-2018, 05:02 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4017-angryicecream","name":"angryicecream","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-16T16:38:46-08:00","id":1176626,"title":"","content":"(Lessons)<br /> <br /> You trail after Chandra as he walks ashore and returns to the girl's side as she looks at him pensively, as a guttural growl emerges from somewhere nearby.<br /> <br /> &quot;What's with him? Didn't you fee him?&quot; Chandra asks the girl, as she slowly nods.<br /> <br /> &quot;I fed him a little bit ago. Something is making him upset. Boy, what's the matter?&quot; she asks, looking up, as the growling continues, before it halts and a whistling breeze shifts by.<br /> <br /> &quot;He just took off. I think something on this island is making him uneasy,&quot; the girl says, as Chandra shrugs.<br /> <br /> &quot;Whatever you say, Shoat. He's your pet,&quot; Chandra counters, as the pair continue on. They walk for about a mile inland, coming to the base of the towering mountain,where a small camp has been erected, with more bandaged folks milling around, shifting vast quantities of earth, along with several dozen small bear-like bipedal creatures wearing crude shell jewelry and small cloth bands about their arms, as they are forced to move several cartloads of earth. Occasionally, they pause, stealing glances at a grisly marker on the mountain base: a figure long-dead, that has been nailed to the side of the mountain with a wicked-looking crimson spear. Over the corpse's face, a large sign was hung, no doubt detailing this person's crimes.<br /> <br /> What will you do now?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-16T17:39:56-08:00","id":1176633,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>angryicecream</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1171397-ic-exalted-3e-the-pirates-of-the-gilded-throne?p=1176373#post1176373\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&quot;Think ye can hold the ship, lads?&quot; He asks, Topaz (and his crew so it doesn't seem like he's asking a random woman to defend the ship from Exalts (figure she's afk OOC so might as well put her blender ways to work defebding the ship)). Assuming she would say yes then follpwing after Chandra, presumably with Essen</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Topaz nods, &quot;We'll be waiting for your return Captain.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11917-aranfan","name":"Aranfan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11917_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"503"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-16T23:11:20-08:00","id":1176700,"title":"","content":"<i>Yuugo Al-Argentum I presume? Though... weren't you hanged? </i>Lessons thinks.<i> I wonder wether you once were a reeeeeeeeally handsome guy wearing some reeeeeeeally weird clothes in life... </i>he ponders as he sees the spear wound. His eyes wander up to the sign, trying to read it as he follows along in Chandras wake, waiting to see where those two are going.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> 0 successes on Lore if relevant. 2 on Perception to read the sign if relevant.<br /> </div></div> </div> </div><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1131211-flintys-homebrew-hub-2e\" target=\"_blank\">My Mage 2e Homebrew</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5241-flinty","name":"Flinty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"793"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-17T22:37:14-08:00","id":1176889,"title":"","content":"Diane will wait until Lessons et al have gotten a ways ahead, and then will follow, leaping overboard on the opposite side of the ship from the Trireme. <br /> <br /> She gets 1 success to track, should that be necessary. 3 successes to keep to hidden while following.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-18T18:39:22-08:00","id":1177117,"title":"","content":"(Lessons)<br /> <br /> Sadly, you cannot read the sign. It looks like an unfortunate picture of a man having his face eaten by an enthusiastic monkey....or something. Surely, this is the work of evil spirits.<br /> <br /> Maybe if you try a linguistics roll, perhaps at Difficulty 4 you can parse out some semblance of understanding? Maybe? Chandra and the others are merely content to watch the bear-people haul dirt. Something amazing must be nearby. The enroaching fog doesn't seem to faze them, either. Is this normal on this island?<br /> <br /> (Laughter and Diane)<br /> <br /> You arrive ashore, approaching the beach where Chandra and the little girl were. As you continue inland, to the base of the mountain, you spy Chandra and the little girl from before, along with a rather grisly monument on the mountain face As you take it all in, you hear a low guttural growl, although it could just be the wind in the trees. As you take in your surroundings, you begin to notice a fell fog rolling in....<br /> <br /> (Topaz)<br /> <br /> Still aboard the ship, you notice that the fog isn't dissipating. Indeed, it seems to be increasing in potency, and when you look up, you notice that the rising Sun seems to be tinged a bloody crimson through the mist. You hear a stifled shriek of pain, and the deck crew rush to one side, to find Seamen X. Pendable has lived up to his name, and expired. Even more mysteriously, he doesn't have any readily identifiable reason for his death, albeit one can see his veins through his skin and his bloodshot eyes bulging lifelessly.<br /> <br /> What will you do?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1586,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","user":"Dietaku","date":". 01-18-2018, 10:29 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-18T18:52:35-08:00","id":1177122,"title":"","content":"&quot;Hell of a dog ye got that, mate. What's the breed?&quot; He says as he looks into the bushes and presumably can't see the beast","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4017-angryicecream","name":"angryicecream","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-18T19:02:37-08:00","id":1177126,"title":"","content":"Diane will attempt to locate the source and origin of the growling noise. <br /> <br /> Rolling Perception+ Awareness, Diane gets 7 successes.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-18T19:10:21-08:00","id":1177128,"title":"","content":"(Diane and Laughter)<br /> <br /> The growling continues, as Laughter searches the bush for it, until Diane searches above them. There, in the treetops, she sees it. A horrifying sight. Spingly legs, fluting mane along a sloping neck, its head seems too small for its bloodshot eyes and its lolling tongue, hanging from a dropping snout, which has a set of vicious fangs. On its brow are a trio of unnervingly sharp horns, and the entire beast looks slick and greasy as if it had recently taken a bath in ichor or...other unsavory things.<br /> <br /> Essen cries out when she sees it, and it lunges, leaping past her, as Essen's side is torn open, and she staggers down to the ground. The beast spins about on its feet, once more facing the Circle, although seemignly unsure if it should attempt its ambush now that it is known to its prey....<br /> <br /> What will you do?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-18T19:16:01-08:00","id":1177130,"title":"","content":"&quot;Essen! Shit!&quot; He shouts, drawing his blade in a whirling parry against their apparently treacherous host's presumed attack before bringing it crashing down on the beast's exposed spine to give Essen a moment to rescue herself (or play dead)<br /> <br /> Attack roll for 7 successes, 5 minimum damage hit for 3 withering","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4017,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4017-angryicecream","user":"angryicecream","date":". 01-18-2018, 10:59 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4017-angryicecream","name":"angryicecream","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-18T19:19:29-08:00","id":1177131,"title":"","content":"(Laughter and Diane)<br /> <br /> Chandra and Shoat both turn to face you as Shoat brightens,&quot; Oh, Dhampir is looking much better! Look, he's even found a few friends.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Indeed. Let's see if these two can do that much,&quot; Chandra says, leaning against a tree. Apparently, this battle will be against 'Dhampir' and the two of you.<br /> <br /> Very well, then. Roll Join Battle.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1586,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","user":"Dietaku","date":". 01-18-2018, 10:31 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-18T19:36:53-08:00","id":1177136,"title":"","content":"Diane get 7 sux on her join battle roll. <br /> <br /> Diane lunges towards the tricorn dhamphir, aiming for it's torso and attempting to stake the beast to the ground. <br /> <br /> After activating excellent strike on her attack roll, Diane gets a resounding... 2 sux.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":155,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","user":"Noodle","date":". 01-18-2018, 10:46 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-18T19:58:03-08:00","id":1177141,"title":"","content":"Sadly, Diane's blow bounces off the Dhampir's thick hide.<br /> <br /> Laughter's, however, strikes true, and gouges a chunk out of the beast's side. It howls an unnerving keening shriek, before whipping out with a taloned paw at Laughter's head, which then misses, as Laughter ducks out of the way.<br /> <br /> It is now Laughter's turn.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1586,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","user":"Dietaku","date":". 01-18-2018, 11:01 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-18T20:17:40-08:00","id":1177145,"title":"","content":"&quot;That all ye got, ye... Ye... Shit!&quot; He exclaims as he only narrowly dodges the beast's massive claw crashing into his skull. *What the hell is this thing!? I knew letting more Exalts on me ship was a bad idea! I knew it! But, nooo. The last one turned out great it'll be fiiiiine, I thought. What's the worst that could happen, I thought. Cat demons, that's what! * he internally monologues as he side steps the beast bringing his cutlass down on the thing's tendon before once more performing a spinning flurry to catch the its vengeful repost","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4017-angryicecream","name":"angryicecream","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-18T20:32:18-08:00","id":1177149,"title":"","content":"The beast screams as Laughter pushes it back ever further. It is now crashed.<br /> <br /> What will Diane do?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-18T20:50:16-08:00","id":1177153,"title":"","content":"Diane will make a flurry of quick jabs and slashes at the beast's head and neck. Her attacks are not intended to cause damage, but to distract. To get the beast to focus on her, leaving Laughter the freedom to set up a killing blow. That was the way the Vicriuth fought the beasts that invaded their lands from the Wyld. Strike in teams. One getherin draws the attention, another attacks while distracted. Keep shuffling the focus, making for lethal blows while the beast's attention is away...<br /> <br /> This is not a beast from the Wyld, nor is Laughter one of the tea-eaters. But the same principles should do.<br /> <br /> Diane will make a distract gambit on the dhampir. Success transfers 6i to Laughter for an attack on the dhampir next round.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":155,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","user":"Noodle","date":". 01-19-2018, 12:00 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-18T21:21:09-08:00","id":1177165,"title":"","content":"As the beast stumbles to find its balance, laughter takes a running leap towards it, planting his boots on the creatures head, holding on by its horns, waiting for the perfect instant to launch himself in a deadly, whirling crescent at the thing's mistress, essence streaming behind him, emanating the stark white glow of a full eclipse in his wake as his spinning blade deftly removes her head from her body.<br /> <br /> As he lands, he quickly readies his blade again in preparation for Chandra's counterattack<br /> <br /> Thunderbolt Attack Prana+Monkey Leap Technique to launch himself, full excellency to land the hit","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4017,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4017-angryicecream","user":"angryicecream","date":". 01-19-2018, 12:30 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4017-angryicecream","name":"angryicecream","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-18T21:38:58-08:00","id":1177171,"title":"","content":"Lunging at Shoat like a wrothful avenger, Laughter lashes out, slicing Shoat diagonally, as she whimpers, barely able to move before the blade smites her. Immediately, Chandra leaps back, staring at Laughter, before Shoat's body writhes unnaturally. It jerks up at Laughter with dead eyes.<br /> <br /> &quot;You, boy! Your murderous vision is truly something to behold! You didn't even hesitate to kill my dear little pet! That's all she was, savor that bloody rush! However, this does set my research back a bit; to lose both Shoat AND my Tricorn Dhampir the Glacial Tyrant so kindly gave me. Such a shame, such a shame. Know this, Boy. If our paths meet again, then I, the Destitute Nova that Watches down at the Rotten Dharma, will take my pound of flesh from YOU,&quot; her voice cries, before collapsing and evaporating into black flame.<br /> <br /> Chandra then dashes off, as the beast lunges at Diane, raking at her torso with its claws.<br /> <br /> What will you do now?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-19T05:59:57-08:00","id":1177249,"title":"","content":"As Shoat is striken down and Chandra plans to run for the hills his own shadow suddenly seems to warp around him coalescing into a shadowy figure that has wrapped him into chains of black iron. &quot;Not so quickly.&quot; the voice rasps.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> Lessons is an unindentifiable black person thing.<br /> Would like to do a Hold at Bay here, but since he allready joined battle (not against Lessons) that may not be possible. If it is impossible then I'll settle for a grapple (11 successes if 10s count twice, 10 if not, for the martials arts roll for the grapple. Went full excellency.) Not at my regular pc so I can't check the books/couldn't make the rolls in discord. Will be back on Saturday.<br /> </div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1131211-flintys-homebrew-hub-2e\" target=\"_blank\">My Mage 2e Homebrew</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5241-flinty","name":"Flinty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"793"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-19T17:53:28-08:00","id":1177468,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dietaku</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1171397-ic-exalted-3e-the-pirates-of-the-gilded-throne?p=1177117#post1177117\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">(Topaz)<br /> <br /> Still aboard the ship, you notice that the fog isn't dissipating. Indeed, it seems to be increasing in potency, and when you look up, you notice that the rising Sun seems to be tinged a bloody crimson through the mist. You hear a stifled shriek of pain, and the deck crew rush to one side, to find Seamen X. Pendable has lived up to his name, and expired. Even more mysteriously, he doesn't have any readily identifiable reason for his death, albeit one can see his veins through his skin and his bloodshot eyes bulging lifelessly.<br /> <br /> What will you do?</div> </div> </div> </div>Well shit.<br /> <br /> Shining Topaz leans down to examine the body of poor mister Pendable. She also looks for any sign of what happened.<br /> <br /> (Per+Awareness+1m=8d10 -&gt; 2 sux)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":11917,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11917-aranfan","user":"Aranfan","date":". 01-19-2018, 08:57 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11917-aranfan","name":"Aranfan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11917_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"503"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-19T18:08:41-08:00","id":1177476,"title":"","content":"(Lessons)<br /> <br /> Chandra didn't join battle. Your grapple needs a control roll now.<br /> <br /> (Topaz)<br /> <br /> After investigating the body, Topaz notices the strange fact that, despite a lack of wounds, the man died of a lack of blood. As a wise man, the Lord-Scholar Noodle once stated,&quot;Funny thing, that. Not living and not having any blood.&quot;<br /> <br /> There are many mysteries in this world, truly....","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-19T18:12:13-08:00","id":1177477,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dietaku</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1171397-ic-exalted-3e-the-pirates-of-the-gilded-throne?p=1177476#post1177476\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> (Topaz)<br /> <br /> After investigating the body, Topaz notices the strange fact that, despite a lack of wounds, the man died of a lack of blood. As a wise man, the Lord-Scholar Noodle once stated,&quot;Funny thing, that. Not living and not having any blood.&quot;<br /> <br /> There are many mysteries in this world, truly....</div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;Right then.&quot; Topaz turns to one of the other crewmen, &quot;Get the doc.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11917-aranfan","name":"Aranfan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11917_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"503"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-20T19:13:04-08:00","id":1177749,"title":"","content":"Seeing the shadowy figure tackle Chandra to the ground, Laughter takes a brief moment to assess the situation, then goes with his gut, flinging himself back towards &quot;Dhampir&quot; to finish the job before it could hurt anyone else.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> <br /> Using Motive Discerning Technique to replace perc with wits and double 9s. 4 3 motes<br /> Using monkey leap technique to get back spend 1 mote.<br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4017,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4017-angryicecream","user":"angryicecream","date":". 01-20-2018, 10:40 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4017-angryicecream","name":"angryicecream","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-21T13:16:03-08:00","id":1177922,"title":"","content":"&quot;Don't do anything stupid and you may yet just live through this.&quot; The shadow rasps, emphasizing his point by drawing the chain a bit tighter around Chandras neck, demonstrating how easy it would be for him to just snap it.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> Laughter can probably tell that the shadow is vaguely on his side? At least he means him no harm. Full intention would be 'keep Chandra subdued for questioning while they deal with the monkey&quot; but I doubt as exact information could be gathered.<br /> Lessons initiative is 14, should it matter.<br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1131211-flintys-homebrew-hub-2e\" target=\"_blank\">My Mage 2e Homebrew</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5241-flinty","name":"Flinty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"793"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-22T21:48:30-08:00","id":1178345,"title":"","content":"Diane's eyes widen as Laughter ceases his assault on the nercomantic giraffe-wolf that mauled his newest crew-member to brutalize an unarmed child. The shock draws her attention away ... just in time for the dhampir conect with her chest. Winded and reeling from the blow, Diane spares a glance down for an instant. <i>Good, </i>she thinks, <i>the armor did it's job. </i>She steels herself, snarls, and leaps back into the fray. She redoubles her assault on the dhampir, swinging Unlucky End in a tornado of slashes so quick it becomes a blur, the golden arcs of her anima following with a faint halo in its wake. &quot;I've killed bigger than you!&quot; She shouts in a hoarse voice, &quot;I killed worse than you when I was a babe!&quot;<br /> <br /> Diane will make a withering attack on the Dhampir. She will increase her attack by 4 with her excellency, and use Excellent strike. Diane gets a total of 12 successes on accuracy. Assuming it remains having Defense of 6, Soak of 15, Diane hits with 6 threshold successes and deals 4 initiative of damage.<br /> <br /> Should put her back at 4 initiative.<br /> <br /> In the all to likely even that she's attacked, Diane will use her melee excellency to increase her Parry to 8.<br /> <br /> Note: I did not account for any stunt dice in the rolls. Any success from additional stunt dice would be rolled straight as withering damage.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":155,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","user":"Noodle","date":". 01-23-2018, 12:52 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-24T11:37:45-08:00","id":1178880,"title":"","content":"(Lessons)<br /> <br /> &quot;Then what do you want, Devil?&quot; Chandra growls, his gaze jerking from his captor to his bandoleers. For now, he is complying....<br /> <br /> What will you do?<br /> <br /> (Dhampir Melee)<br /> <br /> Diane's assault strikes true, slashing a gout of flesh from its flank as it howls, and a tar-like substance squelches from its open wound. The Dhampir tries to rake its claws at Diane once more, but fails to pierce her masterful guard as she parries the blow. The turn order resets, and Diane is the first to act, as she crashed the Dhampir.<br /> <br /> What will she do?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-24T12:33:47-08:00","id":1178902,"title":"","content":"(Topaz)<br /> <br /> a balding, elderly man walks up to the corpse, and gives it a look over. <br /> <br /> &quot;Yup. It looks like his blood was sucked out here,&quot; the doctor states, pointing to flush skin on the man's neck,&quot; He must've died after the blood was drained through the pores in his skin.&quot;<br /> <br /> As the doctor gives his analysis of the crime scene, Topaz hears a low rumbling along the deck, and a figure strides slowly across the deck. This wouldn't seem so odd, save that the figure is a good two heads taller than the average crew member. Hwoever, as quickly as it appeared, it disappeared back into the fog.<br /> <br /> What will you do?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-24T17:24:00-08:00","id":1179019,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dietaku</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1171397-ic-exalted-3e-the-pirates-of-the-gilded-throne?p=1178902#post1178902\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">(Topaz)<br /> <br /> a balding, elderly man walks up to the corpse, and gives it a look over.<br /> <br /> &quot;Yup. It looks like his blood was sucked out here,&quot; the doctor states, pointing to flush skin on the man's neck,&quot; He must've died after the blood was drained through the pores in his skin.&quot;<br /> <br /> As the doctor gives his analysis of the crime scene, Topaz hears a low rumbling along the deck, and a figure strides slowly across the deck. This wouldn't seem so odd, save that the figure is a good two heads taller than the average crew member. Hwoever, as quickly as it appeared, it disappeared back into the fog.<br /> <br /> What will you do?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Shining Topaz narrows her eyes and strains to re-acquire sight of the figure. Doing so, she runs after it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11917-aranfan","name":"Aranfan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11917_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"503"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-24T17:26:43-08:00","id":1179021,"title":"","content":"&quot;Awnsers.&quot; he rasps. &quot;What do you and your master hope to find on this island?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1131211-flintys-homebrew-hub-2e\" target=\"_blank\">My Mage 2e Homebrew</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5241-flinty","name":"Flinty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"793"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-24T17:38:37-08:00","id":1179024,"title":"","content":"(Topaz)<br /> <br /> Topaz walks into the mist, looking for the figure, as the hairs on the back of her neck tingle, and she spins around, to find herself staring at a towering, gaunt figure. Naked, save for a loincloth, with a hairy body and a face not unlike a mandrill, she finds herself staring into crazed, hungry eyes, as the creature sucks in air, seemingly not to breathe, but as if trying to inhale...something.<br /> <br /> &quot;S-so thirsty. More juice. Need more,&quot; It rumbles, reaching at Topaz with a hand large enough to enclose over her head easily. <br /> <br /> What will you do?<br /> <br /> (Lessons)<br /> <br /> &quot;What do we hope to find? Yuugo Al-Argentum's legacy; Power. Power enough to break free of the shackles that bind everyone to their ruinous fates,&quot; Chandra stated flatly,&quot; I thought I told your friend over there that. Didn't he tell you?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-24T17:40:54-08:00","id":1179025,"title":"","content":"&quot;What kind of power? How will you break these shackles you talk of?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1131211-flintys-homebrew-hub-2e\" target=\"_blank\">My Mage 2e Homebrew</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5241-flinty","name":"Flinty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"793"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-24T20:53:44-08:00","id":1179085,"title":"","content":"Diane halts her twirling offensive, slamming her spear into the ground. She uses her spear as a lever, leaping into the air. She drops towards the dhampir, aiming her spear to pierce through the beast's chest. As she falls, Diane screams bloody murder, like a Getherin descending upon a squirrel-man, or a Getherin descending upon an Ordon, or a Getherin descending upon a Getherin.<br /> <br /> Diane makes a decisive attack on the dhampir, enhancing her attack with 7 dice using the excellency.<br /> <br /> Diane deals 4L damage.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":155,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","user":"Noodle","date":". 01-25-2018, 12:00 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-25T05:28:07-08:00","id":1179160,"title":"","content":"As the monstrosity reels in pain from the ferocity of Diane's attack Laughter capitalizes on her strike by likewise plunging his blade into the wretched creature's wound. THICK HIDE WON'T SAVE YOU NOW, BEAST<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">11 sux with excellent strike hit for 2 damage<br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4017-angryicecream","name":"angryicecream","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-25T17:07:27-08:00","id":1179359,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dietaku</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1171397-ic-exalted-3e-the-pirates-of-the-gilded-throne?p=1179024#post1179024\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">(Topaz)<br /> <br /> Topaz walks into the mist, looking for the figure, as the hairs on the back of her neck tingle, and she spins around, to find herself staring at a towering, gaunt figure. Naked, save for a loincloth, with a hairy body and a face not unlike a mandrill, she finds herself staring into crazed, hungry eyes, as the creature sucks in air, seemingly not to breathe, but as if trying to inhale...something.<br /> <br /> &quot;S-so thirsty. More juice. Need more,&quot; It rumbles, reaching at Topaz with a hand large enough to enclose over her head easily.<br /> <br /> What will you do?</div> </div> </div> </div>Topaz's hand moves to the sword on her back as she dances away from the grasping hand. &quot;You have been drinking blood, not juice. Stand down or I will be forced to end you to defend this ship!&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11917-aranfan","name":"Aranfan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11917_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"503"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-29T18:55:53-08:00","id":1180566,"title":"","content":"(Laughter and Diane)<br /> <br /> Diane's strike hit home, and more black tar-like liquid spilled forth. It may be your battle-fevered mind, or your imagination, but the creature seems to be shrinking.<br /> <br /> Laughter's strike hits home as welll, and staggers the beast.<br /> <br /> The beast lashes out at Diane, and perhaps because of its new wounds, misses.<br /> <br /> It is now Laughter's turn.<br /> <br /> (Topaz)<br /> <br /> The beast ignores the protests of Topaz, and reaches out to grasp her head. However, it misses, fumbling even itself in the fog. What will you do?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-29T19:01:01-08:00","id":1180569,"title":"","content":"(Lessons)<br /> <br /> Chandra scoffs, rolling his eyes,&quot; There's a weapon on this island, the likes of which hasn't been seen since the ages past, a suit of armor so strong, it can withstand the might of the Sun and the Claws of the Moon, a suit of armor so mighty, that even the Five Stars would be forced to concede its legitimacy and cease their meddling. This weapon that, if used correctly, would make even the Central Hegemony of Dragonbloods be forced to recognize us. THAT is the power we will use, you honorless cur,&quot; Chandra grows,&quot; Now, are you going to kill me, or are you going to wring me for more, then?&quot;<br /> <br /> Well? What will you do?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-30T11:56:33-08:00","id":1180832,"title":"","content":"&quot;So you want to take down the gods and the dragonbloods and replace their tyranny with one of your own device? It seems your talk of honor is cheap and you are the real devil here.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1131211-flintys-homebrew-hub-2e\" target=\"_blank\">My Mage 2e Homebrew</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5241-flinty","name":"Flinty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"793"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-30T12:34:54-08:00","id":1180848,"title":"","content":"Well, seeing the respectable damage Diane is already inflicting on the beast, Laughter continues his onslaught to distract the creature and leave it open for her next blow","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4017-angryicecream","name":"angryicecream","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-30T12:49:14-08:00","id":1180852,"title":"","content":"(Lessons)<br /> <br /> Chandra snorts,&quot; You think you're the first to toss that at me? Devils have this strange habit of passing off their sins on others all while reveling in their own evil. What makes you different? Yes, I know my sins cover me, but I'm prepared for the consequences, even if I need to be reincarnated a million times, so long as Devils are destroyed, then I can rest easy knowing my lives' work is bearing fruit.&quot;<br /> <br /> Well, then. What will you do?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-30T14:14:54-08:00","id":1180881,"title":"","content":"&quot;I think you've lost sight of who's the devil here. You work with a serial killer, your men attack any ship that comes here without parley, your friends pet monster attacks those you invited upon the island and all you do is calmly watch while your companion delights in bloodshed. You have become nothing more than a thug, justifying his atrocities with hopes of a better future. This future will never come. The Wulf will bring nothing but death and tyranny and you will be his tool, his mailed fist. But it is not too late for you to stand up, fight the true devils and do what is right.&quot; With that Lessons gives Chandra a kick, sending him tumbling to the ground, entangled, while Lessons vanishes in the nearby trees.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1131211-flintys-homebrew-hub-2e\" target=\"_blank\">My Mage 2e Homebrew</a>","edited":{"userid":5241,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5241-flinty","user":"Flinty","date":". 01-30-2018, 05:17 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5241-flinty","name":"Flinty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"793"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-30T14:35:34-08:00","id":1180887,"title":"","content":"EXTERMINATE!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4017,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4017-angryicecream","user":"angryicecream","date":".  Accidental double post 01-30-2018, 05:37 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4017-angryicecream","name":"angryicecream","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-31T16:10:05-08:00","id":1181262,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dietaku</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1171397-ic-exalted-3e-the-pirates-of-the-gilded-throne?p=1180566#post1180566\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> (Topaz)<br /> <br /> The beast ignores the protests of Topaz, and reaches out to grasp her head. However, it misses, fumbling even itself in the fog. What will you do?</div> </div> </div> </div>SHining Topaz sets herself for battle, and readies herself to end this threat to her ship.<br /> <br /> (Join Battle. 5 sux.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11917-aranfan","name":"Aranfan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11917_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"503"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-31T17:40:53-08:00","id":1181290,"title":"","content":"(Topaz)<br /> <br /> The beast rolls a JB of 10. It is now his go. <br /> <br /> The beast lashes out with a large hand, gripping Topaz firmly, engaging in a clunch attempt. He rolls 8 suxx for accuracy and 7 for control. What will you do now?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-31T18:05:59-08:00","id":1181293,"title":"","content":"Diane withdraws her blade from the beast's flank with a shout and twirls around making a cruel slash at its head. <br /> <br /> Diane attacks with max excellency. 10 sux on hit, 6 for damage.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-31T18:13:56-08:00","id":1181295,"title":"","content":"(Laughter and Diane)<br /> <br /> Diane's stroke strikes true, and the beast howls, and collapses dead. The beast's inky ichor, drains into the ground as disembodied voices speaking in whispers the likes of which the world hasn't seen since the World's dawn are whispered on the wind, before the beast shrivels into a mummified husk before you.<br /> <br /> The beastmen pause in their excavations, while the zombies contine their mindless digging.<br /> <br /> What will you do?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-31T18:17:32-08:00","id":1181296,"title":"","content":"(Lessons)<br /> <br /> Chandra gets up, dusts himself off, and dashes off into the brush. <br /> <br /> You are now alone, albeit with Diane, Laughter, and the beastmen and zombies.<br /> <br /> What will you do?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-31T18:26:14-08:00","id":1181299,"title":"","content":"Diane plants her spear in the ground, as much to clean it of the beast's ichor as to get it out of her hands as she draws a pair of bronze axes. She sets onto the beast, hacking the corpse limb from limb with a brutal efficiency. Once she has sufficiently maimed the corpse. She will toss each piece as far from the body as possible. Except the head. That she keeps on her person. For now. <br /> <br /> Only then does she check to ensure that Essen is still among the living.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-31T18:28:39-08:00","id":1181301,"title":"","content":"(Laughter, Lessons and Diane)<br /> <br /> Essen blinks, the wound on her side throbbing unnervingly as a horde of tentacles bursts forth from her wounds, before falling off and fresh, healthy skin is visible underneath.<br /> <br /> &quot;Oh, hello. what did I miss?&quot; she asks, getting to her feet, as if nothing at all happened.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-31T18:42:20-08:00","id":1181304,"title":"","content":"&quot;Octopi are just gross...&quot; Diane mumbles. She coughs and then continues, &quot;Anyways, I kept that thing off of you while the captain went off and murdered some children. Then he came back and distracted it long enough for me to put it down.&quot;<br /> <br /> Content that no one from the crew is dead, Diane retrieves her spear and then sets off to check out that one spear fancy spear that's holding a corpse to the mountain.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-31T18:48:22-08:00","id":1181306,"title":"","content":"(Laughter, Lessons and Diane)<br /> <br /> Essen frowns, &quot;Killing children? He would never.....&quot; she trails off, trying to digest this new information.<br /> <br /> Diane saunters over to the corpse, and gives it a look over. She sees a sign that reads:<br /> <br /> &quot;By the Deeds of Jyubei the Cleft-Handed, this Anathema, known vulgarly as Thryme the Bloody Garden, will be sealed to this holy spot for all eternity. Let no power on Heaven or Earth remove it, lest their unholy wroth once again plague the innocent, holy peoples of Creation.&quot;<br /> <br /> However, as you see it, this corpse is looooooooong dead.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-31T21:35:23-08:00","id":1181327,"title":"","content":"Lessons receeded to the treeline after releasing Chandra, lest Diane or Laughter get any ideas about questioning him. Lurking in the shadows he stays long enough to make sure Essen is going to be allright, then takes a closer look at the dig site.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> Lessons reestablishes Stealth with 10 successes, should someone want to contest.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1131211-flintys-homebrew-hub-2e\" target=\"_blank\">My Mage 2e Homebrew</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5241-flinty","name":"Flinty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"793"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-31T21:50:25-08:00","id":1181329,"title":"","content":"&quot;A murderous exalt that sets loose unholy abominations on invited guests then cheers it on as it mangles me people don't be strikin' me as any child. Still less when blackest magic spews forth from 'er corpse. Anyway, be ye well, Essen?&quot; He says helping her up and looking towards Chandra as he dashes off into the brush","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4017-angryicecream","name":"angryicecream","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-02T05:21:02-08:00","id":1181625,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dietaku</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1171397-ic-exalted-3e-the-pirates-of-the-gilded-throne?p=1181290#post1181290\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">(Topaz)<br /> <br /> The beast rolls a JB of 10. It is now his go.<br /> <br /> The beast lashes out with a large hand, gripping Topaz firmly, engaging in a clunch attempt. He rolls 8 suxx for accuracy and 7 for control. What will you do now?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> (Topaz rolls 5 on the opposed roll, using Str+Martial Arts and a full excellency.)<br /> <br /> Struggling in the grasp, she manuvers her sword and attempts the stabbening.<br /> <br /> (Spends 1wp to activate Perfect strike discipline, -1 from grapple means only 23 dice instead of 24. The extra 3 come from accuracy because this is withering. 14 sux)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11917-aranfan","name":"Aranfan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11917_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"503"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-05T18:15:03-08:00","id":1182771,"title":"","content":"Diane rubs her chin, pondering whether or not to remove the spear, when she suddenly remembers the legend of Aengus, one of the tales of her childhood. Aengus, the story went, was a powerful Getherin, both young and handsome. After a long series of adventures, he found a massive axe embedded in a massive oak tree. After pulling the axe from the tree, a procession of Fae descended upon Aengus and declared him their true and rightful king.<br /> <br /> &quot;Truely, this is my destiny,&quot; Diane says, as she reaches out to pull the spear out of the mountain, perhaps intentionally forgetting the end of the story where Aengus accidentally and almost immediately caused a populist revolt through his new demesne and causing the formation of a democratic republic.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-05T18:31:21-08:00","id":1182773,"title":"","content":"(Laughter)<br /> <br /> Essen nods, bowing, &quot; I'm fine, thank you, Beloved. How did you fare? I must apologize myself. I didn't expect an attacker with such guile on this island.&quot;<br /> <br /> (Topaz, Scholar)<br /> <br /> Topaz's strike hits home, and the beast howls with pain, loosening its grip. <br /> <br /> It is now Scholar's turn, if he wishes.<br /> <br /> (Diane)<br /> <br /> Pulling the spear out of the corpse, the hand grasped around the spear falls off and crumbles to dust before you. As you test the spear's weight a shimmering figure melts into view; that of a chubby young youth wearing immaculate robes with small dainty wings on its back and a rosy halo about his head, alongside his golden mane.<br /> <br /> &quot;Greetings, Champion. I am Zykawl, the Divine Spear of Imprisonment. You are now the rightful Sovereign of the Principality of Xatuum-Bojahn, by the bylaws of the Creation-Ruling Mandate. With this in mind, how may I serve you?&quot;<br /> <br /> You also notice the corpse, no longer held up b ythe spear, slumps over, making an odd squishy noise. Something is not right with that corpse...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-06T15:16:31-08:00","id":1183057,"title":"","content":"&quot;All is well with me... Though, this black magic makes me uncomfortable.&quot; he walks over towards Diane as she pulls out the spear and the pudgy cherub appears &quot;What in the name of the five dragons be that?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4017-angryicecream","name":"angryicecream","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-06T15:38:20-08:00","id":1183067,"title":"","content":"(Laughter, Diane)<br /> <br /> The Cherub stares at Laughter, before stating flatly, &quot;I am the spirit, Zykawl, Lord of Light and Master of Divine Justice. I was forged into this Spear in an Aeon forgotten, when the World was more complete and there was happiness and laughter. I relinquished my form to become an instrument of Divine Will when the great Terror, the Five Evil Suns,emerged across the shores of reality. So, do not think me some common sunsprite, buccaneer.&quot;<br /> <br /> There is now a silent whistling that can be heard, almost imperceptible to the ear. Still, it seems to waver in and out of earshot.<br /> <br /> What will you do?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-06T15:44:20-08:00","id":1183070,"title":"","content":"(Lessons)<br /> <br /> As he looks over the dig site, he notices that the excavation has gone quite deep indeed, finding many ancient obelisks carved impeccably with numerous glyphs, the likes of which you cannot read. Alongside these obelisks, several of which stand off to one end of the dig site, there are numerous recovered tools and trinkets, which are gathered into reed baskets nearby. You also notice a small gaggle of the bearmen are inching their way towards where Diane, and the corpse are located, carrying a basket of what looks like fruit and a few dead birds.<br /> <br /> Now, what are they doing?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-06T16:07:15-08:00","id":1183078,"title":"","content":"&quot;I don't even know what a sunsprite be, oh radiant one&quot; he says, cocking his ear to the side &quot;What be that whistlin'?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4017-angryicecream","name":"angryicecream","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-06T16:12:07-08:00","id":1183080,"title":"","content":"\u201cOh,\u201d Diane says as she kneels down to examine the body, \u201c I\u2019m also a princess now or something.\u201d<br /> <br /> Diane will examine the body. Somethings not exactly kosher here.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-06T16:30:11-08:00","id":1183085,"title":"","content":"(Laughter, Diane, Lessons)<br /> <br /> Zykawl harrumphs,&quot;A sunsprites are small spirits who rise sunbeams to aid small, pitiful mortals who need excellence or hope in their lives. If you've ever experienced a moment of peace or calm during moments of absolute pain or hardship, that is the work of a sunsprite.&quot;<br /> <br /> As DIane looks over the corpse, the corpse's arm grabbed her, as it jerked up to standing, growling in a guttural, vacillating voice,&quot; Yuuuuuu, waza Shoguunu yiia izi eetii?&quot; it demands, staring with shriveled eyes at Diane.<br /> <br /> (The 'corpse' is speaking in the language of Spirits, not a tongue that Laughter would know, at least at present.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-06T16:36:02-08:00","id":1183089,"title":"","content":"&quot;Dammit, not another one!&quot; Laughter says with a start, drawing his blade and readying himself for battle... again... before realizing it's not attacking... yet &quot;What be it sayin'?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4017-angryicecream","name":"angryicecream","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-06T16:43:39-08:00","id":1183093,"title":"","content":"\u201cZa Shoguunu fele moa zana seve ciintureez ahgo,\u201d Diane replies, \u201cEye du nauza no waza shoguunu yirii eetii izi.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cHe\u2019s asking what year it is,\u201d she says to Laughter.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":155,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","user":"Noodle","date":". 02-06-2018, 07:46 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-06T22:35:33-08:00","id":1183170,"title":"","content":"Assuming for now that the three of them can handle one corpse and a few beasties with tribute, Lessons inspect the Obelisks and especially the tools that have been excavated more closely.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1131211-flintys-homebrew-hub-2e\" target=\"_blank\">My Mage 2e Homebrew</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5241-flinty","name":"Flinty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"793"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-07T10:54:19-08:00","id":1183306,"title":"","content":"(Laughter, Diane)<br /> <br /> The corpse sighs, as if not getting the answers it wanted. The beastmen then inch ever closer, laying a basket filled with fruits and loaves of bread before the corpse, as it sniffed the offering, gobbling it down.<br /> <br /> &quot;Ziisi eesee sheetii! Stilli, Beggaas kannata bii chuuzasa,&quot; it said between bites, as the Beastmen all sighed as one.<br /> <br /> &quot;Lady Thryme has accepted our tribute! Another season of good harvests!&quot; one called, as the leader, the bearman who presented the basket, approached Laughter and Diane.<br /> <br /> &quot;Ye who rescued Lady Thryme from her limbo, we thank you, and, from the depths of the Uru-Uru people, offer out undying loyalty,&quot; he says, as the bearmen all bow.<br /> <br /> &quot;Whazza bancha wyaadohzo,&quot; Thryme grunts, still eating the &quot;sacrifice.&quot;<br /> <br /> (Lessons)<br /> <br /> Despite your most scholarly approach to the obelisks, you get nothing more than an appreciation for their artistry. You find the glyphs to be quite masterfully carved, with no chipping or cracking you normally see with such fine stonework. Whoever carved these was a superlative artisan. As for the other finds, you find numerous metal tools, some of which you know, like blades, shovels, combs, and a few mirrors. Others you do not, like a plain metal cylinder about a cubit long which has no immediately identifiable use, another looks like a metal stave, albeit limp and serpentine, almost like a metal rope. The last being a translucent green crystalline cube that could easily fit in your palm. It doesn't seem to have any unique properties, although it is flawless, surely a treasure, at the very least.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-07T11:43:26-08:00","id":1183333,"title":"","content":"&quot;Seems ye've got yerself somethin' of a fan club, Diane...&quot; Turning towards the bear people &quot;Who be this Lady Thryme?&quot; He asks &quot;And why'd ye have er stabbed to a block if she's helpin' he?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4017-angryicecream","name":"angryicecream","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-07T11:49:02-08:00","id":1183335,"title":"","content":"Nice... shiney... no idea what it is though, so better left undisturbed, before he pockets a bomb that ends up blowing up the ship. Instead he decides to get a look at what they are trying to excavate here, descending into the ditch.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1131211-flintys-homebrew-hub-2e\" target=\"_blank\">My Mage 2e Homebrew</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5241-flinty","name":"Flinty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"793"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-07T12:10:28-08:00","id":1183343,"title":"","content":"(Laughter, DIane)<br /> <br /> &quot;Who is lady Thryme? That's Lady Thryme,&quot; the leader said, pointing to the Corpse, as it continued to eat,&quot; She was one of Yuugo Al-Argentum's crew members. He had a hide-out on the island way back in the olden days, or so Grampy told me when I was little. Then, the Dragon-Harlots came,&quot; the leader paused to spit on the ground, before continuing,&quot; and they stole Yuugo away and nailed Thryme to the mountain. We of the Uru-Uru tried to keep her alive, and she'd bless us with favorable weather and keep other's away. She spoke with the gods of the winds and seas and let us have this island for our own. However, none of us could remove the spear, as we lacked the favor of the Sun, Stars or Moon. The Dragon-Harlots used some fell magicks to wield the power of a Sun-Lord from ages past, wielding his flesh and so, could wield the spear themselves, but we, we could do nothing but feed her and keep her clean,&quot; the bearman said, as Thryme shrugged.<br /> <br /> &quot;Eetee waznaa za faahztaa taaima Eye wazaa biitweeenee a rokko anada a haada plahysii,&quot; she shrugs, continuing to devour the contents of the basket.<br /> <br /> (Lessons)<br /> <br /> As you descend into the dig site, you find that the light of the Sun fades as you go deeper and deeper into the mountain, until you hit the bottom, where only a haze of sun shimmers down onto you. You see a small procession of zombies continuing to dig up dirt, but they seem to not notice you, or they're too invested into their digging to care. In any case, you notice several tunnels extending from the main shaft you descended down, one which ends about six feet away in a large obelisk with what can only be the Unconquered Sun trampling some unknown demon underfoot in a spectacular scene of dancing. Truly magnificent.<br /> <br /> However, there are two other shafts you see. One of which extends into the mountain. The other extends off into the northeast, off towards the other isde of the island around the mountain.<br /> <br /> What will you do?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-07T12:14:26-08:00","id":1183345,"title":"","content":"&quot;Oh ye? How's it she lived so long lookin' like the livin' dead an stapled ere?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4017-angryicecream","name":"angryicecream","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-07T12:27:15-08:00","id":1183347,"title":"","content":"(Laughter, Diane)<br /> <br /> Zykawl spoke up,&quot; I think I can answer that. My [Divine Imprisonment] isn't just a name.I seal those I pierce not just in place, but also in time. They will remain as they are as long as they are when pierced. For the most part, at least.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Eye steelii geetii hangurii,&quot; Thryme grumbled,&quot; Ahlzoo, leetlii mana, eezii deesgaihzee,&quot; <br /> <br /> Before Laughter can ask for clarification, Thryme grabs her desciated hair, tugging as a sickening cracking noise roars, as she rips off her skin in one motion. However, instead of the muscle and other unpleasantness you expect to find underneath, she reveals youthful, smooth skin, unveiling an olive-skinned beauty smiling at you, coiffing her wild green mane as she popped another mango into her mouth. She grunted at Zykawl, as he nodded.<br /> <br /> &quot;She says it is a Faerie skill she learned; <i>Oneiromancy</i>, she called it,&quot; Zykawl explained, as Essen gasped.<br /> <br /> &quot;The word-magic of the Faeries!? My master told me of that power,&quot; she mumbled.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-07T12:40:05-08:00","id":1183351,"title":"","content":"Diane chuckles at Thryme\u2019s joke, as she attempts to ignore the fact that she\u2019s surrounded by beastmen. They\u2019re mutant abominations, but they just pledged their loyalty to her. That makes them useful, and therefore valuable... <br /> <br /> She ponders this dilemma, until Thryme demonstrates her powers. \u201cAra ewe ah Faeree?\u201d she gasps, \u201cOra ara ewe ah sorasera?\u201d","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-07T12:44:55-08:00","id":1183353,"title":"","content":"(Laughter, Diane)<br /> <br /> Thryme frowns,&quot; How Ruudu! Eye am a Sutuuwaadaa! Eye ama ae Soodo ava Creaashunuu! Eye leahnada zisi furahma mae Mentaah, Laedee Kaadaalaa.&quot;<br /> <br /> Clearly, this is a gaffe, but an understandable one. What will you do?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-07T14:46:02-08:00","id":1183392,"title":"","content":"Lessons takes a closer look at the statue... and then follows the tunnel leading deeper into the mountain.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1131211-flintys-homebrew-hub-2e\" target=\"_blank\">My Mage 2e Homebrew</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5241-flinty","name":"Flinty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"793"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-07T15:06:45-08:00","id":1183400,"title":"","content":"\u201cMushu sorree.\u201d Diane apologizes, \u201cEye hava sumu baada tiimiz wida Faeree. Eye izi tareye too bee carafuulu.\u201d <br /> <br /> She cocks her head, \u201cEye du nauza no waza \u2018Soodo ava Creaashunuu\u2019 izi, bautu eye hava hurudo ava Kaadaalaa. Eye hurudo shee izi ana anaseanata Luna-balesseede Sutuuwaadaa. Shee tareinada Mejana Holofo, wana ava mai peepolez garaetezete hiiroez. Ara ewe balesseede ava da Sola? Oro da Luna?\u201d","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-07T17:26:03-08:00","id":1183438,"title":"","content":"Well, Laughter scratches his chin as he watches those two talk for a moment, &quot;Do ye know what they be sayin', hun?&quot; he asks Essen","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4017,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4017-angryicecream","user":"angryicecream","date":". 02-10-2018, 10:32 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4017-angryicecream","name":"angryicecream","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-11T17:44:53-08:00","id":1184967,"title":"","content":"(Lessons)<br /> <br /> As Lessons stalks ever deeper into the depths of the mountain, the light becomes dimmer and dimmer, until the only light in view is that of softly glowing crystals set into the walls. You wonder if perhaps this corridor existed before the digging began. This theory rings true as the corridor suddenly halts in a large stone surface, decorated with carvings depicting a series of five ferocious figures. The central figure is a terrifying man in a cape whose is kneeling cross-legged at the fore, his hands holding out for...something. There is an indentation in the frieze, as if the carving is merely accessory for something else entirely....<br /> <br /> Hmmmmmm.....<br /> <br /> (Laughter, Diane)<br /> <br /> Essen nods to Laughter,&quot; She is saying she's like me, a Lunar. Or at least that's what I think.&quot;<br /> <br /> Essen bows to Thryme, before flaring her anima, as Thryme brightenes. the elder Steward motions for Essen to approach, and before she can protest, Thrme grabs Essen and bites her wrist. Essen whimpers for a moment, before Thryme rises, swallowing, before Essen concentrates and in a softly glowing light, her wound is healed.<br /> <br /> &quot;My apologies, but there really was no other way for me to communicate with everyone here otherwise. So! Salutations, heroes! You have done me a mighty service for freeing me, Thryme, Bloody Garden, and Second Mate to Yuugo Al-Argentum! Now....Can you direct me to him?&quot; Thryme says proudly, looking over the circle.<br /> <br /> Well? What will you do?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-11T18:12:53-08:00","id":1184971,"title":"","content":"&quot;Indisposed, I'm afraid. Would have said dead but truth be told I would have said the same of yerself so that don't be meanin' much.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4017-angryicecream","name":"angryicecream","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-12T01:26:32-08:00","id":1185052,"title":"","content":"Interesting. What shape does the indentation have? Would it fit the desciption of the heart of the lighthouse?<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> In case it's important: Due to the active Cloak of Shadows Lessons can see in darkness without issue.<br /> </div></div> </div> </div><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1131211-flintys-homebrew-hub-2e\" target=\"_blank\">My Mage 2e Homebrew</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5241-flinty","name":"Flinty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"793"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-12T09:11:27-08:00","id":1185219,"title":"","content":"Scholar saw the group after Pool Pinto took him to the island. He had asked Pool Pinto to shrink and get onto his shoulder. He looks at the people as they spoke together. He looked at everyone and said, &quot;Hi all, sorry I'm late. How can I help?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7592-wtaylorjr2001","name":"wtaylorjr2001","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"261"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-12T15:46:24-08:00","id":1185372,"title":"","content":"(Lessons)<br /> <br /> The indentation is that of a long cylinder, longer than your forearm, but less than your height. It looks like the man may need to be holding a weapon of some stripe, given his garb. You cannot recall what shape the Heart of the Lighthouse has, but you surmise Essen may know that, if anyone you know.<br /> <br /> Also, the corridor walls are laced with quartz crystals. Not really important, but very striking in the dim light with your enhanced vision. This most likely was a deliberate aesthetic choice.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-12T16:07:24-08:00","id":1185379,"title":"","content":"Investigating the keyhole and remembering the weird apparatus at the digsite, Lessons ventures back to the excavation site to gather them.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1131211-flintys-homebrew-hub-2e\" target=\"_blank\">My Mage 2e Homebrew</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5241-flinty","name":"Flinty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"793"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-12T16:11:25-08:00","id":1185383,"title":"","content":"(Lessons)<br /> <br /> Recalling the tools from before, you return to the basket, only to find Scholar chatting weith the others. However, this has little bearing on your deep, scholarly archaeological investigation. Before you stands the basket of tools once more, with the strange silvery stave and its pliable length, the cubit-long cylinder, and the green crystal cube.<br /> <br /> Which, if anything, will you retrieve with you?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-12T16:45:25-08:00","id":1185400,"title":"","content":"Why, all of them of course! In fact he will just take the whole basket and quietly escape back into the depths. Let's see if a combination of those strange devices fits the entrance.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1131211-flintys-homebrew-hub-2e\" target=\"_blank\">My Mage 2e Homebrew</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5241-flinty","name":"Flinty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"793"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-12T17:18:45-08:00","id":1185413,"title":"","content":"&quot;Ah, Scholar good of ye to make it, lad. Think your skills could be put to use investigatin' these ruins.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4017-angryicecream","name":"angryicecream","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-12T17:44:30-08:00","id":1185421,"title":"","content":"(Lessons)<br /> <br /> Very well, you arrive once more at the frieze,and look over the indentation once more.<br /> <br /> What will you place in the indentation?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-13T08:08:44-08:00","id":1185582,"title":"","content":"Lessons cautiously inserts the cylinder into the indentation.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1131211-flintys-homebrew-hub-2e\" target=\"_blank\">My Mage 2e Homebrew</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5241-flinty","name":"Flinty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"793"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-13T08:15:48-08:00","id":1185584,"title":"","content":"Scholar greets Laughter and looks at Lessons curiously. He tells Laughter that he is getting the wave marble that he needs. Next, he goes off to find the deposits of wave marble to make three statues.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7592-wtaylorjr2001","name":"wtaylorjr2001","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"261"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-13T08:55:13-08:00","id":1185600,"title":"","content":"(Lessons)<br /> <br /> Lessons inserts the cylinder into the frieze's hands, and the man leans out of the carving, nodding, before standing alongside his fellows, as he holds the cylinder, as it shifts from a small cylinder to a sword about four feet long, before reverting to its cylinder shape. The door slides aside to reveal a large complex, far larger than any building Lessons had seen, with piles of coin and treasures, many which Lessons had never before seen. However, in the center of the complex sits a large sphere, which gently hums. Upon closer inspection, the sphere seems to be made of stone. <br /> <br /> (Scholar, Laughter, Scholar)<br /> <br /> &quot;Wave Marble? You mean Shift-stone, stuff that shifts and alters itself with essence? Yes, there's some of it here, as part of the vault where Yuugo kept his goods before he stashed in his main banks. Don't get your hopes up, chicks, this stuff isn't much. Why would you want such a material, though?&quot; Thryme asked.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-13T09:30:24-08:00","id":1185608,"title":"","content":"Lessons whistles appreciativly. Laughter would be happy about that.... Well golds gold. Time to take a closer look if there's anything more practical left. Lessons inspects the vault for identifiable items of use beyond sheer wealth, ending with a closer inspection of the humming sphere in the middle, touching it carefully.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1131211-flintys-homebrew-hub-2e\" target=\"_blank\">My Mage 2e Homebrew</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5241-flinty","name":"Flinty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"793"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-13T09:34:40-08:00","id":1185612,"title":"","content":"Scholar looks at Thryme and says, &quot;I was contracted to make a statue in the town center out of wave marble.&quot; Please tell me all about this Shift Stone.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7592-wtaylorjr2001","name":"wtaylorjr2001","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"261"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-13T09:34:51-08:00","id":1185613,"title":"","content":"&quot;Do ye know anythin' about a weapon on this island?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4017-angryicecream","name":"angryicecream","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-13T09:51:31-08:00","id":1185619,"title":"","content":"(Lessons)<br /> <br /> The sphere shimmers, begins glowing, and then....ripples wave across its surface at Lessons' touch, before a large ear melds out of its surface. Then, nothing. Presumably, the is another lock, requiring another key....<br /> <br /> (Laughter, Diane, Scholar)<br /> <br /> &quot;A statue made out of Shift-stone?&quot; Thryme snorts,&quot; That would be a gross misuse of such a rare material. Either your patron is mad or has more money than sense. Or both. Shift-stone is basically made of millions of small earth elementals. They will congregate in a certain pattern, forming a certain shape, but they can alter themselves depending on whatever patterns the sorcerer that summoned them thought to teach them. Others CAN alter their shape, but it requires a great deal of effort and will. That's why Yuugo had his vault made of the stuff. It's almost impossible to break the normal way!&quot;<br /> <br /> Shifting to Laughter's question, Thryme grins mischievously,&quot; I'm the strongest weapon on this island. Just you see,&quot; she said, as she rummaged in her pockets, before laughing nervously,&quot; I, uh, seem to have lost my control cube. Oh well! Even without my Therianlord Armor, I'm still the strongest being here! Unless you count that piece of junk Yuugo fawned over....What was its name? Deneb of Marsday? Some piece of junk he bought from the Tyrant of Althanaaz,&quot; Thryme shakes her head,&quot; He always had too much of a soft spot for those romance cycles of his...&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-13T09:54:56-08:00","id":1185623,"title":"","content":"&quot;Oh ye? Where be that? Got some mad men lookin' to misuse it.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4017-angryicecream","name":"angryicecream","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-13T10:01:25-08:00","id":1185627,"title":"","content":"Faced with the insurmountable language barrier Lessons does the only sane thing... he lays out a map for the more scholarly equipped to follow. Taking his brush of excellent adhesion out of his pockets he begins to draw arrows pointing toward the Vault, finally stealing a big plank of wood from the excavation and writing a huge arrow on it pointing down into the Excavation site and reading &quot;HUGE MAGICAL VAULT OF RICHES. WITH GOLD AND STUFF. AND EARSPHERES. THIS WAY.&quot; He waits for an opportune moment, positions the sign so it can be seen if anyone looks down to the excavation site and then throws something heavy that will make a good loud crash where it lands to alert attention to it before slipping back into the darkness of the excavation site.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1131211-flintys-homebrew-hub-2e\" target=\"_blank\">My Mage 2e Homebrew</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5241-flinty","name":"Flinty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"793"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-13T10:07:08-08:00","id":1185630,"title":"","content":"Yes, thought Scholar, I will definitely be keeping two of the three statue sized slabs when I get them. He turns to Thryme and says, &quot;thank you.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7592-wtaylorjr2001","name":"wtaylorjr2001","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"261"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-13T10:19:38-08:00","id":1185633,"title":"","content":"(Lessons, Diane, Scholar)<br /> <br /> &quot;Huh? Oh,no problem, Chick,&quot; Thryme slaps him on the back,&quot; Oh, the entrance to the vault is over....&quot; Thryme pauses, tall, bushy ears, not unlike that of a rabbit, sprout from her head, as she jerks towards the dig site.<br /> <br /> &quot;Something is down there,&quot; she whispers, kneeling down and patting the open earth, &quot;Bugger is invisible to sight, but Lord Paisap can see you, fool,&quot; she grins.<br /> <br /> What will you do?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-13T10:23:18-08:00","id":1185635,"title":"","content":"With a grin Lessons writes onto the ground: Can he read me too?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1131211-flintys-homebrew-hub-2e\" target=\"_blank\">My Mage 2e Homebrew</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5241-flinty","name":"Flinty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"793"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-13T10:27:14-08:00","id":1185638,"title":"","content":"Scholar looks in the direction Thryme is looking. He searches in vain to see what she sees. &quot;Pool Pinto, do you see anything at that dig site?&quot;<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7592-wtaylorjr2001","name":"wtaylorjr2001","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"261"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-13T10:39:06-08:00","id":1185643,"title":"","content":"(Laughter, Diane, Scholar)<br /> <br /> Pool Pinto stares deep into the gloom before shrugging,&quot; NOPE! Sorry, Master! There's just nothing down there! Except that sign. Hey, free gold!&quot;<br /> <br /> Thryme blinks, looking intently into the dig site, as she snorts,&quot; I could've sworn I heard....No matter. That's where the vault entrance is, anyway..&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-13T10:46:54-08:00","id":1185646,"title":"","content":"Scholar looks at Laughter, &quot;So what are we doing here Captain? Are we going down to the site or not? There is a big sigh that wasn't there before.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7592-wtaylorjr2001","name":"wtaylorjr2001","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"261"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-13T12:48:09-08:00","id":1185698,"title":"","content":"&quot;Aye, I see it. Should probably go check it out to make sure that lilly Chandra don't be stealin' any weapons of doom. Would ye be so kind as to grace us with yer august company across yer beautiful island, Thryme?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4017,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4017-angryicecream","user":"angryicecream","date":". 02-13-2018, 03:52 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4017-angryicecream","name":"angryicecream","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-13T17:33:39-08:00","id":1185784,"title":"","content":"Scholar prepares for battle. He checks his breastplate and sword and heads down towards the site. He pulls Pool Pinto into his aura before he starts toward trouble.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7592-wtaylorjr2001","name":"wtaylorjr2001","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"261"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-16T11:27:53-08:00","id":1186749,"title":"","content":"(Laughter, Scholar, Diane)<br /> <br /> Thryme laughs, &quot; It's not my island. It was Captain Yuugo's. Although, now, if he really is....Well, let's not worry about that now. Come on, you lot,&quot;Thryme calls, waving for you all to follow, as she leaps down into the pit. Ignoring the signs, Thryme walks briskly down the corridor, as if the gloom doesn't bother her, before she sighs and claps her hands. Immediately, the crystal veins in the walls hum with soft light, illuminating the hall. Walking along the now lit path, Thryme pauses at the door, which has since closed, before looking back at the Circle apprehensively, and leaning towards the head figure, the one whose arms laid outstretched for the key, and whispered into the frieze's ear.<br /> <br /> The frieze nodded, and bowed, &quot;Welekumu bakka, Diia,&quot; it called, as Thryme nodded.<br /> <br /> She then turned to clap Essen on the back,&quot;Do well, and you might have a cooshy little place like this one day, you,&quot; She chuckled, before motioning for you all to follow. Inside, you find piles of gold, silver, and other precious metals strewn about, along with racks of weapons and armor made of steel, copper, and even metals that you're not familiar with. Pointing to the humming globe at the far end of the hall, Thryme chuckled. &quot;This all merely scraps of what Yuugo accumulated. The really good stuff is in his main vault. Here we just have his silly toy, there in that sphere.&quot;<br /> <br /> What will you do?<br /> <br /> (Lessons)<br /> <br /> You pause as your excellent plan comes to fruition, and the Circle, guided by someone you have yet to meet, walks them along the corridor. THere, at the end of the hall, you inwardly frown as this woman somehow bypasses the lock. And after you did all that puzzle solving and everything! You ought to have figured there was a backup key. She then begins to explain the complex in further detail, but this is nothing you, the intrepid explorer, hasn't seen.<br /> <br /> What will you do?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-16T11:41:16-08:00","id":1186753,"title":"","content":"Content that the others were taking stock of the treasure vault and are keeping it save from any looters Lessons turns around and explores where the path to the northeast leads him.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1131211-flintys-homebrew-hub-2e\" target=\"_blank\">My Mage 2e Homebrew</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5241-flinty","name":"Flinty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"793"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-16T11:53:46-08:00","id":1186757,"title":"","content":"(Lessons)<br /> <br /> Ever restless as you are, you walk along the other path, finding yourself returning to the surace in a wooded area, on the opposite end of the mountain, near a large shrine of the kind you occasionally see in the Old District &quot;Shogunate Rococo style,&quot; you think they call it? Whatever. There, you see a number of heavily armed figures guarding the entrance to the shrine, although you can see a few figures within the walls of the shrine, namely Chandra, who is gesticulating wildly to a man lounging on a fallen statue of a fat man wielding a pair of scales like a weapon. The man seems not entirely interested in Chandra's distress.<br /> <br /> Everyone seems to not have noticed your presence, but you're still somewhat far off.<br /> <br /> What will you do?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-16T12:03:48-08:00","id":1186762,"title":"","content":"Lessons carefully sneaks closer toward the temple, going around so he doesn't approach the guards directly. He looks for a window through which he can listen to the conversation.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> Lessons achieves 12 successes to hide himself<br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1131211-flintys-homebrew-hub-2e\" target=\"_blank\">My Mage 2e Homebrew</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5241-flinty","name":"Flinty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"793"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-16T12:25:44-08:00","id":1186777,"title":"","content":"(Lessons)<br /> <br /> You sneak ever closer to the shrine, where you begin to hear snippets of the conversation..<br /> <br /> &quot;So, this island is....a giant network?&quot;<br /> &quot;Indeed. If my theory is correct, then it's not just....but a whole series!&quot;<br /> &quot;Intriguing! Still, that doesn't leave.....What of those msicreants?&quot;<br /> &quot;Peace, Nova. Chandra was there. What do you think?&quot;<br /> &quot;There's one like...Lord Wulf. And several ...They even killed Shoat.&quot;<br /> &quot;Now, now, no need to get so twisted over a doll. There's many more calves to be fattened for the slaughter yet.&quot;<br /> &quot;But....&quot;<br /> &quot;Peace, Chandra, I'm not upset, and neither should you. After all, I assumed she would degenerate into a husk sooner or later. Now, my dear Makkaku, on the other hand...&quot;<br /> &quot;I would prefer to have Deneb of Marsday,&quot; came the voice owned by the one Chandra called Wulf.<br /> &quot;Your love of that machine belies your position as a knight of Death and an owner of the Wolflord Armor,&quot; Nova chides.<br /> &quot;Bah, We'll see when the Glacial Tyrant rewards me yet,&quot; came the only reply, as the conversation devolved into Nova and Wulf bickering.<br /> <br /> What will you do?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1586,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","user":"Dietaku","date":". 02-16-2018, 03:37 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-16T12:35:44-08:00","id":1186783,"title":"","content":"Nova and the Wulf. The two big bad guys, as far as anyone could tell. And Chandra caught in the middle, being casually disregarded by both. Perhaps this would help him see what low company he keeps... perhaps not. Time would tell. For now time to get a better look at these guards.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> 6 successes on appraising the guards and their equipment<br /> </div></div> </div> </div><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1131211-flintys-homebrew-hub-2e\" target=\"_blank\">My Mage 2e Homebrew</a>","edited":{"userid":5241,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5241-flinty","user":"Flinty","date":". 02-16-2018, 03:41 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5241-flinty","name":"Flinty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"793"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-20T17:38:11-08:00","id":1188032,"title":"","content":"(Lessons)<br /> <br /> The guards are clearly not alive, standing far more still than even living guards could. Their arms and armor are fine craftsmanship weapons and llamelar armor, insofar as Lessons can tell. Their equipment doesn't seem to have any magical qualities, although as Lessons isn o doubt aware, appearances can be deceiving.<br /> '<br /> What will you do now?<br /> <br /> (Laughter, Scholar, DIane)<br /> <br /> As the Circle stands in awe of the wealth before them, a darkness washes over the room, and a chilling laughter echoes across the hall. <br /> <br /> &quot;Is this something you had installed?&quot; Essen asks, as Thryme shakes her head,&quot; This is something new.&quot;<br /> <br /> What will you do?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-20T23:53:41-08:00","id":1188090,"title":"","content":"Lessons retreats back to his listening spot, keeping an ear out for sensible information and otherwise making sure the bad guys don't suddenly move out and get a drop on his allies.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1131211-flintys-homebrew-hub-2e\" target=\"_blank\">My Mage 2e Homebrew</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5241-flinty","name":"Flinty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"793"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-21T06:44:43-08:00","id":1188160,"title":"","content":"As Scholar was following the lady, he was also memorizing the path he followed. Then she said some words at the door, he memorized those also. In case he needed to get out of here fast, he memorized. everything he could. He had also not forgotten about the wave marble. He was tempted to have Pool Pinto pick up some but he didn't. It would be a waste of Essence to keep pulling her out again and again. For now, though, he followed.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7592-wtaylorjr2001","name":"wtaylorjr2001","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"261"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-27T13:31:03-08:00","id":1189990,"title":"","content":"Laughter whistles appreciatively as they walk through the building but presses on for now","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4017-angryicecream","name":"angryicecream","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-13T20:42:51-07:00","id":1206776,"title":"","content":"(Laughter, Diane)<br /> <br /> Ignoring the wave of darkness, Thryme presses towards the waving sphere, as she stands before the sphere, before leaning over and whispering something undecipherable into the ear that melds forth from its surface. The sphere then smelts back, like a cloth curtain, revealing a baroque machine, a relic of a bygone age; a titan of the battlefield, a Warstrider....Or it would be. This one now seems to be a piece of junk, ill-kept and covered in dust.<br /> &quot;I suppose it has been some time,&quot; Thryme admitted, as the shadow that fell over the room darkened.<br /> &quot;I smell fresh blood. Fresh blood of the Sun. I'd love to drench my tongue in your ichor,&quot; it crooned, as a figure came into view.<br /> <br /> What you do?<br /> <br /> (Lessons)<br /> <br /> &quot;So, this Makkaku, what is he capable of?&quot; Wulf asked, as Nova brightened.<br /> &quot;Ah, he's a pinnacle of engineering! A beauty of hunter-killer technology, able to sniff out essence and then wields a ingenious weapon I'm calling the Preta Scourge.&quot;<br /> &quot;Oh? And what does that do?&quot; Wulf asked.<br /> Nova 's echoing cackle resounded out of the plaza,&quot; If we find a victim of it, then I'll explain.&quot;<br /> <br /> Oh, dear, that sounds serious. What will you do now?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-17T22:06:07-07:00","id":1208321,"title":"","content":"&quot;More dead things, then?&quot; Laughter asks, looking for the source of the voice and placing a hand on the hilt of his saber","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4017-angryicecream","name":"angryicecream","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-24T22:40:44-07:00","id":1211301,"title":"","content":"(Diane, Laughter)<br /> <br /> &quot;Your guess is as good as mine,&quot; Thryme muttered, as the figure vanished, reappearing right before the group as a trio of figures, before this group vanished, and the cackling resounded across the The air whistled around you all, as Essen whimpered.<br /> <br /> &quot;There's a bug in here, slicing through the air, she hissed, as Thryme narrowed her eyes.<br /> <br /> &quot;Curious,&quot; she muttered, as the cackling grew to anger. Clearly something wasn't going as planned. However, just as Thryme muttered her quip, the air howled again, and a red blossom of ichor bloomed as her right arm vanished in a cloud of blood. Collapsing to one knee, she let out a keening yell, as the figure appeared before you. A tall, well-muscled facsimile of a man stood before you, clenching the lost arm as he greedily sucked on it. Evil intelligence burned in his dull eyes as he slowly studied the group, before spitting the llimb to the ground.<br /> <br /> &quot;Foul stuff, that. Bestial copper-tasting blood of animals is no good! I want sweet blood! You all! Slit your wrists for me this instant!&quot; he demanded.<br /> <br /> Well, what will you do?<br /> <br /> (Lessons)<br /> <br /> As Lessons continues his ever-present silent and rather contemplative vigil, a squawking can be heard in the plaza, as a new voice is heard between the trio.<br /> <br /> &quot;Nova, Wulf. I will be heading to your present location. I will inspect your present work and progress,&quot; a stern female voice growled, as Nova coughed.<br /> <br /> &quot;Madame Tyrant, there's not been enough time! Besides, we're having...issues. Some of our workers are being attacked by some...interlopers,&quot; Nova explained.<br /> <br /> &quot;Is it that androgynous bravo with the evil starblade, and those...cheese knives?&quot; she demanded, as Nova laughed nervously.<br /> <br /> &quot;No, nothing like that. These are a new group. I have not seen them, but apparently they erased an entire work area.&quot;<br /> <br /> The Tyrant clucked her tongue, before responding,&quot; I see. As stated, I will be arriving in an hour. Be prepared for my arrival, and we shall take care of these pests. By the glory of the Obsidian Pyramids.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;...By the Glory of the Obsidian Pyramids,&quot; Nova and Wulf echoed, not entirely enthusiastically.<br /> <br /> &quot;By the Gods and the Lords of Black Midnight, she's coming here?&quot; Wulf asked incredulously.<br /> <br /> &quot;I just hope she's in a better mood than before. Last time something like this happened, M'Lady Tyrant got put into her...present predicament,&quot; Nova replied with a nervous chuckle.<br /> <br /> Well, that's odd. What will you do now?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-25T12:39:37-07:00","id":1211508,"title":"","content":"Lessons frowns. That didn't sound good. Diane, Laughter and the others were oblivious to the threat coming their way. And what if they got to the ship first... they weren't defenseless, far from it, but most of the Exalted among them were here on this island. He feels torn. He hasn't recovered the heart of the lighthouse yet and if he does not many might suffer. But if he remains without warning the others his friend might suffer for it. The good of the many ought to outweigh that of the few. But in his heart it does not.<br /> <br /> Silently he retreats from the ancient temple, slipping back into the cave system to warn the others of the impending danger. It seems like the time for a retreat had come at last.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1131211-flintys-homebrew-hub-2e\" target=\"_blank\">My Mage 2e Homebrew</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5241-flinty","name":"Flinty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"793"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-26T00:11:10-07:00","id":1211707,"title":"","content":"Am I able to see where he came from? Is the room relatively open? Did he just pop out of the shadows? Any reason not to think there's someone else in here still unseen and this guy is a trap?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4017-angryicecream","name":"angryicecream","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}